 Sprache für das Schreiben agenter Programm mit LLM als Laufzeit","pt":"VVM é uma linguagem de programação para criação de programas agênticos com runtime de LLM","ru":"VVM — язык программирования для создания агентских программ с runtime LLM","ar":"VVM هي لغة برمجة لإنشاء برامج وكيلية بدعم تشغيل LLM"},"features":{"en":["Activates on /vvm-boot, /vvm-compile, /vvm-run, or /vvm-generate commands","Supports .vvm file format for writing agentic programs","Utilizes LLM as the runtime for executing programs","Enables creation of AI-powered workflows","Provides documentation files for understanding VVM syntax and semantics"],"zh":["支持/vvm-boot、/vvm-compile、/vvm-run和/vvm-generate命令","支持.vvm文件的打开和引用","提供VVM语法、语义和模式的支持","可用于创建AI驱动的工作流"],"ja":["/vvm-boot、/vvm-compile、/vvm-run、/vvm-generateコマンドをサポート",".vvmファイルの開きと参照をサポート","VVM構文、セマンティクス、パターンのサポートを提供","AI駆動のワークフローを作成することができる"],"ko":["/vvm-boot, /vvm-compile, /vvm-run, /vvm-generate 명령어 지원",".vvm 파일 열기와 참조 지원","VVM 구문, 의미, 패턴 지원 제공","인공지능 기반 워크플로우 생성 가능"],"es":["Soporte para comandos como /vvm-boot, /vvm-compile, /vvm-run y /vvm-generate","Compatibilidad con archivos .vvm","Capacidad para crear flujos de trabajo impulsados por IA","Uso de LLM como tiempo de ejecución","Sintaxis y semántica de VVM para programas agénticos"],"fr":["Prise en charge des commandes comme /vvm-boot, /vvm-compile, /vvm-run et /vvm-generate","Compatibilité avec les fichiers .vvm","Capacité à créer des flux de travail alimentés par l''IA","Utilisation de LLM comme runtime","Syntaxe et sémantique de VVM pour les programmes agéntiques"],"de":["Unterstützung für Befehle wie /vvm-boot, /vvm-compile, /vvm-run und /vvm-generate","Kompatibilität mit .vvm-Dateien","Fähigkeit, AI-gesteuerte Workflows zu erstellen","Verwendung von LLM als Laufzeit","Syntax und Semantik von VVM für agente Programm"],"pt":["Suporte a runtime de LLM","Criação de programas agênticos","Comandos para inicialização e compilação (/vvm-boot, /vvm-compile)","Suporte a arquivos .vvm","Criação de fluxos de trabalho impulsionados por IA"],"ru":["Поддержка runtime LLM","Создание агентских программ","Команды для инициализации и компиляции (/vvm-boot, /vvm-compile)","Поддержка файлов .vvm","Создание рабочих процессов, управляемых ИИ"],"ar":["دعم تشغيل LLM","إنشاء برامج وكيلية","أوامر لبدء التشغيل والترجمة (/vvm-boot, /vvm-compile)","دعم ملفات .vvm","إنشاء سير عمل مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use vvm","vvm setup guide","vvm alternative","vvm vs other languages","vvm install","what is vvm","vvm documentation","vvm syntax","vvm AI workflows"],"zh":["VVM","AIエージェント","Vibe Virtual Machine","AI工具开发","代理程序","LLM","AI驱动的工作流","VVM语法","VVM语义"],"ja":["VVM","AIエージェント","Vibe Virtual Machine","AIツール開発","エージェントプログラム","LLM","AI駆動のワークフロー","VVM構文","VVMセマンティクス"],"ko":["VVM","인공지능 에이전트","Vibe Virtual Machine","인공지능 툴 개발","에이전트 프로그램","LLM","인공지능 기반 워크플로우","VVM 구문","VVM 의미"],"es":["VVM","Máquina Virtual de Vibe","programas agénticos","LLM","IA","Agente de IA","Herramientas de IA","Desarrollo de software","Lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["VVM","Machine Virtuelle de Vibe","programmes agéntiques","LLM","IA","Agent IA","Outils IA","Développement de logiciels","Langages de programmation"],"de":["VVM","Vibe Virtual Machine","agente Programm","LLM","KI","KI-Agent","KI-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["VVM","Máquina Virtual de Vibe","Linguagem de programação","Programas agênticos","Runtime de LLM","Desenvolvimento de software","IA","Inteligência artificial","Fluxos de trabalho impulsionados por IA"],"ru":["VVM","Виртуальная Машина Вайб","Язык программирования","Агентские программы","Runtime LLM","Разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ","Искусственный интеллект","Рабочие процессы, управляемые ИИ"],"ar":["VVM","آلة افتراضية لمطورين","لغة برمجة","برامج وكيلية","تشغيل LLM","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","سير عمل مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"karanchawla","repo":"vvm","repoPath":"karanchawla/vvm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.643Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vvm","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# VVM Skill\n\nVVM (Vibe Virtual Machine) is a language for writing agentic programs where the LLM acts as the runtime.\n\n---\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n1. User runs `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile`, `/vvm-run`, or `/vvm-generate`\n2. User opens or references a `.vvm` file\n3. User asks about VVM syntax, semantics, or patterns\n4. User wants to create an AI-powered workflow\n\n---\n\n## Documentation Files\n\n| File              | Role                      | When to Read","body":"# VVM Skill\n\nVVM (Vibe Virtual Machine) is a language for writing agentic programs where the LLM acts as the runtime.\n\n---\n\n## When to Activate\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n1. User runs `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile`, `/vvm-run`, or `/vvm-generate`\n2. User opens or references a `.vvm` file\n3. User asks about VVM syntax, semantics, or patterns\n4. User wants to create an AI-powered workflow\n\n---\n\n## Documentation Files\n\n| File              | Role                      | When to Read                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `SKILL.md`        | Quick reference, triggers | Always first                    |\n| `vvm.md`          | Execution semantics       | When running programs           |\n| `spec.md`         | Language specification    | For syntax/validation questions |\n| `memory-spec.md`  | Agent memory (portable)   | When using persistent agents    |\n| `patterns.md`     | Design patterns           | When writing programs           |\n| `antipatterns.md` | Anti-patterns             | When reviewing programs         |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Agent Definition\n\n```vvm\nagent researcher(\n  model=\"sonnet\",\n  prompt=\"thorough, cite sources\",\n  skills=[\"web-search\"],\n  permissions=perm(network=\"allow\", bash=\"deny\"),\n)\n```\n\n### Agent Call\n\n```vvm\nresult = @researcher `Find papers on {topic}.`(topic)\nresult = @researcher `Summarize.`(topic, retry=3, timeout=\"30s\")\n```\n\n### Agent Memory\n\n```vvm\nagent assistant(model=\"sonnet\", prompt=\"Helpful.\", memory={ scope: \"project\", key: \"user:alice\" })\nreply = @assistant `Continue.`(request)  # default: memory_mode=\"continue\"\ndry = @assistant `Read-only run.`(request, memory_mode=\"dry_run\")\nfresh = @assistant `Stateless run.`(request, memory_mode=\"fresh\")\n```\n\n### Semantic Predicate\n\n```vvm\nready = ?`production ready`(code)\n\nif ?`needs more work`(draft):\n  draft = @writer `Improve.`(draft)\n```\n\n### Pattern Matching\n\n```vvm\nmatch result:\n  case ?`high quality`:\n    publish(result)\n  case error(kind=\"timeout\"):\n    result = @backup `Retry.`(request)\n  case error(_):\n    log_error(result)\n  case _:\n    pass\n```\n\n### Choice\n\n```vvm\nchoose analysis by ?`best approach` as choice:\n  option \"quick\":\n    plan = @planner `Minimal plan.`()\n  option \"thorough\":\n    plan = @planner `Full plan.`()\n```\n\n### Control Flow\n\n```vvm\n# If/elif/else\nif condition:\n  do_something()\nelif other:\n  do_other()\nelse:\n  do_default()\n\n# While loop\nwhile not ?`done`(result):\n  result = @worker `Improve.`(result)\n\n# For loop\nfor item in items:\n  process(item)\n```\n\n### Context Passing\n\n```vvm\n# Implicit input (it)\nwith input data:\n  result = @agent `Process.`()  # uses it == data\n\n# Explicit input\nresult = @agent `Process.`(data)\n```\n\n### Functions\n\n```vvm\ndef analyze(topic):\n  research = @researcher `Find info on {topic}.`(topic)\n  return @analyst `Analyze.`(research)\n\nresult = analyze(\"AI safety\")\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```vvm\n# Error values (match)\nmatch result:\n  case error(_):\n    handle_error(result)\n\n# Raised errors (try/except)\ntry:\n  if ?`invalid`(input):\n    raise \"Invalid input\"\nexcept as err:\n  log(err)\nfinally:\n  cleanup()\n```\n\n### Constraints\n\n```vvm\ndraft = @writer `Write report.`(data)\n\nconstrain draft(attempts=3):\n  require ?`has citations`\n  require ?`no hallucinations`\n```\n\n### Imports/Exports\n\n```vvm\n# Skill imports\nimport \"web-search\" from \"github:anthropic/skills\"\n\n# Module value imports (agents are local)\nfrom \"./lib/research.vvm\" import report\n\n# Callable module import\nfrom \"./lib/research.vvm\" import * as research\nresult = research(topic=\"AI\", depth=\"deep\")\nreport = result.report\n\n# Exports (values only)\nexport result\nexport summary\n```\n\n### Standard Library\n\n```vvm\n# Parallel map\nresults = pmap(items, process)\n\n# Sequential map/filter/reduce\nmapped = map(items, transform)\nfiltered = filter(items, predicate)\ndef add(a, b):\n  return a + b\ntotal = reduce(items, add, init=0)\n\n# Iterative refinement\nfinal = refine(initial, max=5, done=is_ready, step=improve)\n\n# Named fan-in\nctx = pack(research, analysis, topic=topic)\n\n# Range\nfor i in range(10):\n  process(i)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Examples\n\n| #   | Name                   | Concepts                |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| 01  | hello-world            | Minimal program         |\n| 02  | simple-agent-call      | Agent with input        |\n| 03  | semantic-predicate     | `?` predicates          |\n| 04  | match-statement        | Pattern matching        |\n| 05  | if-elif-else           | Conditionals            |\n| 06  | while-loop             | While loops             |\n| 07  | for-loop               | For loops               |\n| 08  | with-input             | Context passing         |\n| 09  | agent-options          | retry, timeout, backoff |\n| 10  | code-council           | .with() derived agents  |\n| 11  | parallel-pmap          | Parallel execution      |\n| 12  | functions              | def and return          |\n| 13  | skill-imports          | Skill imports           |\n| 14  | module-imports         | Module imports          |\n| 15  | error-values           | Error value matching    |\n| 16  | try-except-finally     | Raised errors           |\n| 17  | choose-statement       | AI-selected branching   |\n| 18  | constrain-require      | Quality constraints     |\n| 19  | refine-loop            | Iterative improvement   |\n| 20  | collection-helpers     | map, filter, reduce     |\n| 21  | devils-advocate        | Adversarial debate      |\n| 22  | full-research-pipeline | Complex workflow        |\n| 23  | ralph-wiggum-loop      | Continuous improvement  |\n| 24  | agent-memory-basic     | Memory binding + digest/ledger |\n| 25  | agent-memory-modes     | memory_mode: continue/dry_run/fresh |\n| 26  | agent-memory-multi-tenant | Per-key isolation |\n| 27  | agent-memory-parallel-safe | pmap-safe persistence |\n| 28  | ref-composition        | Ref composition patterns |\n| 29  | ref-loop-accumulation  | Accumulating refs in loops |\n| 30  | materializer-pattern   | Materializing refs |\n| 31  | run-inspector          | Inspecting run state |\n| 32  | ouroboros              | Self-modifying workflow |\n| 33  | wisdom-of-crowds       | Ensemble voting |\n| 34  | hydra                  | Multi-headed agents |\n| 35  | forge                  | Agent factory |\n| 36  | inputs                 | Input declarations |\n| 37  | debate                 | Module composition |\n\n---\n\n## Commands\n\n### /vvm-boot\n\nInitialize VVM for new or returning users. Detects existing files and provides onboarding.\n\n### /vvm-compile <file.vvm>\n\nValidate a VVM program without executing. Reports errors and warnings with line numbers.\n\n### /vvm-run <file.vvm>\n\nExecute a VVM program. You become the VVM runtime and execute statements sequentially, spawning subagents for agent calls.\n\n### /vvm-generate <description>\n\nGenerate a VVM program from a natural language description. Analyzes intent, maps to VVM constructs, applies best practices, and produces well-structured code. Asks clarifying questions if the request is ambiguous.\n\n---\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Minimal syntax** - Familiar indentation-based blocks\n2. **Explicit AI boundary** - Agent calls are syntactically distinct (`@agent`)\n3. **Eager execution** - No lazy evaluation, sequential by default\n4. **Semantic control flow** - Branch on meaning, not just booleans\n5. **Two error channels** - Values (match) vs raised (try/except)\n6. **Explicit parallelism** - Only `pmap` runs concurrently\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:44.949Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents needing to write agentic programs with LLM as the runtime, such as those utilizing Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM) for AI-powered workflows.","zh":"适用于需要使用LLM作为运行时环境编写代理程序的高级AI代理，例如使用Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM)进行AI驱动的工作流程。","ja":"LLMをランタイム環境として使用してエージェントプログラムを記述する必要がある高度なAIエージェントに適しています。たとえば、Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM)を使用してAI駆動のワークフローを作成する場合などです。","ko":"LLM을 런타임 환경으로 사용하여 에이전트 프로그램을 작성해야 하는 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어 Vibe Virtual Machine(VVM)을 사용하여 AI 구동 워크플로를 생성하는 경우와 같은 경우입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan escribir programas agenticos con LLM como entorno de ejecución, como aquellos que utilizan Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM) para flujos de trabajo impulsados por IA.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés ayant besoin d''écrire des programmes agenciques avec LLM comme environnement d''exécution, tels que ceux utilisant Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM) pour des flux de travail alimentés par l''IA.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents, die agentiche Programme mit LLM als Laufzeitumgebung schreiben müssen, wie z.B. solche, die Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM) für KI-gesteuerte Workflows verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados que precisam escrever programas agentes com LLM como o tempo de execução, como aqueles que utilizam a Máquina Virtual Vibe (VVM) para fluxos de trabalho com IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым необходимо создавать агентные программы с LLM в качестве среды выполнения, такие как те, которые используют виртуальную машину Vibe (VVM) для рабочих процессов с ИИ.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى كتابة برامج الوكيل مع LLM كبيئة التشغيل، مثل تلك التي تستخدم آلة افتراضية Vibe (VVM) لتدفقات العمل المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create AI-powered workflows by leveraging the Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM) language, supporting specific commands like `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile`, and file formats such as `.vvm`, enabling seamless interaction with LLM as the runtime.","zh":"通过利用Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM)语言，支持特定的命令，如 `/vvm-boot`、`/vvm-compile`，以及文件格式如 `.vvm`，实现与LLM作为运行时环境的无缝交互，从而赋予代理创建AI驱动工作流的能力。","ja":"Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM)言語を利用することで、 `/vvm-boot`、`/vvm-compile`などの特定のコマンドや`.vvm`などのファイル形式をサポートし、LLMをランタイム環境として利用した場合に無縫な相互作用を実現し、エージェントがAI駆動のワークフローを作成する能力を提供します。","ko":"Vibe Virtual Machine(VVM) 언어를 활용하여 `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile`などの 특정 명령어 및 `.vvm`과 같은 파일 형식을 지원함으로써 LLM을 런타임 환경으로 사용하는 경우에 무결점 상호 작용을 구현하여 에이전트가 AI 구동 워크플로를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear flujos de trabajo impulsados por IA aprovechando el lenguaje de Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM), que admite comandos específicos como `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile` y formatos de archivo como `.vvm`, lo que permite una interacción sin problemas con LLM como entorno de ejecución.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des flux de travail alimentés par l''IA en exploitant le langage de Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM), qui prend en charge des commandes spécifiques comme `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile` et des formats de fichier tels que `.vvm`, permettant une interaction transparente avec LLM comme environnement d''exécution.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, KI-gesteuerte Workflows zu erstellen, indem sie die Sprache von Vibe Virtual Machine (VVM) nutzen, die spezifische Befehle wie `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile` und Dateiformate wie `.vvm` unterstützt, was eine nahtlose Interaktion mit LLM als Laufzeitumgebung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar fluxos de trabalho com IA, aproveitando a linguagem da Máquina Virtual Vibe (VVM), com suporte a comandos específicos como `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile` e formatos de arquivo como `.vvm`, permitindo interação sem problemas com LLM como o tempo de execução.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать рабочие процессы с ИИ, используя язык виртуальной машины Vibe (VVM), поддерживающий конкретные команды, такие как `/vvm-boot`, `/vvm-compile` и форматы файлов, такие как `.vvm`, обеспечивая бесшовное взаимодействие с LLM в качестве среды выполнения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء تدفقات عمل مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي من خلال استخدام لغة آلة افتراضية Vibe (VVM)، مع دعم أوامر محددة مثل `/vvm-boot` و `/vvm-compile` وأشكال الملفات مثل `.vvm`، مما يتيح التفاعل الخالي من المشاكل مع LLM كبيئة تشغيل."},"useCases":{"en":["Compiling VVM programs for efficient execution","Generating AI-powered workflows using `.vvm` files","Debugging agentic programs with VVM syntax and semantics"],"zh":["为高效执行而编译VVM程序","使用`.vvm`文件生成AI驱动工作流","使用VVM语法和语义调试代理程序"],"ja":["効率的な実行のためにVVMプログラムをコンパイルする","`.vvm`ファイルを使用してAI駆動のワークフローを生成する","VVMの構文とセマンティクスを使用してエージェントプログラムをデバッグする"],"ko":["효율적인 실행을 위해 VVM 프로그램을 컴파일하는 것",".vvm 파일을 사용하여 AI 구동 워크플로를 생성하는 것","VVM 구문 및 의미론을 사용하여 에이전트 프로그램을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Compilación de programas VVM para una ejecución eficiente","Generación de flujos de trabajo impulsados por IA utilizando archivos `.vvm`","Depuración de programas agenticos con sintaxis y semántica de VVM"],"fr":["Compilation de programmes VVM pour une exécution efficace","Génération de flux de travail alimentés par l''IA en utilisant des fichiers `.vvm`","Débogage de programmes agenciques avec syntaxe et sémantique de VVM"],"de":["Kompilierung von VVM-Programmen für eine effiziente Ausführung","Erstellung von KI-gesteuerten Workflows unter Verwendung von `.vvm`-Dateien","Fehlerbehebung von agencichen Programmen mit VVM-Syntax und -Semantik"],"pt":["Compilar programas VVM para execução eficiente","Gerar fluxos de trabalho com IA usando arquivos `.vvm`","Depurar programas agentes com sintaxe e semântica VVM"],"ru":["Компилировать программы VVM для эффективного выполнения","Генерировать рабочие процессы с ИИ, используя файлы `.vvm`","Отлаживать агентные программы с синтаксисом и семантикой VVM"],"ar":["تجميع برامج VVM لتنفيذ فعال","إنشاء تدفقات عمل مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام ملفات `.vvm`","تصحيح أخطاء برامج الوكيل ذات الصياغة والبنية المنطقية VVM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLM as the runtime environment","Specific to VVM language and `.vvm` file format"],"zh":["需要LLM作为运行时环境","特定于VVM语言和`.vvm`文件格式"],"ja":["LLMをランタイム環境として必要とする","VVM言語と`.vvm`ファイル形式に特有のもの"],"ko":["LLM을 런타임 환경으로 필요로 함","VVM 언어 및 `.vvm` 파일 형식에 특정된 것"],"es":["Requiere LLM como entorno de ejecución","Específico del lenguaje VVM y del formato de archivo `.vvm`"],"fr":["Nécessite LLM comme environnement d''exécution","Spécifique au langage VVM et au format de fichier `.vvm`"],"de":["Benötigt LLM als Laufzeitumgebung","Spezifisch für die VVM-Sprache und das Dateiformat `.vvm`"],"pt":["Exige LLM como o ambiente de execução","Específico para a linguagem VVM e o formato de arquivo `.vvm`"],"ru":["Требует LLM в качестве среды выполнения","Конкретно для языка VVM и формата файла `.vvm`"],"ar":["يتطلب LLM كبيئة تشغيل","محدد للغة VVM وشكل الملف `.vvm`"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"545df9404a3f930fd2f2422674fc2db4c8fc5e2f70d0b7f200f5cfd47f335e0b","qualityScore":54}');
