вание CLI для установки","Проверка установки навыков","Поддержка нескольких агентов","Интеграция со скриптами установки"],"ar":["تثبيت مهارات AgentOps","تحسين كفاءة تدفق عمل DevOps لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخدام CLI لتثبيت","تحقق من تثبيت المهارات","دعمعدة وكلاء","تكامل مع скриптов تثبيت"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use update skill","update skill setup guide","update alternative","update vs agentops","update install bash script","what is update skill"],"zh":["AIエージェント代码更新","update技能","bash脚本","代码更新和验证","AI工具","代码更新最佳实践"],"ja":["AIエージェントのコード更新","updateスキル","bashスクリプト","コードの更新と検証","AIツール","コード更新のベストプラクティス"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 코드 업데이트","update 스킬","bash 스크립트","코드 업데이트와 검증","AI 도구","코드 업데이트 가이드"],"es":["actualización de AgentOps","agentes de código","DevOps","GitHub","Bash","instalación de habilidades","actualización de habilidades","agentes de IA","herramientas de código"],"fr":["mise à jour d''AgentOps","agents de code","DevOps","GitHub","Bash","installation de compétences","mise à jour de compétences","agents d''IA","outils de code"],"de":["Aktualisierung von AgentOps","Code-Agents","DevOps","GitHub","Bash","Installation von Fähigkeiten","Aktualisierung von Fähigkeiten","IA-Agents","Code-Tools"],"pt":["update devops","agentops skills","instalação de skills","devops tools","ferramentas de devops","fluxo de trabalho de devops","cli para instalação","verificação de instalação"],"ru":["update devops","agentops навыки","установка навыков","devops инструменты для ИИ Агентов","инструменты devops","рабочий процесс devops","cli для установки","проверка установки"],"ar":["تحديث devops","مهارات agentops","تثبيت مهارات","أدوات devops لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات devops","تدفق عمل devops","cli لتثبيت","تحقق من التثبيت"]}},"owner":"boshu2","repo":"agentops","repoPath":"boshu2/agentops","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.647Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update","description":"Reinstall all AgentOps skills globally from the latest source. Triggers: update skills, reinstall skills, sync skills.","bodyPreview":"# /update — Reinstall AgentOps Skills\n\n> **Purpose:** One command to pull the latest skills from the repo and install them globally across all agents.\n\n**YOU MUST EXECUTE THIS WORKFLOW. Do not just describe it.**\n\n---\n\n## Execution\n\n### Step 1: Install\n\n```bash\nbash <(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/boshu2/agentops/main/scripts/install.sh)\n```\n\nRun this command. Wait for it to complete.\n\n### Step 2: Verify\n\nConfirm the output shows all skills installed with no failures.\n\nIf any skil","body":"# /update — Reinstall AgentOps Skills\n\n> **Purpose:** One command to pull the latest skills from the repo and install them globally across all agents.\n\n**YOU MUST EXECUTE THIS WORKFLOW. Do not just describe it.**\n\n---\n\n## Execution\n\n### Step 1: Install\n\n```bash\nbash <(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/boshu2/agentops/main/scripts/install.sh)\n```\n\nRun this command. Wait for it to complete.\n\n### Step 2: Verify\n\nConfirm the output shows all skills installed with no failures.\n\nIf any skills failed to install, report which ones failed and suggest re-running the installer. If the failure is isolated to one skill, tell the user to inspect the target agent''s installed skill or plugin directory and restore just that skill from the latest repo copy.\n```bash\n# Retry the full installer:\nbash <(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/boshu2/agentops/main/scripts/install.sh)\n```\n\n### Step 3: Report\n\nTell the user:\n1. How many skills installed successfully\n2. Any failures and how to fix them\n\n## Examples\n\n### Routine skill update\n\n**User says:** `/update`\n\n**What happens:**\n1. Runs the install script to pull the latest skills from the repository and install them globally.\n2. Verifies the output confirms all skills installed with no failures.\n3. Reports the total count of successfully installed skills.\n\n**Result:** All AgentOps skills are updated to the latest version and available globally across all agent sessions.\n\n### Recovering from a partial failure\n\n**User says:** `/update` (after a previous run failed for some skills)\n\n**What happens:**\n1. Re-runs the install script which re-downloads and overwrites all skills from the latest source.\n2. Detects that 2 of 50 skills failed to install and identifies them by name.\n3. Reports the failures and provides manual sync commands as a fallback.\n\n**Result:** 48 skills installed successfully, with clear instructions to retry the installer and recover the 2 failed skills from the latest repo copy if needed.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Problem | Cause | Solution |\n|---------|-------|----------|\n| `curl: command not found` | curl is not installed | Install curl via your package manager |\n| Download fails | Network or GitHub unreachable | Check connectivity; retry |\n| Individual skills fail | Permissions issue in the agent''s install or plugin directory | Fix permissions on the target agent''s install home, then re-run `/update` |\n| Skills not available after install | Agent session not restarted | Restart your agent session |\n| `EACCES: permission denied` | Restrictive permissions on the install target | Fix permissions on the install target, then re-run `/update` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:48.772Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Developers needing streamlined code deployment and updates for their agents","zh":"适合需要简化代码部署和更新的 AI Agent 开发人员","ja":"AI エージェント開発者がエージェントのコードをストリームライン化してデプロイおよび更新する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"AI 에이전트 개발자가 에이전트의 코드를 간소화하여 배포하고 업데이트 하는 데 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Agentes de IA que necesitan una implementación y actualización de código simplificadas para sus agentes","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''agents IA ayant besoin d''un déploiement et de mises à jour de code simplifiés pour leurs agents","de":" Perfekt für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine vereinfachte Code-Bereitstellung und -Aktualisierung für ihre Agenten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que necessitam de implantação e atualização de código otimizadas para seus agentes","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков агентов ИИ, которым необходима оптимизированная развертка и обновление кода для их агентов","ar":"مثالي لمطوري وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر وتحديث رمز مبسط لعمليات وكلائهم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate code deployment, pulling and installing the latest skills globally using GitHub repositories and bash scripts, ensuring consistent and up-to-date capabilities across all agents","zh":"赋予代理人自动化代码部署的能力，使用 GitHub 仓库和 bash 脚本，拉取和安装最新的技能，从而确保所有代理人具备一致且最新的能力","ja":"エージェントにコードのデプロイを自動化する能力を付与し、GitHub リポジトリと bash スクリプトを使用して最新のスキルをプルしてインストールし、すべてのエージェントに一貫した最新の機能を提供","ko":"에이전트가 코드를 자동으로 배포할 수 있도록 해 주며, GitHub 저장소와 bash 스크립트를 사용하여 최신 스킬을 가져와 설치하여 모든 에이전트가 일관되고 최신의 기능을 갖추도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la implementación de código, extrayendo e instalando las últimas habilidades a nivel global utilizando repositorios de GitHub y scripts de bash, garantizando capacidades consistentes y actualizadas en todos los agentes","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le déploiement de code, en extrayant et en installant les dernières compétences à l''échelle mondiale en utilisant des référentiels GitHub et des scripts bash, garantissant des capacités cohérentes et à jour sur tous les agents","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Code-Bereitstellung zu automatisieren, indem sie die neuesten Fähigkeiten weltweit mithilfe von GitHub-Repositorys und bash-Skripten abrufen und installieren, und so konsistente und aktuelle Fähigkeiten auf allen Agenten sicherstellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a implantação de código, baixando e instalando as últimas habilidades globalmente utilizando repositórios GitHub e scripts bash, garantindo capacidades consistentes e atualizadas em todos os agentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать развертку кода, выкачивая и устанавливая последние навыки во всем мире с использованием репозиториев GitHub и скриптов bash, обеспечивая последовательные и обновленные возможности во всех агентах","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير تلقائي لنشر الرمز، عن طريق سحب وتثبيت أحدث المهارات على الصعيد العالمي باستخدام مستودعات GitHub وبرامج bash، مما يضمن القدرات المتسقة والمحدّثة على جميع الوكلاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code updates for AI agents","Deploying new skills across multiple agents","Synchronizing agent capabilities with the latest repository updates"],"zh":["自动化 AI 代理人的代码更新","跨多个代理人部署新技能","同步代理人功能与最新的仓库更新"],"ja":["AI エージェントのコード更新を自動化する","複数のエージェントに新しいスキルをデプロイする","エージェントの機能を最新のリポジトリ更新と同期する"],"ko":["AI 에이전트의 코드를 자동으로 업데이트 하는 것","여러 에이전트에 새로운 스킬을 배포하는 것","에이전트의 기능을 최신 저장소 업데이트와 동기화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de código para agentes de IA","Implementación de nuevas habilidades en varios agentes","Sincronización de capacidades de agentes con las últimas actualizaciones del repositorio"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de code pour les agents IA","Déploiement de nouvelles compétences sur plusieurs agents","Synchronisation des capacités des agents avec les dernières mises à jour du référentiel"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Aktualisierungen für AI-Agenten","Bereitstellung neuer Fähigkeiten auf mehreren Agenten","Synchronisierung der Fähigkeiten von Agenten mit den neuesten Repository-Aktualisierungen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de código para agentes de IA","Implantar novas habilidades em vários agentes","Sincronizar capacidades de agentes com as últimas atualizações de repositório"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений кода для агентов ИИ","Развертка новых навыков на нескольких агентах","Синхронизация возможностей агентов с последними обновлениями репозитория"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات الرمز الآلي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","نشر مهارات جديدة عبر عدة وكلاء","تنظيم قدرات الوكلاء مع أحدث تحديثات المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for GitHub repository pull","Needs execution of bash scripts for installation","Global installation may override local agent customizations"],"zh":["需要互联网访问来拉取 GitHub 仓库","需要执行 bash 脚本来安装","全局安装可能会覆盖本地代理人自定义"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリをプルするためにインターネットへのアクセスが必要","インストールするために bash スクリプトの実行が必要","グローバルインストールによりローカルエージェントのカスタマイズが上書きされる可能性"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소를 가져올 때 인터넷에 접근해야 함","설치하기 위해 bash 스크립트를 실행해야 함","전역 설치는 로컬 에이전트의 사용자 정의를 덮어쓸 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Internet para extraer el repositorio de GitHub","Necesita la ejecución de scripts de bash para la instalación","La instalación global puede anular las personalizaciones locales del agente"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Internet pour extraire le référentiel GitHub","Nécessite l''exécution de scripts bash pour l''installation","L''installation globale peut remplacer les personnalisations locales de l''agent"],"de":["Benötigt Internetzugang, um das GitHub-Repository abzurufen","Benötigt die Ausführung von bash-Skripten für die Installation","Die globale Installation kann lokale Anpassungen des Agents überschreiben"],"pt":["Requer acesso à internet para pull de repositório GitHub","Necessita execução de scripts bash para instalação","Instalação global pode substituir personalizações locais de agente"],"ru":["Требует доступа к интернету для выкачивания репозитория GitHub","Требует выполнения скриптов bash для установки","Глобальная установка может переопределить локальные настройки агента"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت لسحب مستودع GitHub","يتطلب تشغيل برامج bash للتثبيت","التثبيت العالمي قد يلغي التخصيصات المحلية للوكيل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d577aac62c83fce270db900a42b0b5dd129bbc500f882260c735d23fd75b8bfa","qualityScore":54}');
