outil en ligne de commande pour la gestion des référentiels GitHub pour les agents d''IA","de":"gkn-cli ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool für die Verwaltung von GitHub-Repositorys für KI-Agents","pt":"O gkn-cli é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de repositório GitHub para agentes de IA que simplifica operações git comuns.","ru":"gkn-cli - это инструмент управления репозиториями GitHub для ИИ Агентов, который упрощает общие операции git.","ar":"gkn-cli هو أداة لإدارة مستودع جيت هاب للوكلاء الذكية التي تبسط العمليات جيت الشائعة."},"features":{"en":["Initializes config using the `gkn config init` command","Clones repositories into a specified `reposRoot` directory using `gkn clone <url>`","Validates config using the `gkn config validate` command","Supports quickstart repo and skills setup with `gkn quickstart <name>`","Lists repositories using the `gkn` command","Syncs skills workflows using repo selection patterns and global `--json` flags"],"zh":["配置初始化：`gkn config init`","仓库克隆：`gkn clone <url>`","技能同步：`gkn quickstart <name>`","仓库列表：`gkn repo list`","配置验证：`gkn config validate`"],"ja":["構成の初期化：`gkn config init`","リポジトリのクローン：`gkn clone <url>`","スキルの同期：`gkn quickstart <name>`","リポジトリの一覧：`gkn repo list`","構成の検証：`gkn config validate`"],"ko":["설정 초기화：`gkn config init`","저장소 클론：`gkn clone <url>`","스킬 동기화：`gkn quickstart <name>`","저장소 목록：`gkn repo list`","설정 검증：`gkn config validate`"],"es":["Inicialización de configuración con `gkn config init`","Validación de configuración con `gkn config validate`","Clonación de repositorios con `gkn clone <url>`","Lista de repositorios con `gkn repo list`","Sincronización de habilidades con `gkn skills sync`","Soporte para operaciones de git con `--json` y patrones de selección de repositorio"],"fr":["Initialisation de la configuration avec `gkn config init`","Validation de la configuration avec `gkn config validate`","Clonage de référentiels avec `gkn clone <url>`","Liste de référentiels avec `gkn repo list`","Synchronisation des compétences avec `gkn skills sync`","Prise en charge des opérations Git avec `--json` et des modèles de sélection de référentiel"],"de":["Initialisierung der Konfiguration mit `gkn config init`","Validierung der Konfiguration mit `gkn config validate`","Klonen von Repositorys mit `gkn clone <url>`","Auflistung von Repositorys mit `gkn repo list`","Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten mit `gkn skills sync`","Unterstützung von Git-Operationen mit `--json` und Repository-Auswahlmustern"],"pt":["Inicialização de configuração com `gkn config init`","Exibição de configuração com `gkn config show`","Validação de configuração com `gkn config validate`","Criação rápida de repositório e habilidades com `gkn quickstart`","Clonagem de repositório com `gkn clone` ou `gkn repo clone`","Listagem de repositórios"],"ru":["Инициализация конфигурации с `gkn config init`","Отображение конфигурации с `gkn config show`","Валидация конфигурации с `gkn config validate`","Быстрое создание репозитория и навыков с `gkn quickstart`","Клонирование репозитория с `gkn clone` или `gkn repo clone`","Список репозиториев"],"ar":["تثبيت إعدادات مع `gkn config init`","عرض الإعدادات مع `gkn config show`","تحقق من صحة الإعدادات مع `gkn config validate`","إنشاء سريع لمستودع ومهارات مع `gkn quickstart`","استنساخ مستودع مع `gkn clone` أو `gkn repo clone`","قائمة المستودعات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gkn-cli","gkn-cli setup guide","gkn-cli alternative","gkn-cli vs git cli","gkn-cli install","what is gkn-cli","gkn-cli for AI agents","gkn-cli GitHub repository management","gkn-cli config initialization","gkn-cli repository cloning"],"zh":["gkn-cli","GitHub 仓库管理","CLI 工具","AI 代理","Git 操作","配置初始化","仓库克隆","技能同步"],"ja":["gkn-cli","GitHub リポジトリ管理","CLI ツール","AI エージェント","Git 操作","構成の初期化","リポジトリのクローン","スキルの同期"],"ko":["gkn-cli","GitHub 저장소 관리","CLI 도구","AI 에이전트","Git 작업","설정 초기화","저장소 클론","스킬 동기화"],"es":["gkn-cli","agentes de AI","herramientas de línea de comandos","gestión de repositorios de GitHub","operaciones de git","Codex","Claude Code","configuración de gkn-cli","simplificación de operaciones de git"],"fr":["gkn-cli","agents d''IA","outils en ligne de commande","gestion des référentiels GitHub","opérations Git","Codex","Claude Code","configuration de gkn-cli","simplification des opérations Git"],"de":["gkn-cli","KI-Agents","Kommandozeilen-Tools","Verwaltung von GitHub-Repositorys","Git-Operationen","Codex","Claude Code","Konfiguration von gkn-cli","Vereinfachung von Git-Operationen"],"pt":["gkn-cli","agentes de IA","gerenciamento de repositório GitHub","operações git comuns","configuração de repositório","clonagem de repositório","listagem de repositórios","Codex","Claude Code"],"ru":["gkn-cli","ИИ Агенты","управление репозиториями GitHub","общие операции git","конфигурация репозитория","клонирование репозитория","список репозиториев","Codex","Claude Code"],"ar":["gkn-cli","الوكلاء الذكية","إدارة مستودع جيت هاب","عمليات جيت الشائعة","تثبيت إعدادات المستودع","استنساخ مستودع","قائمة المستودعات","كودكس","كلود كود"]}},"owner":"TT-AIXion","repo":"github-kanri","repoPath":"TT-AIXion/github-kanri","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.651Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gkn-cli","description":"Complete command reference and usage guidance for the gkn (github-kanri) CLI. Use when handling gkn repo management, skills sync/verification, config init/show/validate, doctor/version, or when mapping tasks to the correct gkn commands, flags, and examples.","bodyPreview":"# gkn CLI\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to map user goals to exact gkn commands and flags, including global `--json`, repo selection patterns, and skills sync workflows.\n\n## Intent To Command\n\n- Initialize config: `gkn config init` (use `--force` to overwrite).\n- Show config: `gkn config show`.\n- Validate config: `gkn config validate`.\n- Quickstart repo + skills: `gkn quickstart <name> [--public|--private]`.\n- Clone repo into `reposRoot`: `gkn clone <url>` or `gkn repo clone <url>`.\n- List repos:","body":"# gkn CLI\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to map user goals to exact gkn commands and flags, including global `--json`, repo selection patterns, and skills sync workflows.\n\n## Intent To Command\n\n- Initialize config: `gkn config init` (use `--force` to overwrite).\n- Show config: `gkn config show`.\n- Validate config: `gkn config validate`.\n- Quickstart repo + skills: `gkn quickstart <name> [--public|--private]`.\n- Clone repo into `reposRoot`: `gkn clone <url>` or `gkn repo clone <url>`.\n- List repos: `gkn repo list`.\n- Check dirty/clean: `gkn repo status`.\n- Show recent activity: `gkn repo recent --limit n`.\n- Open repo in VS Code: `gkn repo open <pattern> [--pick n]`.\n- Get repo path: `gkn repo path <pattern> [--pick n]`.\n- Show repo info: `gkn repo info <pattern> [--pick n]`.\n- Show oneline log: `gkn repo graph <pattern> [--pick n] [--limit n]`.\n- Run command across repos: `gkn repo exec --cmd \"<command>\"`.\n- Clone or update skills repo: `gkn skills clone [--remote url]`.\n- Sync skills: `gkn skills sync [--mode copy|mirror|link]`.\n- Link skills: `gkn skills link`.\n- Check drift: `gkn skills diff` or `gkn skills status`.\n- Verify match: `gkn skills verify` (exit code `2` on mismatch).\n- Pin skills to ref: `gkn skills pin --target name --ref <commit|tag>`.\n- Clean extras: `gkn skills clean --force`.\n- Watch and auto-sync: `gkn skills watch --interval sec`.\n- Environment check: `gkn doctor`.\n- Show version: `gkn version`.\n\n## Global Behavior\n\n- Use `gkn help`, `gkn -h`, or `gkn --help` to show top-level usage.\n- Use `gkn <group> --help` or `gkn <group> <command> --help` for details.\n- Use global `--json` to emit JSON envelopes (`level`, `message`, `data`).\n- Treat `<pattern>` as substring match on repo name unless it contains `*` or `?` (glob match).\n- Use `--pick n` (1-based) when multiple matches exist.\n- Use `--only` and `--exclude` as repeatable or comma-separated globs.\n- Note `gkn repo open` runs `code <path>` on the selected repo.\n\n## Commands (Complete)\n\n```text\ngkn [--json] <command>\n\ngkn clone <url> [--name repo]\ngkn quickstart <name> [--public|--private]\n\ngkn repo list [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn repo status [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn repo open <pattern> [--pick n]\ngkn repo path <pattern> [--pick n]\ngkn repo recent [--limit n] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn repo info <pattern> [--pick n]\ngkn repo graph <pattern> [--pick n] [--limit n]\ngkn repo clone <url> [--name repo]\ngkn repo exec --cmd \"<command>\" [--parallel n] [--timeout sec] [--require-clean] [--dry-run] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\n\ngkn skills clone [--remote url] [--force]\ngkn skills sync [--target name] [--mode copy|mirror|link] [--force] [--dry-run] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn skills link [--target name] [--force] [--dry-run] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn skills watch [--target name] [--interval sec]\ngkn skills diff [--target name] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn skills verify [--target name] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn skills status [--target name] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\ngkn skills pin --target name --ref <commit|tag> [--force]\ngkn skills clean [--target name] [--force] [--dry-run] [--only glob] [--exclude glob]\n\ngkn config show\ngkn config init [--force]\ngkn config validate\ngkn doctor\ngkn version\n```\n\n## Command Notes\n\n- `clone` is an alias for `repo clone` and clones into `reposRoot`.\n- `repo list` outputs `name path` for each repo; `repo status` reports `clean/dirty`.\n- `repo recent` sorts by last commit time; repos with no commits are flagged.\n- `repo info` shows origin/current/default/dirty; `repo graph` shows oneline log.\n- `repo exec` runs a shell command per repo with optional parallelism, timeout, `--require-clean`, and `--dry-run`.\n- `skills clone` uses `skillsRemote` from config unless `--remote` is provided; pulls if `skillsRoot` already is a git repo.\n- `skills sync` applies configured `syncTargets`; `skills link` forces link mode.\n- `skills diff`/`status` show drift; `skills verify` exits with code `2` on mismatch.\n- `skills pin` requires clean `skillsRoot` unless `--force`.\n- `skills clean` requires `--force` or `conflictPolicy=overwrite` and removes files not in `src` (supports `--dry-run`).\n- `config show/init/validate` operate on `~/.config/github-kanri/config.json`.\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n- `skills verify` returns `2` on mismatch.\n- Most commands return `1` on error and `0` on success.\n- `repo exec` returns `1` if any execution error occurs; `--require-clean` skips dirty repos without failing.\n\n## Examples\n\n```text\ngkn --json repo list\ngkn repo status --only \"foo*\" --exclude \"tmp*\"\ngkn repo open api --pick 2\ngkn repo exec --cmd \"git status -sb\" --parallel 4\ngkn skills sync --mode mirror --dry-run\ngkn skills verify --target skills\ngkn skills clean --force --dry-run\ngkn quickstart my-repo\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:53.429Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Git-based AI Agents seeking streamlined repository management and config initialization.","zh":"适合基于 Git 的 AI 代理，寻求简化存储库管理和配置初始化。","ja":"Git ベースの AI エージェントに適しており、リポジトリ管理とコンフィグ初期化を簡素化する。","ko":"Git 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 저장소 관리 및 구성 초기화를 간소화합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Git que buscan una gestión de repositorio simplificada y una inicialización de configuración.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Git recherchant une gestion de référentiel simplifiée et une initialisation de configuration.","de":"Ideal für Git-basierte KI-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Repository-Verwaltung und Konfigurationsinitialisierung suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Git que buscam gerenciamento de repositório simplificado e inicialização de configuração.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Git, ищущих упрощенное управление репозиторием и инициализацию конфигурации.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى Git الذين يبحثون عن إدارة مخزن مبسطة وتشغيل تكوين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute precise gkn commands and flags, including global --json, repo selection patterns, and skills sync workflows, enhancing their GitHub repository interactions through config initialization, validation, and repository cloning using protocols like git clone.","zh":"赋予代理执行精确的 gkn 命令和标志的能力，包括全局 --json、仓库选择模式和技能同步工作流，通过配置初始化、验证和使用 git clone 等协议的仓库克隆来增强其与 GitHub 仓库的交互。","ja":"エージェントが正確な gkn コマンドとフラグを実行する能力を与え、グローバル --json、リポジトリ選択パターン、スキル同期ワークフローなどを使用し、コンフィグ初期化、検証、git clone などのプロトコルを使用したリポジトリクローンを通じて GitHub リポジトリとのやり取りを強化する。","ko":"에이전트가 정밀한 gkn 명령과 플래그를 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 전역 --json, 저장소 선택 패턴 및 스킬 동기화 워크플로우를 포함하여 git clone과 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 저장소 클로닝, 구성 초기화, 검증을 통해 GitHub 저장소와의 상호 작용을增强합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar comandos gkn precisos y flags, incluyendo global --json, patrones de selección de repositorio y flujos de trabajo de sincronización de habilidades, mejorando sus interacciones con el repositorio de GitHub a través de la inicialización de configuración, validación y clonación de repositorios utilizando protocolos como git clone.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes gkn précises et des flags, y compris global --json, des modèles de sélection de référentiel et des flux de travail de synchronisation de compétences, améliorant leurs interactions avec le référentiel GitHub via l''initialisation de configuration, la validation et le clonage de référentiels en utilisant des protocoles tels que git clone.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, präzise gkn-Befehle und Flags auszuführen, einschließlich global --json, Repository-Auswahlmustern und Fähigkeitssynchronisations-Workflows, und verbessert ihre GitHub-Repository-Interaktionen durch Konfigurationsinitialisierung, Validierung und Repository-Klonen mithilfe von Protokollen wie git clone.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar comandos gkn precisos e flags, incluindo global --json, padrões de seleção de repositório e fluxos de trabalho de sincronização de habilidades, melhorando as interações do repositório GitHub por meio da inicialização de configuração, validação e clonagem de repositório usando protocolos como git clone.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность выполнять точные команды gkn и флаги, включая глобальный --json, шаблоны выбора репозитория и рабочие процессы синхронизации навыков, улучшая взаимодействие с репозиторием GitHub посредством инициализации конфигурации, проверки и клонирования репозитория с использованием протоколов, таких как git clone.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تنفيذ أوامر gkn دقيقة وعلامات، بما في ذلك العلامة العالمية --json ونماذج انتخاب مخزن وعمليات عمل متزامنة للمهارات، مما يعزز تفاعلات مخزن GitHub من خلال تشغيل تكوين التحقق والتحقق من صحة المخزن باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل git clone."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing config for GitHub repositories","Validating and showing config for repository management","Cloning repositories into specified roots for further analysis"],"zh":["为 GitHub 仓库初始化配置","验证和显示配置用于仓库管理","将仓库克隆到指定根目录以进行进一步分析"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリのコンフィグ初期化","コンフィグの検証と表示によるリポジトリ管理","リポジトリを指定されたルートにクローンしてさらに分析する"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소에 대한 구성 초기화","구성 유효성 검사 및 표시를 통한 저장소 관리","추가 분석을 위해 저장소를 지정된 루트에 클로닝"],"es":["Inicialización de configuración para repositorios de GitHub","Validación y visualización de configuración para la gestión de repositorios","Clonación de repositorios en raíces especificadas para un análisis posterior"],"fr":["Initialisation de la configuration pour les référentiels GitHub","Validation et affichage de la configuration pour la gestion de référentiel","Clonage de référentiels dans des racines spécifiées pour une analyse ultérieure"],"de":["Initialisierung der Konfiguration für GitHub-Repositorys","Validierung und Anzeige der Konfiguration für die Repository-Verwaltung","Klonen von Repositorys in angegebenen Wurzeln für eine weitere Analyse"],"pt":["Inicializando config para repositórios GitHub","Validando e mostrando config para gerenciamento de repositório","Clonando repositórios em raízes especificadas para análise posterior"],"ru":["Инициализация конфигурации для репозиториев GitHub","Проверка и отображение конфигурации для управления репозиторием","Клонирование репозиториев в указанные корни для дальнейшего анализа"],"ar":["تشغيل تكوين لمخازن GitHub","التحقق من صحة تكوين وإظهاره لإدارة المخزن","استنساخ مخازن في جذور محددة للتحليل اللاحق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires gkn command-line interface","Git and GitHub repository access needed"],"zh":["需要 gkn 命令行界面","需要 Git 和 GitHub 仓库访问"],"ja":["gkn コマンドラインインターフェイスが必要","Git および GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["gkn 명령줄 인터페이스가 필요합니다.","Git 및 GitHub 저장소 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la interfaz de línea de comandos gkn","Se necesita acceso a Git y GitHub repository"],"fr":["Nécessite l''interface de ligne de commande gkn","L''accès au référentiel Git et GitHub est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt die gkn-Kommandozeilenoberfläche","Zugriff auf Git- und GitHub-Repository erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer interface de linha de comando gkn","Acesso ao repositório Git e GitHub necessário"],"ru":["Требуется командная строка gkn","Необходим доступ к репозиторию Git и GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب واجهة سطر الأوامر gkn","تحتاج الوصول إلى مخزن Git ومخزن GitHub"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4d33936e5ad230cac467e4edc32bd173a31fc236a3ecd223adf61817f8db52fc","qualityScore":54}');
