 uncertainty and inform planning decisions, utilizing a small enumerator script for compatibility with agents like Codex.","zh":"definition.tech_spike 是一种 AI 技能，帮助工程领导者定义技术探索以减少不确定性","ja":"definition.tech_spike は、エンジニアリングリーダーが不確実性を減らすためのスパイクを定義するのに役立つ AI スキルです","ko":"definition.tech_spike 는 엔지니어링 리더가 불확실성을 줄이기 위한 기술 스파이크를 정의하는 데 도움이 되는 AI 기능입니다","es":"Definition.tech_spike es una habilidad de Agente de IA que ayuda a definir picos para reducir la incertidumbre","fr":"Definition.tech_spike est une compétence d''Outil d''IA qui aide à définir des pics pour réduire l''incertitude","de":"Definition.tech_spike ist eine Fähigkeit von KI-Tool, die dabei hilft, Spitzen zu definieren, um die Unsicherheit zu reduzieren","pt":"Definition.tech_spike é uma habilidade de IA que ajuda a definir spikes de tecnologia","ru":"Definition.tech_spike - это навык ИИ, помогающий определять технологические спайки","ar":"definition.tech_spike هو مهارة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد في تعريف النقاط التكنولوجية"},"features":{"en":["Runs with Codex using the `codex skills run` command","Requires a small enumerator script for compatibility","Takes variables such as `topic`, `desired_outcome`, and `constraints`","Helps clarify decisions to be unlocked by the spike","Aligns with timebox and resourcing availability","Gathers related research or prior explorations"],"zh":["支持 Codex 等其他 AI 代理","枚举脚本实现快速集成","减少不确定性，提高规划效率","支持多种变量输入，例如主题、期望结果和约束","提供清晰的预运行检查列表"],"ja":["Codex 等他の AI エージェントをサポート","列挙スクリプトによる迅速な統合","不確実性を減らし、計画の効率を高める","複数の変数入力をサポート（例：トピック、望ましい結果、制約）","明確な事前実行チェックリストを提供"],"ko":["Codex 등 다른 AI 에이전트 지원","열거 스크립트를 통한 빠른 통합","불확실성을 줄이고 계획 효율성을 높임","여러 변수 입력 지원(예: 주제, 원하는 결과, 제약)","명확한事前 실행 체크리스트 제공"],"es":["Implementación de script de enumerador para otros agentes como Codex","Definición de picos para reducir la incertidumbre","Compatibilidad con CLI","Uso de variables como topic, desired_outcome y constraints","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Python"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''un script d''énumérateur pour d''autres agents comme Codex","Définition de pics pour réduire l''incertitude","Compatibilité avec CLI","Utilisation de variables comme topic, desired_outcome et constraints","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme React et Python"],"de":["Implementierung eines Enumerator-Skripts für andere Agenten wie Codex","Definition von Spitzen zur Reduzierung der Unsicherheit","Kompatibilität mit CLI","Verwendung von Variablen wie topic, desired_outcome und constraints","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Python"],"pt":["Suporte à execução de comandos CLI","Integração com o Codex","Definição de spikes de tecnologia","Redução da incerteza em conversas de planejamento","Suporte à variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Поддержка выполнения команд CLI","Интеграция с Codex","Определение технологических спайков","Снижение неопределенности в планировочных разговорах","Поддержка переменных среды"],"ar":["دعم تنفيذ أوامر CLI","التكامل مع Codex","تعريف النقاط التكنولوجية","تقليل عدم اليقين في محادثات التخطيط","دعم متغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use definition.tech_spike","definition.tech_spike setup guide","what is definition.tech_spike","definition.tech_spike alternative","definition.tech_spike vs Codex","install definition.tech_spike","definition.tech_spike for AI agents","running definition.tech_spike with Codex","definition.tech_spike technical requirements"],"zh":["AI 代理技术","definition.tech_spike 集成","Codex 技术文档","减少不确定性","提高规划效率","AI 技能开发","技术探索"],"ja":["AI エージェント技術","definition.tech_spike 統合","Codex 技術文書","不確実性を減らす","計画の効率を高める","AI スキル開発","技術探索"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 기술","definition.tech_spike 통합","Codex 기술 문서","불확실성을 줄이기","계획 효율성을 높이기","AI 기능 개발","기술 스파이크"],"es":["definition.tech_spike","Agente de IA","Herramientas de desarrollo","CLI","React","Python","Variables de configuración","Definición de picos","Reducción de incertidumbre"],"fr":["definition.tech_spike","Outil d''IA","Outils de développement","CLI","React","Python","Variables de configuration","Définition de pics","Réduction de l''incertitude"],"de":["definition.tech_spike","KI-Tool","Entwicklungstools","CLI","React","Python","Konfigurationsvariablen","Definition von Spitzen","Reduzierung der Unsicherheit"],"pt":["definition.tech_spike","Ferramentas de IA","Configuração de spikes de tecnologia","Redução da incerteza","Conversas de planejamento","Codex","CLI","Variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["definition.tech_spike","ИИ Агенты","Настройка технологических спайков","Снижение неопределенности","Планировочные разговоры","Codex","CLI","Переменные среды"],"ar":["definition.tech_spike","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعداد النقاط التكنولوجية","تقليل عدم اليقين","محادثات التخطيط","Codex","CLI","متغيرات البيئة"]}},"owner":"edwardmonteiro","repo":"Aiskillinpractice","repoPath":"edwardmonteiro/Aiskillinpractice","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.657Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"definition.tech_spike","description":"Roles or teams partnering on the spike.","bodyPreview":"# Purpose\nHelp engineering leaders quickly define spikes that reduce uncertainty and feed confidently into planning conversations.\n\n# Pre-run Checklist\n- ✅ Clarify what decision will be unlocked by the spike.\n- ✅ Align on timebox and resourcing availability.\n- ✅ Gather related research or prior explorations.\n\n# Invocation Guidance\n```bash\ncodex skills run definition.tech_spike \\\n  --vars \"topic={{topic}}\" \\\n         \"desired_outcome={{desired_outcome}}\" \\\n         \"constraints={{constraints}}\" \\","body":"# Purpose\nHelp engineering leaders quickly define spikes that reduce uncertainty and feed confidently into planning conversations.\n\n# Pre-run Checklist\n- ✅ Clarify what decision will be unlocked by the spike.\n- ✅ Align on timebox and resourcing availability.\n- ✅ Gather related research or prior explorations.\n\n# Invocation Guidance\n```bash\ncodex skills run definition.tech_spike \\\n  --vars \"topic={{topic}}\" \\\n         \"desired_outcome={{desired_outcome}}\" \\\n         \"constraints={{constraints}}\" \\\n         \"collaborators={{collaborators}}\"\n```\n\n# Recommended Input Attachments\n- Architecture diagrams or RFCs.\n- Known issues or bugs impacting the area.\n\n# Claude Workflow Outline\n1. Summarize context, desired outcome, and constraints.\n2. Define success criteria and explicit questions to answer.\n3. Outline the spike plan with tasks, owners, and deliverables.\n4. Recommend instrumentation or benchmarks to capture results.\n5. Provide guidance for sharing outcomes and converting to stories.\n\n# Output Template\n```\n## Spike Charter — {{topic}}\n### Background\n...\n\n### Questions to Answer\n1. ...\n\n### Success Criteria\n- Criterion:\n\n### Plan & Timebox\n| Task | Owner | Duration | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n\n### Reporting Plan\n- Artifact:\n- Audience:\n- Next Steps:\n```\n\n# Follow-up Actions\n- Create spike tickets in the engineering tracker with links to this output.\n- Schedule readout with the product trio to review learnings.\n- Convert recommendations into backlog work with acceptance criteria.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:59.847Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Planning Agents needing structured spike definition and uncertainty reduction capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化的技术规划代理，能够定义明确的技术难点并减少不确定性的代理。","ja":"テクニカルプランニングエージェントに適しており、構造化されたスパイク定義と不確実性軽減の機能を必要とするエージェントに適しています。","ko":"기술 계획 에이전트에게 적합하며 구조화된 스파이크 정의 및 불확실성 감소 기능을 필요로 하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Planificación Técnica que necesitan una definición de pico estructurada y capacidades de reducción de incertidumbre.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Planification Technique ayant besoin d''une définition de pointe structurée et de capacités de réduction d''incertitude.","de":"Perfekt für technische Planungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Spike-Definition und Fähigkeiten zur Unsicherheitsreduzierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Planejamento Técnico que necessitam de definição de spike estruturada e capacidades de redução de incerteza.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Технических Плановых Агентов, которым необходимы структурированное определение.spike и возможности снижения неопределенности.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التخطيط الفني الذين يحتاجون إلى تعريفات رأسية منظمة وقدرات تقليل الشك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define tech spikes with clarity, utilizing enumerator scripts and integrating with Codex for informed planning conversations, while considering factors like timebox and resourcing availability.","zh":"赋予代理定义技术难点的清晰度，利用枚举器脚本并与Codex集成以进行明智的规划对话，同时考虑时间盒和资源可用性等因素。","ja":"エージェントが技術的なスパイクを明確に定義できるようにし、enumeratorスクリプトを利用し、Codexと統合して情報に基づいた計画対話を行うことができ、タイムボックスやリソースの可用性などの要素も考慮に入れます。","ko":"에이전트가 기술적인 스파이크를 명확하게 정의할 수 있도록 하며, 열거자 스크립트를 사용하고 Codex와 통합하여 정보에 기반한 계획 대화를 할 수 있으며, 시간박스 및 리소스 가용성과 같은 요소를 고려합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir picos técnicos con claridad, utilizando scripts de enumerador y integrándose con Codex para conversaciones de planificación informadas, considerando factores como timebox y disponibilidad de recursos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des pointes techniques avec clarté, en utilisant des scripts d''énumérateur et en s''intégrant à Codex pour des conversations de planification éclairées, en tenant compte de facteurs tels que timebox et disponibilité des ressources.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, technische Spikes mit Klarheit zu definieren, indem sie Enumerator-Skripte verwenden und sich in Codex integrieren, um informierte Planungsgespräche zu führen, unter Berücksichtigung von Faktoren wie Timebox und Ressourcenverfügbarkeit.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir spikes técnicos com clareza, utilizando scripts de enumerador e integrando com Codex para conversas de planejamento informadas, considerando fatores como timebox e disponibilidade de recursos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять технические spikes с ясностью, используя скрипты перечислителя и интегрируя с Codex для информированных планировочных разговоров, учитывая факторы, такие как timebox и доступность ресурсов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تعريف الرؤوس الفنية بوضوح، باستخدام سكريبتات العداد وتكاملها مع Codex من أجل محادثات التخطيط المطلعة، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار العوامل مثل timebox وتوافر الموارد."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining spikes to reduce project uncertainty","Informing planning conversations with clear spike definitions","Aligning engineering teams on spike goals and constraints"],"zh":["定义技术难点以减少项目不确定性","为规划对话提供清晰的技术难点定义","使工程团队在技术难点目标和约束上保持一致"],"ja":["プロジェクトの不確実性を軽減するためのスパイクの定義","計画対話に明確なスパイク定義を提供する","エンジニアリングチームがスパイクの目標と制約に一致するようにする"],"ko":["프로젝트 불확실성을 줄이기 위한 스파이크 정의","계획 대화에 명확한 스파이크 정의를 제공하는 것","엔지니어링 팀이 스파이크 목표 및 제약조건에 일치하도록 하는 것"],"es":["Definir picos para reducir la incertidumbre del proyecto","Informar conversaciones de planificación con definiciones de pico claras","Alinear equipos de ingeniería en objetivos y restricciones de pico"],"fr":["Définir des pointes pour réduire l''incertitude du projet","Informer les conversations de planification avec des définitions de pointe claires","Aligner les équipes d''ingénierie sur les objectifs et les contraintes de pointe"],"de":["Definieren von Spikes, um die Unsicherheit des Projekts zu reduzieren","Informieren von Planungsgesprächen mit klaren Spike-Definitionen","Ausrichten von Ingenieurteams auf Spike-Ziele und -Einschränkungen"],"pt":["Definir spikes para reduzir a incerteza do projeto","Informar conversas de planejamento com definições de spike claras","Alinhar equipes de engenharia em metas e restrições de spike"],"ru":["Определение spikes для снижения неопределенности проекта","Информирование планировочных разговоров с четкими определениями spikes","Согласование инженерных команд по целям и ограничениям spikes"],"ar":["تعريف الرؤوس لتقليل عدم اليقين في المشروع","إعلام محادثات التخطيط مع تعريفات رأسية واضحة","مواءمة فرق الهندسة على أهداف ورؤوس متوافقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Codex integration","Needs a small enumerator script","Dependent on pre-run checklist completion for optimal results"],"zh":["需要与Codex集成","需要一个小的枚举器脚本","需要在运行前检查清单以获得最佳结果"],"ja":["Codexとの統合が必要","小さなenumeratorスクリプトが必要","最適な結果を得るために事前にチェックリストを実行する必要がある"],"ko":["Codex와의 통합이 필요합니다.","작은 열거자 스크립트가 필요합니다.","최적의 결과를 얻기 위해事前に 체크리스트를 실행해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere integración con Codex","Necesita un script de enumerador pequeño","Depende de la finalización de la lista de verificación previa para obtener resultados óptimos"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Codex","A besoin d''un script d''énumérateur de petite taille","Dépend de l''achèvement de la liste de vérification préalable pour obtenir des résultats optimaux"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration mit Codex","Benötigt ein kleines Enumerator-Skript","Hängt von der Vervollständigung der Checklist vor dem Ausführen für optimale Ergebnisse ab"],"pt":["Requer integração com Codex","Necessita de um pequeno script de enumerador","Dependente da conclusão da lista de verificação prévia para resultados ótimos"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Codex","Нуждается в небольшом скрипте перечислителя","Зависит от завершения предварительной контрольной lists для оптимальных результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع Codex","يحتاج إلى سكريبت عداد صغير","يعتمد على استكمال قائمة التحقق المسبقة من أجل نتائج مثالية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a5a01ef70ce02a123d9a0d2ec1f87be7dc45054b8de5c799b338309f7b8c1064","qualityScore":54}');
