g","designsystem-auswahl","ui-design-tools","software-entwicklung","software-ingeneering"],"pt":["ui-architect","design de componentes","estrutura de UI","camadas de produto","sistemas de design","hierarquia de componentes","concerns entre camadas"],"ru":["ui-architect","ИИ Агенты","проектирование компонентов","структура UI","слои продукта","системы дизайна","иерархия компонентов","проблемы между слоями"],"ar":["ui-architect","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصميم المكونات","هيكل الواجهة","طبقات المنتج","أنظمة التصميم","هرمية المكونات","مشاكل بين الطبقات"]}},"owner":"45black","repo":"uk-legal-plugins","repoPath":"45black/uk-legal-plugins","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.661Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-architect","description":"Design component architecture for legaltech UIs - layer separation, data flow, design system selection","bodyPreview":"# ui-architect\n\nDesign component architecture for 45Black legaltech products. This skill helps non-coders plan UI structure, separate product layers, and select appropriate design systems.\n\n## When To Use\n\n- Starting a new UI product or feature\n- Restructuring existing UI architecture\n- Deciding which design system variant to use\n- Planning component hierarchy for apex products\n- Separating concerns between product layers\n- User mentions: \"architect\", \"component structure\", \"layer design\", \"ui p","body":"# ui-architect\n\nDesign component architecture for 45Black legaltech products. This skill helps non-coders plan UI structure, separate product layers, and select appropriate design systems.\n\n## When To Use\n\n- Starting a new UI product or feature\n- Restructuring existing UI architecture\n- Deciding which design system variant to use\n- Planning component hierarchy for apex products\n- Separating concerns between product layers\n- User mentions: \"architect\", \"component structure\", \"layer design\", \"ui planning\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Gather Context\n\nAsk the user about:\n- **Product name** and purpose\n- **Target users** (trustees/clients vs developers/admins)\n- **Usage pattern** (occasional vs 8hr+ daily use)\n- **Data sources** (which apex services: helix, governance, precedent, kestrel)\n- **Key user journeys** (what tasks do users need to complete)\n\n### 2. Select Design System\n\nBased on user answers, recommend design system:\n\n```\nIs this CLIENT-FACING (trustees, advisers, external)?\n├── YES → TRUSTEE EDITION v1.0\n│         • Light-first, Paper White backgrounds\n│         • Inter typography\n│         • Governance Blue primary (#1A4F7A)\n│         • Compliance status colours\n│         • WCAG AAA target\n│         • Print-ready\n│\n└── NO → Is this for 8+ hours DAILY USE?\n    ├── YES → SAVILLE v5.0 CLARITY\n    │         • Matte OFF\n    │         • Hero weight 500\n    │         • Data-dense optimised\n    │\n    └── NO → SAVILLE v5.0 CORE\n              • Matte ON (15% dark, 8% light)\n              • Hero weight 300\n              • Developer/admin aesthetic\n```\n\n### 3. Define Product Layers\n\nFor apex ecosystem products, define these layers:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    PRESENTATION LAYER                        │\n│  Components, Pages, Layouts (React/Next.js)                 │\n│  Design System: [Selected System]                           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                    INTERACTION LAYER                         │\n│  State Management (Zustand), Form Handling (React Hook Form)│\n│  User preferences, UI state, Session management             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                    DATA ACCESS LAYER                         │\n│  React Query hooks, API clients, Data transformation        │\n│  Connects to: apex-helix | apex-governance | apex-precedent │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                    COMPLIANCE LAYER                          │\n│  AI transparency markers, Audit logging, GDPR consent       │\n│  EU AI Act compliance, Hash-chained audit trails            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 4. Map Component Hierarchy\n\nCreate a component tree document:\n\n```markdown\n## Component Hierarchy: [Product Name]\n\n### Layout Components\n- AppShell (header, sidebar, main content)\n- PageLayout (breadcrumbs, title, actions)\n- SplitPane (resizable document/panel views)\n\n### Feature Components\n- [Domain-specific components]\n\n### Shared UI Components (from design system)\n- Buttons, Cards, Badges, Tables, Forms\n- Use shadcn/ui with design system tokens\n\n### Data Components\n- [Product].Provider (context for data)\n- use[Product]Data (React Query hook)\n```\n\n### 5. Define Data Flow\n\nDocument how data moves between layers:\n\n```\nUser Action → Interaction Layer → Data Layer → API Proxy → Backend Service\n                                                              │\n                                                              ▼\nUI Update ← Presentation ← State Update ← Query Invalidation ← Response\n```\n\n### 6. Output Architecture Document\n\nCreate `docs/UI_ARCHITECTURE.md` with:\n\n1. **Design System Selection** - Which system and why\n2. **Layer Diagram** - Visual representation\n3. **Component Hierarchy** - Tree structure\n4. **Data Flow** - Sequence diagrams for key journeys\n5. **Compliance Requirements** - AI transparency, audit, GDPR\n6. **Implementation Notes** - For developers\n\n## Apex Product Layer Matrix\n\nReference for the apex constellation:\n\n| Product | Data Source | Primary Users | Design System | Status |\n|---------|-------------|---------------|---------------|--------|\n| apex-lens | helix, precedent, kestrel | Prospects, trustees | Saville Clarity → migrate to Trustee? | Active |\n| apex-governance | helix | Trustees, advisers | Trustee v1.0 | Active |\n| apex-precedent | precedent DB | Legal researchers | Saville Clarity | Active |\n| apex-tracker | helix | Scheme managers | Trustee v1.0 | Planned |\n| apex-admin | helix (write) | Wills (admin) | Saville Core | Internal |\n\n## Key Architectural Decisions\n\n### API Proxy Pattern (Mandatory)\nAll backend requests go through Next.js API routes:\n- `/api/helix/*` → apex-helix (port 3001)\n- `/api/precedent/*` → apex-precedent (port 3002)\n- `/api/kestrel/*` → apex-kestrel (port 3003)\n\n### AI Transparency (EU AI Act Compliance)\nAll AI-generated content MUST include:\n- \"AI-Generated\" badge\n- \"Generated with Claude | Always verify AI suggestions\" footer\n- Human approval step before any action\n\n### State Management\n- **Server state**: React Query (caching, invalidation)\n- **Client state**: Zustand (UI preferences, local state)\n- **Form state**: React Hook Form + Zod validation\n\n## Example Output\n\n```markdown\n# UI Architecture: apex-lens v2.0\n\n## Design System\n**Trustee Edition v1.0** - Selected because:\n- Primary users are pension trustees (external)\n- Needs print-ready compliance reports\n- Light-first suits office environments\n\n## Component Layers\n\n### Presentation (Trustee Edition)\n├── LegislationViewer\n│   ├── DocumentPane (Merriweather, cream background)\n│   ├── ObligationPanel (cards with status badges)\n│   └── NavigationTree (sidebar with sections)\n├── SearchInterface\n│   ├── SearchBar\n│   ├── FacetedFilters\n│   └── ResultsList\n└── CollectionManager\n    ├── FavouritesList\n    └── CollectionView\n\n### Data Access\n├── useLegislation(id) → /api/helix/acts/{id}\n├── useObligations(sectionId) → /api/helix/obligations\n└── useCaseLaw(query) → /api/precedent/search\n\n### Compliance\n├── AITransparencyBadge\n├── AuditLogProvider\n└── ConsentManager\n```\n\n## Model Preference\n\n**opus** - Architecture decisions require deep reasoning about trade-offs\n\n---\n*Part of 45Black UI Expert Devstack*\n*For non-coders: This skill helps you plan before building*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:05.597Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI component architecture design capabilities for 45Black legaltech products.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI 组件架构设计能力的前端代理，特别是针对 45Black 法律技术产品。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度な UI コンポーネントアーキテクチャ設計能力を必要とする場合に最適です。特に、45Black 法律テック製品に適しています。","ko":"고급 UI 컴포넌트 아키텍처 디자인 능력이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 45Black 법률 기술 제품에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades de diseño avanzadas de arquitectura de componentes de interfaz de usuario para productos legales 45Black.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de conception avancées d''architecture de composants d''interface utilisateur pour les produits legtech 45Black.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte UI-Komponenten-Architektur-Designfähigkeiten für 45Black-Legalsprodukte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design de arquitetura de componentes UI para produtos de legaltech 45Black.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проектирования архитектуры компонентов UI для юридических продуктов 45Black.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصميم هيكل المكونات الواجهة الأمامية لمنتجات التكنولوجيا القانونية 45Black."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design component hierarchies, separate product layers, and select appropriate design systems, utilizing UI structure planning and component architecture for apex products.","zh":"赋予代理设计组件层次结构、分离产品层并选择适当的设计系统的能力，利用 UI 结构规划和组件架构设计顶级产品。","ja":"エージェントがコンポーネントの階層構造を設計し、製品の層を分離し、適切な設計システムを選択する能力を与え、UI 構造計画とコンポーネントアーキテクチャを使用して最高レベルの製品を設計します。","ko":"에이전트가 컴포넌트 계층 구조를 설계하고 제품 계층을 분리하며 적절한 디자인 시스템을 선택할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 UI 구조 계획 및 컴포넌트 아키텍처를 사용하여 최고 수준의 제품을 설계합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para diseñar jerarquías de componentes, separar capas de productos y seleccionar sistemas de diseño adecuados, utilizando la planificación de la estructura de interfaz de usuario y la arquitectura de componentes para productos apex.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour concevoir des hiérarchies de composants, séparer les couches de produits et sélectionner des systèmes de conception appropriés, en utilisant la planification de la structure d''interface utilisateur et l''architecture de composants pour les produits apex.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Komponenten-Hierarchien zu entwerfen, Produkt-Schichten zu trennen und geeignete Design-Systeme auszuwählen, wobei die Planung der Benutzeroberflächen-Struktur und die Komponenten-Architektur für Apex-Produkte verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar hierarquias de componentes, separar camadas de produtos e selecionar sistemas de design apropriados, utilizando planejamento de estrutura UI e arquitetura de componentes para produtos apex.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать иерархии компонентов, разделять слои продукции и выбирать подходящие системы дизайна, используя планирование структуры UI и архитектуру компонентов для продуктов apex.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم هرمية المكونات، وفصل طبقات المنتجات، واختيار أنظمة التصميم المناسبة، باستخدام تخطيط هيكل الواجهة الأمامية وهيكل المكونات للمنتجات Apex."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing component architecture for new UI products","Restructuring existing UI architecture","Planning component hierarchy for apex products"],"zh":["为新 UI 产品设计组件架构","现有 UI 架构的重构","为顶级产品规划组件层次结构"],"ja":["新しい UI 製品のコンポーネントアーキテクチャの設計","既存の UI アーキテクチャのリファクタリング","トップレベルの製品のコンポーネント階層構造の計画"],"ko":["새로운 UI 제품의 컴포넌트 아키텍처 설계","既存의 UI 아키텍처의 리팩토링","최상급 제품의 컴포넌트 계층 구조 계획"],"es":["Diseñar la arquitectura de componentes para nuevos productos de interfaz de usuario","Reestructurar la arquitectura de interfaz de usuario existente","Planificar la jerarquía de componentes para productos apex"],"fr":["Concevoir l''architecture de composants pour de nouveaux produits d''interface utilisateur","Réorganiser l''architecture d''interface utilisateur existante","Planifier la hiérarchie de composants pour les produits apex"],"de":["Komponenten-Architektur für neue Benutzeroberflächen-Produkte entwerfen","Bestehende Benutzeroberflächen-Architektur neu strukturieren","Komponenten-Hierarchie für Apex-Produkte planen"],"pt":["Projeto de arquitetura de componentes para novos produtos UI","Reestruturação da arquitetura UI existente","Planejamento da hierarquia de componentes para produtos apex"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектуры компонентов для новых продуктов UI","Перестройка существующей архитектуры UI","Планирование иерархии компонентов для продуктов apex"],"ar":["تصميم هيكل المكونات για منتجات الواجهة الأمامية الجديدة","إعادة هيكلة هيكل الواجهة الأمامية الحالي","تخطيط هرمية المكونات للمنتجات Apex"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of 45Black legaltech products","Limited to UI architecture design"],"zh":["需要了解 45Black 法律技术产品","仅限 UI 架构设计"],"ja":["45Black 法律テック製品の知識が必要","UI アーキテクチャ設計のみ"],"ko":["45Black 법률 기술 제품에 대한 지식이 필요","UI 아키텍처 디자인만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los productos legales 45Black","Limitado al diseño de arquitectura de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur les produits legtech 45Black","Limité à la conception d''architecture d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über 45Black-Legalsprodukte","Begrenzt auf die Gestaltung der Benutzeroberflächen-Architektur"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos produtos de legaltech 45Black","Limitado ao design de arquitetura UI"],"ru":["Требует знания продуктов юридической технологии 45Black","Ограничен проектированием архитектуры UI"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة منتجات التكنولوجيا القانونية 45Black","محدود بتصميم هيكل الواجهة الأمامية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"720a0dabd4322f652b92184c603724d78fbc82661be3234157e0684c97e9820f","qualityScore":54}');
