INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kidow/dongwook.kim/deepwiki', 'deepwiki', 'kidow', 'dongwook.kim', 'community', 'deepwiki kidow dongwook.kim community deepwiki is a tool for developers to query public GitHub repositories from the terminal. It provides access to table of contents, full wiki content, and AI-powered Q&A. DeepWiki Node.js DeepWiki Node.js DeepWiki Node.js deepwiki es una herramienta que permite consultar la documentación de repositorios GitHub públicos desde la terminal mediante comandos como toc, wiki y ask deepwiki est un outil qui permet d''interroger la documentation des dépôts GitHub publics depuis le terminal via des commandes comme toc, wiki et ask deepwiki ist ein Tool, das den Zugriff auf die Dokumentation öffentlicher GitHub-Repositorys über die Terminal mittels Befehlen wie toc, wiki und ask ermöglicht O DeepWiki é uma ferramenta de consulta de repositórios GitHub que permite acessar documentos de repositórios públicos via terminal com Node.js. DeepWiki — это инструмент запроса репозиториев GitHub, который позволяет получить доступ к документам из публичных репозиториев через терминал с помощью Node.js. ديبويكي هو أداة للاستعلام عن مستودعات جيثب التي تمكن الوصول إلى مستندات المستودعات العامة عبر الطرفية باستخدام نود.جس how to use deepwiki what is deepwiki deepwiki alternative deepwiki vs git wiki deepwiki install deepwiki setup guide github repository query nodejs github integration ai powered q&a for github DeepWiki AI Node.js GitHub toc wiki ask AI Generates table of contents for GitHub repositories using `npx @seflless/deepwiki toc <owner/repo>` Retrieves full wiki content from GitHub repositories using `npx @seflless/deepwiki wiki <owner/repo>` Provides AI-powered Q&A for GitHub repositories using `npx @seflless/deepwiki ask <owner/repo> "<question>"` Supports multiple repository queries using `npx @seflless/deepwiki ask <repo1> <repo2> "<question>"` Assumes Node.js installation for seamless execution Utilizes GitHub repository data for accurate query results deepwiki is a Node.js-based tool that allows developers to query public GitHub repositories from the terminal via commands like `toc`, `wiki`, and `ask`');
