s","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI) für Entwickler","Integration mit React, Python und Node.js","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit AI-Tools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de Agentes de IA via CLI","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de trabalho personalizadas","Suporte a automação de tarefas","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Управление ИИ Агентами через CLI","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Разработка индивидуальных приложений для работы","Поддержка автоматизации задач","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["إدارة الوكيل الذكي عبر سطر الأوامر","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","تطوير تطبيقات العمل المخصصة","دعم آلي لتنفيذ المهام","واجهة مستخدم بديهية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理工作","Agent Skills Registry","CLI工具","AI代理管理","AI代理部署","开发效率提升","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理工作原理"],"ja":["AIエージェントの仕事","Agent Skills Registry","CLIツール","AIエージェントの管理","AIエージェントのデプロイ","開発効率の向上","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの仕組み"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 작업","Agent Skills Registry","CLI 도구","AI 에이전트 관리","AI 에이전트 배포","개발 효율성 향상","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 원리"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es un agente de trabajo","alternativas a herramientas de AI","herramientas de AI vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de AI","guía de configuración de herramientas de AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent de travail","alternatives aux outils IA","outils IA vs concurrents","installation d''outils IA","guide de configuration d''outils IA"],"de":["wie man AI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Arbeitsagent","Alternativen zu AI-Tools","AI-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von AI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für AI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é agente de ia","agente de ia vs robô","instalar agente de ia","guias de configuração de agente de ia","alternativas de agente de ia"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент vs робот","установить ИИ Агент","руководства по настройке ИИ Агента","альтернативы ИИ Агента"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام الوكيل الذكي","ما هو الوكيل الذكي","الوكيل الذكي مقابل الروبوت","تثبيت الوكيل الذكي","دليل إعداد الوكيل الذكي","بديل الوكيل الذكي"]}},"owner":"skilluse","repo":"skilluse","repoPath":"skilluse/skilluse","stars":40,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-01-23T23:12:55Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"work","description":"Work incrementally on Issues with Git worktree support for parallel agent workflows. Use when starting a coding session, continuing work, or running parallel agents.","bodyPreview":"# Work - Incremental Implementation\n\nMake incremental progress on Issues, leaving clean state for next session.\n\nBased on [Anthropic''s Coding Agent pattern](https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents).\n\n## Arguments\n\nThis skill accepts an optional issue path:\n```\n/work [issue-path]\n```\n\nExamples:\n- `/work` - Continue work on current issue from Epic progress.md\n- `/work issues/20251227-task05-config-store` - Work on specific issue\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting","body":"# Work - Incremental Implementation\n\nMake incremental progress on Issues, leaving clean state for next session.\n\nBased on [Anthropic''s Coding Agent pattern](https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents).\n\n## Arguments\n\nThis skill accepts an optional issue path:\n```\n/work [issue-path]\n```\n\nExamples:\n- `/work` - Continue work on current issue from Epic progress.md\n- `/work issues/20251227-task05-config-store` - Work on specific issue\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Starting a new coding session\n- User says \"continue\", \"work on issue\", \"next feature\"\n- Running AI agents on parallel issues (via worktrees)\n\n## Session Workflow\n\n```\n1. GET BEARINGS        →  pwd, git worktree list, cat epics/*/progress.md\n       ↓\n2. READ ISSUE          →  Read issue.md and feature.json from issue directory\n       ↓\n3. VERIFY BASELINE     →  Run build/tests, fix any broken state\n       ↓\n4. IMPLEMENT           →  One feature at a time: implement → test → commit\n       ↓\n5. END SESSION         →  Use /commit skill, update Epic progress.md\n```\n\n## Directory Structure\n\n```\nproject/\n├── epics/\n│   ├── cli/\n│   │   ├── epic.md\n│   │   ├── progress.md               # Check here for current work\n│   │   └── references/\n│   └── website/\n│       ├── epic.md\n│       ├── progress.md\n│       └── references/\n└── issues/\n    ├── 20250115-task01-auth-setup/\n    │   ├── issue.md                  # Requirements\n    │   └── feature.json              # Acceptance criteria\n    └── ...\n```\n\n## Reading the Issue\n\nEach issue directory contains:\n- `issue.md` - Requirements, technical details, API design\n- `feature.json` - Testable acceptance criteria with pass/fail status\n\n```bash\n# Read issue to understand the work\ncat issues/ISSUE_ID/issue.md\ncat issues/ISSUE_ID/feature.json\n```\n\n## Core Loop: Implement One Feature\n\n```bash\n# 1. Implement the feature\n# 2. Test end-to-end (browser/HTTP/CLI)\n# 3. Update feature.json: \"passes\": true\n# 4. Use /commit skill to commit changes\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n**DO:**\n- Start every session with \"Get Bearings\"\n- Read issue.md and feature.json before implementing\n- Work on ONE feature at a time\n- Test BEFORE marking `passes: true`\n- Use `/commit` skill for commits (not manual git commit)\n- Update Epic''s progress.md at session end\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- Skip baseline verification\n- Mark features passing without testing\n- Leave half-implemented code\n- Commit without using the commit skill\n\n## Launch Agent in New Terminal\n\nWhen user says \"work on [issue]\" with a specific issue, open a new Ghostty terminal and run the agent there:\n\n```bash\n# Get current directory first\nPROJ_DIR=$(pwd)\n\n# Open Ghostty and run claude agent in that directory\nopen -a Ghostty --args -e zsh -lc \"cd $PROJ_DIR && claude --dangerously-skip-permissions\"\n```\n\nThis allows:\n- Running an autonomous agent in a separate terminal\n- Continuing work in the current terminal\n- Agent runs with full permissions for unattended operation\n\n## Parallel Development (Worktrees)\n\nUse Git worktrees to run agents on separate issues in parallel:\n\n```bash\n# Create worktree for agent\ngit worktree add ../project-task02 -b task02\ncd ../project-task02\nclaude --print \"Complete task02 per issue.md\"\n\n# Continue your work in main repo\ncd ../project\n```\n\nSee: [worktree-commands.md](references/worktree-commands.md) | [parallel-agents.md](references/parallel-agents.md)\n\n## Handling Issues\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Broken baseline | Fix FIRST, then new work |\n| Blocked by dependency | Document, switch issue or end session |\n| Feature fails testing | Keep `passes: false`, fix and re-test |\n\n## Progress File Format\n\nUpdate the Epic''s `progress.md`:\n\n```markdown\n#### [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] Session #N\n- Working on: task02-auth\n- Completed: F001, F002\n- In progress: F003\n- Commits: abc123, def456\n- Notes:\n  - Brief description of what was done\n  - Any important decisions or changes\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:30:23.592Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents needing incremental progress on issues with clean state management.","zh":"适合需要在问题上进行增量进展并保持清洁状态管理的编码代理。","ja":"クリーンな状態管理で問題に対してインクリメンタルに進捗を遂げる必要があるコーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"클린 상태 관리로 문제에 대해 점진적으로 진행을 필요로 하는 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación que necesitan progreso incremental en problemas con gestión de estado limpia.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage nécessitant une progression incrémentale sur les problèmes avec une gestion d''état propre.","de":"Perfekt für Codierungsagenten, die inkrementellen Fortschritt bei Problemen mit sauberer Zustandsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação que necessitam de progresso incremental em problemas com gerenciamento de estado limpo.","ru":"Идеально для Кодировочных Агентов, которым требуется инкрементный прогресс по вопросам с чистым управлением состоянием.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البرمجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى التقدم التكراري في القضايا بإدارة حالة نظيفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to make incremental progress on issues using Anthropic''s Coding Agent pattern, leaving a clean state for the next session and supporting issue paths for targeted work.","zh":"赋予代理使用Anthropic的编码代理模式在问题上进行增量进展的能力，并为下一个会话留下干净的状态，同时支持针对特定工作的问题路径。","ja":"Anthropicのコーディングエージェントパターンを使用して、エージェントが問題に対してインクリメンタルに進捗を遂げ、次のセッションのためにクリーンな状態を残し、ターゲットワークのための問題パスをサポートする能力を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Anthropic의 코딩 에이전트 패턴을 사용하여 문제에 대해 점진적으로 진행을 하며 다음 세션을 위해 깨끗한 상태를 남기고 목표 작업을 위한 문제 경로를 지원하는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para realizar progreso incremental en problemas utilizando el patrón de agente de codificación de Anthropic, dejando un estado limpio para la próxima sesión y admitiendo rutas de problemas para trabajo dirigido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser une progression incrémentale sur les problèmes en utilisant le modèle d''agent de codage d''Anthropic, laissant un état propre pour la prochaine session et prenant en charge les chemins de problèmes pour un travail ciblé.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, inkrementellen Fortschritt bei Problemen unter Verwendung des Codierungsagenten-Musters von Anthropic zu machen, wobei ein sauberer Zustand für die nächste Sitzung hinterlassen wird und Problemwege für gezielte Arbeit unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fazer progresso incremental em problemas usando o padrão de Agente de Codificação da Anthropic, deixando um estado limpo para a próxima sessão e suportando caminhos de problema para trabalho direcionado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью делать инкрементный прогресс по вопросам, используя шаблон Кодировочного Агента от Anthropic, оставляя чистое состояние для следующей сессии и поддерживая пути вопросов для целенаправленной работы.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إحراز تقدم تكراري في القضايا باستخدام نمط وكيل الترميز من Anthropic ، وتترك حالة نظيفة للجلسة التالية ودعم مسارات المشكلة للعمل المستهدف."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing work on current issues from Epic progress.md","Working on specific issues via issue paths","Managing issue progress with clean state for collaboration"],"zh":["从Epic进度.md继续处理当前问题","通过问题路径处理特定问题","使用干净的状态管理问题进度以便于协作"],"ja":["Epic進度.mdから現在の問題を継続して作業する","問題パスを介して特定の問題に作業する","クリーンな状態管理を使用して問題の進捗を管理し、コラボレーションを支援する"],"ko":["Epic 진행.md에서 현재 문제를 계속 작업하는 것","문제 경로를 통해 특정 문제에 작업하는 것","클린 상태 관리를 사용하여 문제 진행을 관리하고 협력을 지원하는 것"],"es":["Continuar el trabajo en problemas actuales desde Epic progress.md","Trabajar en problemas específicos a través de rutas de problemas","Gestionar el progreso de problemas con estado limpio para la colaboración"],"fr":["Continuer le travail sur les problèmes actuels à partir d''Epic progress.md","Travailler sur des problèmes spécifiques via des chemins de problèmes","Gérer la progression des problèmes avec un état propre pour la collaboration"],"de":["Weiterarbeiten an aktuellen Problemen von Epic progress.md","Arbeiten an bestimmten Problemen über Problemwege","Verwalten des Problemfortschritts mit sauberem Zustand für die Zusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Continuar trabalho nos problemas atuais a partir do progresso Epic progress.md","Trabalhar em problemas específicos via caminhos de problema","Gerenciar progresso de problema com estado limpo para colaboração"],"ru":["Продолжить работу над текущими проблемами из Epic progress.md","Работать над конкретными проблемами через пути проблемы","Управлять прогрессом проблемы с чистым состоянием для сотрудничества"],"ar":["استكمال العمل على القضايا الحالية من Epic progress.md","العمل على قضايا محددة من خلال مسارات المشكلة","إدارة تقدم المشكلة بحالة نظيفة للتعاون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to issue paths and Epic progress.md","Dependent on Anthropic''s Coding Agent pattern implementation"],"zh":["需要访问问题路径和Epic进度.md","依赖于Anthropic的编码代理模式实现"],"ja":["問題パスとEpic進度.mdへのアクセスが必要","Anthropicのコーディングエージェントパターンの実装に依存する"],"ko":["문제 경로와 Epic 진행.md에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Anthropic의 코딩 에이전트 패턴 구현에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a rutas de problemas y Epic progress.md","Dependiente de la implementación del patrón de agente de codificación de Anthropic"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux chemins de problèmes et à Epic progress.md","Dépend de la mise en œuvre du modèle d''agent de codage d''Anthropic"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Problemwege und Epic progress.md","Abhängig von der Implementierung des Codierungsagenten-Musters von Anthropic"],"pt":["Requer acesso a caminhos de problema e Epic progress.md","Dependente da implementação do padrão de Agente de Codificação da Anthropic"],"ru":["Требует доступа к путям проблемы и Epic progress.md","Зависит от реализации шаблона Кодировочного Агента от Anthropic"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مسارات المشكلة و Epic progress.md","يعتمد على تنفيذ نمط وكيل الترميز من Anthropic"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"03d5ad36a3c9ab8153c61c31db3f84ec9adad111eeed017812d4891b043c7300","qualityScore":54}');
