50개 이상의 엔터프라이즈 도구","25개 이상의 전문 에이전트","A2A/MCP 오케스트레이션","확장 가능한 AI 시스템","금융 지능","RAG 파이프라인"],"es":["50+ herramientas empresariales","25+ agentes especializados","Inteligencia financiera avanzada","Gobernanza segura","Orquestación A2A/MCP"],"fr":["50+ outils d''entreprise","25+ agents spécialisés","Intelligence financière avancée","Gouvernance sécurisée","Orchestration A2A/MCP"],"de":["50+ Unternehmens-Tools","25+ spezialisierte Agenten","Erweiterte Finanzintelligenz","Sicherheitsgovernance","A2A/MCP-Orchestrierung"],"pt":["Framework de multi-agente para sistemas de IA escaláveis","Ferramentas de inteligência financeira e governança segura","Suporte a pipelines RAG e observabilidade","Integração com ACP Openclaw, Gemini CLI e Opencode","Desenvolvimento com React, NextJS e Node.js"],"ru":["Фреймворк для многоагентных систем ИИ, масштабируемых","Инструменты финансовой разведки и безопасного управления","Поддержка конвейеров RAG и наблюдаемости","Интеграция с ACP Openclaw, Gemini CLI и Opencode","Разработка с использованием React, NextJS и Node.js"],"ar":["إطار عمل متعدد الوكلاء لنظم الذكاء الاصطناعي القابلة للتوسيع","أدوات ذكاء مالي وحوكمة آمنة","دعم لمواقف RAG والرصد","التكامل مع ACP Openclaw، Gemini CLI و Opencode","التطوير باستخدام React، NextJS و Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","AgentStack","多智能体框架","企业工具","专业智能体","A2A/MCP编排","可扩展的AI系统","金融智能","RAG管道","如何使用AgentStack","AgentStack安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AgentStack","マルチエージェントフレームワーク","エンタープライズツール","専門エージェント","A2A/MCPオーケストレーション","拡張可能なAIシステム","金融知能","RAGパイプライン","AgentStackの使い方","AgentStackのインストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","AgentStack","다중 에이전트 프레임워크","엔터프라이즈 도구","전문 에이전트","A2A/MCP 오케스트레이션","확장 가능한 AI 시스템","금융 지능","RAG 파이프라인","AgentStack 사용법","AgentStack 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar ai-elements","qué es un agente de IA","ai-elements vs openai","instalación de ai-elements","guía de configuración de ai-elements","desarrollo de agentes de IA","herramientas de inteligencia financiera","gobernanza segura para sistemas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser ai-elements","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","ai-elements vs openai","installation d''ai-elements","guide de configuration d''ai-elements","développement d''agents IA","outils d''intelligence financière","gouvernance sécurisée pour les systèmes IA"],"de":["wie man ai-elements verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","ai-elements vs openai","installation von ai-elements","konfigurationsanleitung für ai-elements","entwicklung von KI-Agenten","tools für finanzintelligenz","sicherheitsgovernance für KI-Systeme"],"pt":["como usar AI Agents","o que são AI Agents","AgentStack alternativa","AgentStack vs OpenAI","instalar AgentStack","guia de configuração do AgentStack","desenvolvimento de AI com React","inteligência financeira com AI"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","AgentStack альтернатива","AgentStack vs OpenAI","установить AgentStack","руководство по настройке AgentStack","разработка ИИ с использованием React","финансовая разведка с ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل AgentStack","AgentStack مقابل OpenAI","تثبيت AgentStack","دليل إعداد AgentStack","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام React","الذكاء المالي مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ssdeanx","repo":"AgentStack","repoPath":"ssdeanx/AgentStack","stars":17,"forks":4,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T10:10:13Z","topics":["a2a","agentic-ai","agents","ai-agents","chatbot","claude-code","copilot","deep-learning","gemini-api","generative-ai","mcp","mcp-server","mcp-tools","nextjs","openai","openclaw","opencode","react","web-scraping","workflows"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-elements","description":"Create new AI chat interface components for the ai-elements library following established composable patterns, shadcn/ui integration, and Vercel AI SDK conventions. Use when creating new components in packages/elements/src or when the user asks to add a new component to ai-elements.","bodyPreview":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted s","body":"# AI Elements\n\n[AI Elements](https://www.npmjs.com/package/ai-elements) is a component library and custom registry built on top of [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) to help you build AI-native applications faster. It provides pre-built components like conversations, messages and more.\n\nInstalling AI Elements is straightforward and can be done in a couple of ways. You can use the dedicated CLI command for the fastest setup, or integrate via the standard shadcn/ui CLI if you''ve already adopted shadcn''s workflow.\n\n\n\n## Quick Start\n\nHere are some basic examples of what you can achieve using components from AI Elements.\n\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore installing AI Elements, make sure your environment meets the following requirements:\n\n- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/download/), version 18 or later\n- A [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) project with the [AI SDK](https://ai-sdk.dev/) installed.\n- [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) installed in your project. If you don''t have it installed, running any install command will automatically install it for you.\n- We also highly recommend using the [AI Gateway](https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway) and adding `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY` to your `env.local` so you don''t have to use an API key from every provider. AI Gateway also gives $5 in usage per month so you can experiment with models. You can obtain an API key [here](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai%2Fapi-keys&title=Get%20your%20AI%20Gateway%20key).\n\n\n\n## Installing Components\n\nYou can install AI Elements components using either the AI Elements CLI or the shadcn/ui CLI. Both achieve the same result: adding the selected component’s code and any needed dependencies to your project.\n\nThe CLI will download the component’s code and integrate it into your project’s directory (usually under your components folder). By default, AI Elements components are added to the `@/components/ai-elements/` directory (or whatever folder you’ve configured in your shadcn components settings).\n\nAfter running the command, you should see a confirmation in your terminal that the files were added. You can then proceed to use the component in your code.\n\n## Usage\n\nOnce an AI Elements component is installed, you can import it and use it in your application like any other React component. The components are added as part of your codebase (not hidden in a library), so the usage feels very natural.\n\n## Example\n\nAfter installing AI Elements components, you can use them in your application like any other React component. For example:\n\n```tsx title=\"conversation.tsx\"\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  Message,\n  MessageContent,\n  MessageResponse,\n} from \"@/components/ai-elements/message\";\nimport { useChat } from \"@ai-sdk/react\";\n\nconst Example = () => {\n  const { messages } = useChat();\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      {messages.map(({ role, parts }, index) => (\n        <Message from={role} key={index}>\n          <MessageContent>\n            {parts.map((part, i) => {\n              switch (part.type) {\n                case \"text\":\n                  return (\n                    <MessageResponse key={`${role}-${i}`}>\n                      {part.text}\n                    </MessageResponse>\n                  );\n              }\n            })}\n          </MessageContent>\n        </Message>\n      ))}\n    </>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default Example;\n```\n\nIn the example above, we import the `Message` component from our AI Elements directory and include it in our JSX. Then, we compose the component with the `MessageContent` and `MessageResponse` subcomponents. You can style or configure the component just as you would if you wrote it yourself – since the code lives in your project, you can even open the component file to see how it works or make custom modifications.\n\n## Extensibility\n\nAll AI Elements components take as many primitive attributes as possible. For example, the `Message` component extends `HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>`, so you can pass any props that a `div` supports. This makes it easy to extend the component with your own styles or functionality.\n\n## Customization\n\n\n\nAfter installation, no additional setup is needed. The component’s styles (Tailwind CSS classes) and scripts are already integrated. You can start interacting with the component in your app immediately.\n\nFor example, if you''d like to remove the rounding on `Message`, you can go to `components/ai-elements/message.tsx` and remove `rounded-lg` as follows:\n\n```tsx title=\"components/ai-elements/message.tsx\" highlight=\"8\"\nexport const MessageContent = ({\n  children,\n  className,\n  ...props\n}: MessageContentProps) => (\n  <div\n    className={cn(\n      \"flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm text-foreground\",\n      \"group-[.is-user]:bg-primary group-[.is-user]:text-primary-foreground group-[.is-user]:px-4 group-[.is-user]:py-3\",\n      className\n    )}\n    {...props}\n  >\n    <div className=\"is-user:dark\">{children}</div>\n  </div>\n);\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n## Why are my components not styled?\n\nMake sure your project is configured correctly for shadcn/ui in Tailwind 4 - this means having a `globals.css` file that imports Tailwind and includes the shadcn/ui base styles.\n\n## I ran the AI Elements CLI but nothing was added to my project\n\nDouble-check that:\n\n- Your current working directory is the root of your project (where `package.json` lives).\n- Your components.json file (if using shadcn-style config) is set up correctly.\n- You’re using the latest version of the AI Elements CLI:\n\n```bash title=\"Terminal\"\nnpx ai-elements@latest\n```\n\nIf all else fails, feel free to open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues).\n\n## Theme switching doesn’t work — my app stays in light mode\n\nEnsure your app is using the same data-theme system that shadcn/ui and AI Elements expect. The default implementation toggles a data-theme attribute on the `<html>` element. Make sure your tailwind.config.js is using class or data- selectors accordingly:\n\n## The component imports fail with “module not found”\n\nCheck the file exists. If it does, make sure your `tsconfig.json` has a proper paths alias for `@/` i.e.\n\n```json title=\"tsconfig.json\"\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"./*\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## My AI coding assistant can''t access AI Elements components\n\n1. Verify your config file syntax is valid JSON.\n2. Check that the file path is correct for your AI tool.\n3. Restart your coding assistant after making changes.\n4. Ensure you have a stable internet connection.\n\n## Still stuck?\n\nIf none of these answers help, open an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements/issues) and someone will be happy to assist.\n\n## Available Components\n\nSee the `references/` folder for detailed documentation on each component.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:18:11.216Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing accelerated AI-native application development with pre-built UI components.","zh":"非常适合需要使用预建 UI 组件进行加速的 AI 本地应用开发的前端代理。","ja":"加速された AI ネイティブ アプリケーション開発に予備構築された UI コンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"사전 구축된 UI 구성 요소를 사용하여 가속된 AI 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan un desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de IA acelerado con componentes de UI preconstruidos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un développement d''applications natifs IA accéléré avec des composants d''interface utilisateur préconstruits.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine beschleunigte Entwicklung von AI-nativen Anwendungen mit vorgefertigten UI-Komponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos nativos de IA acelerado com componentes de UI pré-construídos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуется ускоренное развитие приложений с родной поддержкой ИИ и предварительно созданными компонентами пользовательского интерфейса.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات أصلية ذكية معمقة مع مكونات واجهة المستخدم المسبقة البناء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build conversational interfaces using pre-built components like conversations and messages, leveraging shadcn/ui and AI Elements'' custom registry, while supporting scalable AI systems through A2A/MCP orchestration.","zh":"赋予代理构建对话式接口的能力，使用预建组件如会话和消息，利用 shadcn/ui 和 AI Elements 的自定义注册表，同时通过 A2A/MCP 编排支持可扩展的 AI 系统。","ja":"エージェントが会話インターフェースを構築することを可能にし、会話やメッセージなどの予備構築コンポーネントを使用して shadcn/ui および AI Elements のカスタム レジストリを活用し、A2A/MCP オーケストレーションを介してスケーラブルな AI システムをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 대화형 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있도록 하며, 대화 및 메시지와 같은 사전 구축 구성 요소를 사용하여 shadcn/ui 및 AI Elements의 사용자 정의 레지스트리를 활용하고, A2A/MCP 오케스트레이션을 통해 확장 가능한 AI 시스템을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir interfaces conversacionales utilizando componentes preconstruidos como conversaciones y mensajes, aprovechando shadcn/ui y el registro personalizado de AI Elements, al mismo tiempo que admite sistemas de IA escalables a través de la orquestación A2A/MCP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des interfaces conversationnelles en utilisant des composants préconstruits tels que des conversations et des messages, en exploitant shadcn/ui et le registre personnalisé d''AI Elements, tout en prenant en charge des systèmes d''IA évolutifs via l''orchestration A2A/MCP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konversationelle Schnittstellen mit vordefinierten Komponenten wie Konversationen und Nachrichten zu erstellen, indem sie shadcn/ui und das benutzerdefinierte Register von AI Elements nutzen und dabei skalierbare KI-Systeme über die A2A/MCP-Orchestrierung unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir interfaces conversacionais usando componentes pré-construídos como conversas e mensagens, aproveitando o shadcn/ui e o registro personalizado dos Elementos de IA, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta sistemas de IA escaláveis por meio da orquestração A2A/MCP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать разговорные интерфейсы с использованием предварительно созданных компонентов, таких как разговоры и сообщения, используя shadcn/ui и пользовательский реестр Элементов ИИ, а также поддерживает масштабируемые системы ИИ посредством оркестровки A2A/MCP.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء واجهات محادثات باستخدام مكونات مسبقة البناء مثل المحادثات والرسائل، مستفيدا من shadcn/ui وسجل مخصص لعناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي، مع دعم نظم الذكاء الاصطناعي القابلة للتوسيع من خلال الأوركسترا A2A/MCP."},"useCases":{"en":["Building AI-powered chat applications","Creating customized message interfaces","Developing conversational AI workflows"],"zh":["构建 AI 驱动的聊天应用程序","创建自定义消息接口","开发对话式 AI 工作流"],"ja":["AI駆動のチャットアプリケーションを構築する","カスタマイズされたメッセージインターフェースを作成する","会話式AIワークフローを開発する"],"ko":["AI 구동 채팅 애플리케이션 구축","사용자 지정 메시지 인터페이스 생성","대화형 AI 워크플로 개발"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones de chat impulsadas por IA","Crear interfaces de mensaje personalizadas","Desarrollar flujos de trabajo de IA conversacional"],"fr":["Construire des applications de chat alimentées par l''IA","Créer des interfaces de message personnalisées","Développer des flux de travail d''IA conversationnelle"],"de":["Erstellen von KI-gesteuerten Chat-Anwendungen","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Nachrichtenschnittstellen","Entwickeln von konversationellen KI-Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["Construir aplicações de chat alimentadas por IA","Criar interfaces de mensagens personalizadas","Desenvolver fluxos de trabalho de IA conversacional"],"ru":["Создание приложений чата на основе ИИ","Создание настраиваемых интерфейсов сообщений","Разработка рабочих процессов разговорной ИИ"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات دردشة مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء واجهات رسائل مخصصة","تطوير سير عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires shadcn/ui integration","Dependent on AI Elements'' custom registry"],"zh":["需要 shadcn/ui 集成","依赖于 AI Elements 的自定义注册表"],"ja":["shadcn/ui の統合が必要","AI Elements のカスタム レジストリに依存"],"ko":["shadcn/ui 통합이 필요","AI Elements의 사용자 정의 레지스트리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración de shadcn/ui","Dependiente del registro personalizado de AI Elements"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration de shadcn/ui","Dépend du registre personnalisé d''AI Elements"],"de":["Erfordert eine Integration von shadcn/ui","Abhängig vom benutzerdefinierten Register von AI Elements"],"pt":["Requer integração com shadcn/ui","Dependente do registro personalizado dos Elementos de IA"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с shadcn/ui","Зависит от пользовательского реестра Элементов ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع shadcn/ui","يعتمد على سجل مخصص لعناصر الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7e36e211495cf1ecfa6791c1e91cc53e253375cc5ee939d98656cc5a44d41fda","qualityScore":54}');
