ts d''IA","Mise en œuvre minimaliste","Inspiré de SuperClaude","Compatibilité avec Claude Code","Efficacité dans l''automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Orchestrierung von KI-Agents","Minimalistische Implementierung","Inspiriert von SuperClaude","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Effizienz bei der Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Orquestração de agentes de IA","Inspiração no SuperClaude","Desenvolvido para Claude Code","Arquitetura minimalista","Facilidade de implementação"],"ru":["Оркестрация ИИ Агентов","Вдохновлен SuperClaude","Разработан для Claude Code","Минимальная архитектура","Легкость реализации"],"ar":["توجيه وسيط للوكلاء الذكية","مستوحى من SuperClaude","تم تطويره ل Claude Code","هيكل متواضع","سهولة التنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理实现","Minimalist多代理编排框架","Claude Code","SuperClaude","AI代理工具","如何使用Minimalist","Minimalist教程","AI智能代理比较"],"ja":["AIエージェントの実装","Minimalistマルチエージェントオーケストレーションフレームワーク","Claude Code","SuperClaude","AIエージェントツール","Minimalistの使い方","Minimalistチュートリアル","AIエージェントの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 구현","Minimalist 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크","Claude Code","SuperClaude","AI 에이전트 도구","Minimalist 사용법","Minimalist 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 비교"],"es":["herramientas de agente de ia","cómo usar implement","qué es un agente de ia","implement vs superclaud","guía de instalación de implement","alternativas a implement"],"fr":["outils d''agents d''ia","comment utiliser implement","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''ia","implement vs superclaud","guide d''installation de implement","alternatives à implement"],"de":["ki-agenten-tools","wie man implement verwendet","was ist ein ki-agent","implement vs superclaud","anleitung zur installation von implement","alternativen zu implement"],"pt":["como usar Implement","o que é Implement","Implement vs SuperClaude","guias de instalação do Implement","configuração do Implement","desenvolvimento de agentes de IA com Implement"],"ru":["как использовать Implement","что такое Implement","Implement vs SuperClaude","руководство по установке Implement","настройка Implement","разработка ИИ Агентов с помощью Implement"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Implement","ما هو Implement","Implement مقابل SuperClaude","دليل تثبيت Implement","إعداد Implement","تطوير الوكلاء الذكية باستخدام Implement"]}},"owner":"gudzenkov","repo":"SuperClaudeZero","repoPath":"gudzenkov/SuperClaudeZero","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.765Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement","description":"Implement a task from the backlog with code and tests","bodyPreview":"# /implement - Task Implementation\n\nImplement a specific task from the backlog with production code and tests.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExecute a task by:\n- Understanding the requirement and acceptance criteria\n- Writing production code following existing patterns\n- Creating tests for new functionality\n- Preparing a commit message\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `$ARGUMENTS`: Task ID (e.g., \"T-001\") or task description\n- BACKLOG: `docs/development/BACKLOG.md` for task details\n- Architecture: `docs/architecture/ARCHITECTURE.m","body":"# /implement - Task Implementation\n\nImplement a specific task from the backlog with production code and tests.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExecute a task by:\n- Understanding the requirement and acceptance criteria\n- Writing production code following existing patterns\n- Creating tests for new functionality\n- Preparing a commit message\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `$ARGUMENTS`: Task ID (e.g., \"T-001\") or task description\n- BACKLOG: `docs/development/BACKLOG.md` for task details\n- Architecture: `docs/architecture/ARCHITECTURE.md` for patterns\n- `${PROJECT_NAME}`: Current project context\n\n## Outputs\n\n- Production code in appropriate source files\n- Tests alongside implementation\n- Suggested commit message\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Identify Task\nParse `$ARGUMENTS` to find the task:\n- If task ID provided, look up in BACKLOG.md\n- If description provided, match to existing task or confirm new work\n\n### 2. Read Task Details\nFrom BACKLOG.md, extract:\n- Task description\n- Acceptance criteria\n- Epic context\n- Dependencies (ensure they''re complete)\n\n### 3. Explore Codebase\nBefore writing code:\n- Find related existing code\n- Identify patterns to follow\n- Check for similar implementations\n- Understand the module structure\n\n### 4. Plan Implementation\nOutline the approach:\n- Files to modify/create\n- Functions/classes needed\n- Test approach\n- Edge cases to handle\n\n### 5. Implement\nWrite code following these principles:\n- **Read Before Write**: Understand existing code\n- **Minimal Changes**: Only modify what''s necessary\n- **Follow Patterns**: Match existing style\n- **No Over-Engineering**: Simple solutions preferred\n- **Security Aware**: Avoid common vulnerabilities\n\n### 6. Write Tests\nFor new functionality:\n- Unit tests for core logic\n- Integration tests if crossing boundaries\n- Edge case coverage\n- Follow existing test patterns\n\n### 7. Verify\nCheck against acceptance criteria:\n- [ ] Each AC is met\n- [ ] Tests pass\n- [ ] No regressions\n- [ ] Code follows patterns\n\n### 8. Prepare Commit\nSuggest commit message:\n```\ntype(scope): description\n\n- Detail of change 1\n- Detail of change 2\n\nRefs: T-XXX\n```\n\nTypes: feat, fix, refactor, test, docs, chore\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Code Quality\n- Use descriptive variable/function names\n- Keep functions focused (single responsibility)\n- Add comments only where logic isn''t self-evident\n- Handle errors appropriately\n\n### Testing\n- Test behavior, not implementation\n- One assertion per test when possible\n- Clear test names describing expected behavior\n- Mock external dependencies\n\n### Security\n- Validate inputs at boundaries\n- Escape outputs appropriately\n- No secrets in code\n- Follow OWASP guidelines\n\n## Validation Checklist\nBefore completing:\n- [ ] All acceptance criteria met\n- [ ] Tests written and passing\n- [ ] Code follows existing patterns\n- [ ] No hardcoded secrets or credentials\n- [ ] Commit message prepared\n- [ ] Task ready to mark complete\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf blocked:\n1. Document the blocker clearly\n2. Suggest alternatives if possible\n3. Don''t make assumptions without verification\n4. Consider invoking /analyse for investigation\n\n## Policy References\n\n**Should-read** from `~/.claude/policy/RULES.md`:\n- Implementation Completeness - No partial features, no TODOs\n- Git Workflow - Feature branches, incremental commits\n- Safety Rules - Framework respect, pattern adherence\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:17:18.258Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing task implementation capabilities with production code and tests.","zh":"非常适合需要使用生产代码和测试实现任务的开发代理。","ja":"タスクの実装機能と生産コードおよびテストを必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"생산 코드와 테스트를 사용하여 태스크를 구현해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de implementación de tareas con código de producción y pruebas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin de capacités de mise en œuvre de tâches avec du code de production et des tests.","de":"Perfekt für Development Agents, die Fähigkeiten zur Aufgabenimplementierung mit Produktionscode und Tests benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de implementação de tarefas com código de produção e testes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Разработки Агентов, которым необходимы возможности реализации задач с рабочим кодом и тестами.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تنفيذ المهام باستخدام كود الإنتاج والاختبارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute tasks by understanding requirements, writing production code following existing patterns, creating tests for new functionality, and preparing commit messages using Markdown files like BACKLOG.md and ARCHITECTURE.md.","zh":"使代理能够通过理解需求、按照现有模式编写生产代码、为新功能创建测试以及使用Markdown文件（如BACKLOG.md和ARCHITECTURE.md）准备提交消息来执行任务。","ja":"要求を理解し、既存のパターンに従って生産コードを記述し、新しい機能のテストを作成し、BACKLOG.mdやARCHITECTURE.mdのようなMarkdownファイルを使用してコミットメッセージを準備することで、エージェントがタスクを実行できるようにします。","ko":"요구 사항을 이해하고 기존 패턴에 따라 생산 코드를 작성하며 새로운 기능에 대한 테스트를 만들고 BACKLOG.md 및 ARCHITECTURE.md와 같은 Markdown 파일을 사용하여 커밋 메시지를 준비하여 에이전트가 태스크를 실행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar tareas mediante la comprensión de requisitos, escribiendo código de producción siguiendo patrones existentes, creando pruebas para nuevas funcionalidades y preparando mensajes de commit utilizando archivos Markdown como BACKLOG.md y ARCHITECTURE.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches en comprenant les exigences, en écrivant du code de production suivant les modèles existants, en créant des tests pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités et en préparant les messages de commit à l''aide de fichiers Markdown comme BACKLOG.md et ARCHITECTURE.md.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Aufgaben auszuführen, indem sie Anforderungen verstehen, Produktionscode nach bestehenden Mustern schreiben, Tests für neue Funktionalitäten erstellen und Commit-Messages unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien wie BACKLOG.md und ARCHITECTURE.md vorbereiten.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a executar tarefas através da compreensão dos requisitos, escrita de código de produção seguindo os padrões existentes, criação de testes para novas funcionalidades e preparação de mensagens de commit usando arquivos Markdown como BACKLOG.md e ARCHITECTURE.md.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять задачи путем понимания требований, написания рабочего кода в соответствии с существующими шаблонами, создания тестов для нового функционала и подготовки сообщений коммитов с использованием Markdown файлов, таких как BACKLOG.md и ARCHITECTURE.md.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ المهام من خلال فهم المتطلبات، وكتابة كود الإنتاج باتباع الأنماط الحالية، وإنشاء اختبارات للوظائف الجديدة، وإعداد رسائل الالتزام باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل BACKLOG.md و ARCHITECTURE.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing tasks from the backlog with production code","Creating tests for new functionality","Preparing commit messages for task implementation"],"zh":["使用生产代码实现待办事项中的任务","为新功能创建测试","为任务实现准备提交消息"],"ja":["バックログからタスクを実装し、生産コードを使用する","新しい機能のテストを作成する","タスクの実装のためのコミットメッセージを準備する"],"ko":["생산 코드를 사용하여 백로그에서 태스크를 구현한다","새로운 기능에 대한 테스트를 생성한다","태스크 구현을 위한 커밋 메시지를 준비한다"],"es":["Implementar tareas del backlog con código de producción","Crear pruebas para nuevas funcionalidades","Preparar mensajes de commit para la implementación de tareas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des tâches du backlog avec du code de production","Créer des tests pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Préparer les messages de commit pour la mise en œuvre des tâches"],"de":["Umsetzung von Aufgaben aus dem Backlog mit Produktionscode","Erstellen von Tests für neue Funktionalitäten","Vorbereiten von Commit-Messages für die Aufgabenumsetzung"],"pt":["Implementação de tarefas do backlog com código de produção","Criação de testes para novas funcionalidades","Preparação de mensagens de commit para implementação de tarefas"],"ru":["Реализация задач из бэклога с рабочим кодом","Создание тестов для нового функционала","Подготовка сообщений коммитов для реализации задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ المهام من قائمة الأعمال المعلقة باستخدام كود الإنتاج","إنشاء اختبارات للوظائف الجديدة","إعداد رسائل الالتزام لتنفيذ المهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to BACKLOG.md and ARCHITECTURE.md files","Task ID or description needed as input"],"zh":["需要访问BACKLOG.md和ARCHITECTURE.md文件","需要任务ID或描述作为输入"],"ja":["BACKLOG.mdおよびARCHITECTURE.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","タスクIDまたは説明が入力として必要"],"ko":["BACKLOG.md 및 ARCHITECTURE.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","태스크 ID 또는 설명이 입력으로 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos BACKLOG.md y ARCHITECTURE.md","Se necesita un ID de tarea o una descripción como entrada"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers BACKLOG.md et ARCHITECTURE.md","Un ID de tâche ou une description est nécessaire en entrée"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Dateien BACKLOG.md und ARCHITECTURE.md","Eine Task-ID oder Beschreibung wird als Eingabe benötigt"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos arquivos BACKLOG.md e ARCHITECTURE.md","Necessita de ID da tarefa ou descrição como entrada"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к файлам BACKLOG.md и ARCHITECTURE.md","Необходим идентификатор задачи или ее описание в качестве входных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات BACKLOG.md و ARCHITECTURE.md","يحتاج إلى معرف المهمة أو وصفها كمدخل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"02906511a096cfc8c467b3a29feb6a8ce863e2e56137900fddf62807dd3dc223","qualityScore":54}');
