des commentaires","Intègre CLI pour une plus grande efficacité","Permet la collecte de commentaires sur les PR","Utilise jq pour parser les commentaires","Offre une prévisualisation de la révision de code"],"de":["Verwendet GitHub API, um Kommentare zu sammeln","Integriert CLI für eine höhere Effizienz","Ermöglicht die Kommentarsammlung in PR","Verwendet jq, um Kommentare zu parsen","Bietet eine Vorschau der Code-Überprüfung"],"pt":["Análise de comentários de revisão de PR","Verificação de sugestões antes de aplicá-las","Uso de comandos do GitHub para visualizar PR","Capacidade de categorizar comentários de revisão","Suporte a experimentos de página de destino A/B","Integração com a API do GitHub para obter comentários de PR"],"ru":["Анализ комментариев к ревью PR","Проверка предложений перед их применением","Использование команд GitHub для просмотра PR","Возможность категоризации комментариев к ревью","Поддержка экспериментов с посадочными страницами А/Б для ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с API GitHub для получения комментариев к PR"],"ar":["تحليل تعليقات المراجعة لطلبات السحب","التحقق من الاقتراحات قبل تطبيقها","استخدام أوامر GitHub لعرض طلبات السحب","القدرة على تصنيف تعليقات المراجعة","دعم تجارب صفحة الهبوط A/B باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub لاسترداد تعليقات طلبات السحب"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use address-review","address-review setup guide","what is address-review","address-review alternative","address-review vs optimizely","address-review install for unbound.tools","github pr feedback integration","ab landing page experiment tools"],"zh":["Address Review","AI工具","代码审查","GH API","CLI命令","代码反馈","JQ","JSON数据处理"],"ja":["Address Review","AIエージェント","コードレビュー","GH API","CLIコマンド","コードフィードバック","JQ","JSONデータ処理"],"ko":["Address Review","AI 툴","코드 리뷰","GH API","CLI 명령","코드 피드백","JQ","JSON 데이터 처리"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agent","experimentos de landing page","GitHub API","CLI","revisión de código","desarrollo de software","commentarios en GitHub"],"fr":["outils d''agent IA","expériences de page de destination","GitHub API","CLI","révision de code","développement de logiciels","commentaires sur GitHub"],"de":["AI-Tools","Landingpage-Experimente","GitHub API","CLI","Code-Überprüfung","Software-Entwicklung","Kommentare auf GitHub"],"pt":["address-review","experimentos de página de destino","testes A/B","otimização de página de destino","análise de comentários de revisão","GitHub","API do GitHub","comandos do GitHub","ferramentas de experimentação"],"ru":["address-review","эксперименты с посадочными страницами","тесты А/Б","оптимизация посадочных страниц","анализ комментариев к ревью","GitHub","API GitHub","команды GitHub","инструменты для экспериментов для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["address-review","تجارب صفحة الهبوط","اختبارات A/B","تحسين صفحة الهبوط","تحليل تعليقات المراجعة","GitHub","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","أوامر GitHub","أدوات تجربة لصفحات الهبوط باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"unbound-tools","repo":"landing","repoPath":"unbound-tools/landing","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T17:55:34Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"address-review","description":"Address PR review feedback, verify independently, and re-request review","bodyPreview":"# Address Review Feedback\n\nAddress review comments on PR #$ARGUMENTS. Be adversarial about the feedback itself — verify that suggestions are correct before applying them.\n\n## PR Context\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n```\n!gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments --jq ''.[] | \"---\\n\\(.path):\\(.line // .original_line)\\n\\(.body)\\n\"''\n```\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS --comments\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Gather All Feedback\n\nRead every review comment above. Categorize each piece o","body":"# Address Review Feedback\n\nAddress review comments on PR #$ARGUMENTS. Be adversarial about the feedback itself — verify that suggestions are correct before applying them.\n\n## PR Context\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n```\n!gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments --jq ''.[] | \"---\\n\\(.path):\\(.line // .original_line)\\n\\(.body)\\n\"''\n```\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS --comments\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Gather All Feedback\n\nRead every review comment above. Categorize each piece of feedback:\n\n- **Action Required** — Reviewer flagged as blocking merge\n- **Recommended** — Reviewer suggested addressing before merge\n- **Minor** — Nits, style suggestions\n\n### Step 2: Independently Verify Each Finding\n\n**Do not blindly apply suggestions.** For each piece of feedback:\n\n1. **Read the file in question** — Use Glob/Grep/Read to find the relevant file and understand the full context, not just the diff snippet.\n2. **Assess whether the feedback is correct** — Reviewers (including agent reviewers) can be wrong. Check:\n   - Does the suggested change actually fix the issue identified?\n   - Could the suggestion introduce a new bug or visual regression?\n   - Is the reviewer missing context that makes the current code correct?\n   - Does the suggestion align with project conventions in `AGENTS.md`?\n3. **For visual feedback** — Check out the branch, run `npm run dev`, verify rendering at mobile and desktop widths, check both variants (`/start` and `/build`).\n4. **For security feedback** — Take it seriously by default. Security suggestions should be applied unless you can clearly demonstrate they''re wrong.\n\n### Step 3: Respond to Each Finding\n\nFor each piece of feedback, take one of these actions:\n\n**Apply** — The feedback is correct. Make the change.\n- Edit the file\n- Run `npm run dev` and verify both variants render correctly\n- Note what was changed\n\n**Partially apply** — The core insight is right but the suggested fix isn''t quite right.\n- Implement a better fix that addresses the underlying concern\n- Explain why you deviated from the exact suggestion\n\n**Reject with justification** — The feedback is incorrect or doesn''t apply.\n- Explain clearly why the current code is correct\n- Reference `AGENTS.md` or project conventions to support your reasoning\n- Never reject feedback without a concrete justification\n\n**Escalate** — You''re unsure whether the feedback is valid.\n- Flag it to the human with the evidence for and against\n- Do not guess or silently skip\n\n### Step 4: Run Full Verification\n\nAfter addressing all feedback:\n\n1. **Run `npm run dev`** and verify both variants render correctly at mobile and desktop widths\n2. **Check TypeScript compilation** — `npx wrangler types && npx tsc --noEmit` (Worker-side only)\n3. **Test form submission** if any API or form changes were made\n4. **Spot-check your changes** — Read through your own diff. Did you introduce any new issues while fixing the review feedback?\n5. **Check sizing** — If the fixes significantly expanded the PR, flag whether it should be split.\n\n### Step 5: Commit and Push\n\n- Commit fixes with clear messages linking to the review feedback: `fix: Address review — <description>`\n- Keep fix commits separate from each other when they address unrelated feedback (easier to review the re-review)\n- Push to the PR branch\n\n### Step 6: Post Summary and Re-request Review\n\nPost a comment on the PR summarizing how each finding was addressed, then re-request review:\n\n```\ngh pr comment $ARGUMENTS --body \"<summary>\"\ngh pr edit $ARGUMENTS --add-reviewer <reviewer>\n```\n\nUse this format for the summary:\n\n```markdown\n## Review Feedback Addressed\n\n| # | Finding | Action | Details |\n|---|---------|--------|---------|\n| 1 | <brief description> | Applied / Partially applied / Rejected | <what was done and why> |\n| 2 | ... | ... | ... |\n\n**Visual verification:** Both variants checked at mobile + desktop\n**New commits:** <list of fix commits>\n```\n\nFor any rejected findings, provide the full justification in the Details column so the reviewer can evaluate your reasoning.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:46:35.673Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub-focused Agents needing streamlined feedback management for data-driven projects.","zh":"适合需要简化反馈管理的 GitHub 专注代理，用于数据驱动的项目。","ja":"GitHub に焦点を当てたエージェントが、データ駆動型のプロジェクトのためにフィードバック管理を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"데이터 주도 프로젝트를 위한 피드백 관리를 간소화해야 하는 GitHub 중심 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes centrados en GitHub que necesitan una gestión de comentarios de retroalimentación simplificada para proyectos impulsados por datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur GitHub qui ont besoin d''une gestion de commentaires de rétroaction simplifiée pour les projets axés sur les données.","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-fokussierte Agenten, die eine gestreamte Feedback-Verwaltung für datengetriebene Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados no GitHub que necessitam de uma gestão simplificada de feedback para projetos orientados por dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов, ориентированных на GitHub, которым требуется упрощенное управление обратной связью для проектов, управляемых данными.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء يركزون على GitHub ويحتاجون إلى إدارة مبسطة للتعليقات للمشاريع القائمة على البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently address review comments on GitHub PRs, utilizing !gh pr view and !gh api for comprehensive feedback analysis, and facilitating data-driven decision-making with unbound.tools.","zh":"赋予代理人利用 !gh pr view 和 !gh api 进行综合反馈分析的能力，并通过 unbound.tools 实现数据驱动的决策，从而高效地处理 GitHub PR 的审查评论。","ja":"!gh pr view および !gh api を使用して包括的なフィードバック分析を実行し、unbound.tools を使用してデータドリブンの意思決定を容易にし、GitHub PR のレビューコメントを効率的に処理できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"!gh pr view 및 !gh api를 사용하여 포괄적인 피드백 분석을 수행하고 unbound.tools를 사용하여 데이터 주도형 의사결정을 용이하게 하여 GitHub PR의 리뷰 댓글을 효율적으로 처리할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes abordar de manera eficiente los comentarios de revisión en las solicitudes de extracción de GitHub, utilizando !gh pr view y !gh api para un análisis de comentarios de retroalimentación completo, y facilitando la toma de decisiones basada en datos con unbound.tools.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les commentaires de révision sur les demandes de tirage GitHub, en utilisant !gh pr view et !gh api pour une analyse complète des commentaires de rétroaction, et en facilitant la prise de décision basée sur les données avec unbound.tools.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, effizient auf Überprüfungskommentare in GitHub-PRs zu reagieren, indem !gh pr view und !gh api für eine umfassende Feedback-Analyse verwendet werden, und datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung mit unbound.tools erleichtert.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a abordar eficientemente os comentários de revisão em PRs do GitHub, utilizando !gh pr view e !gh api para uma análise abrangente de feedback, e facilitando a tomada de decisão orientada por dados com unbound.tools.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно обрабатывать комментарии к проверке в GitHub PR, используя !gh pr view и !gh api для всестороннего анализа обратной связи и способствуя принятию решений на основе данных с помощью unbound.tools.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من معالجة تعليقات المراجعة على طلبات السحب (PRs) في GitHub بكفاءة، باستخدام !gh pr view و !gh api لإجراء تحليل شامل للتعليقات، وتسهيل اتخاذ القرارات القائمة على البيانات مع unbound.tools."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating A/B landing page experiment feedback","Streamlining GitHub PR review comment management","Verifying suggestions for data-driven project improvements"],"zh":["自动化 A/B 랜딩 페이지 실험 피드백","简化 GitHub PR 리뷰 댓글 관리","데이터 주도 프로젝트 改进 제안의 검증"],"ja":["A/B ランディングページ実験のフィードバックの自動化","GitHub PR のレビューコメント管理の簡素化","データドリブンプロジェクトの改善提案の検証"],"ko":["A/B 랜딩 페이지 실험 피드백 자동화","GitHub PR 리뷰 댓글 관리 간소화","데이터 주도 프로젝트 개선 제안 검증"],"es":["Automatización de la retroalimentación de experimentos de página de aterrizaje A/B","Simplificación de la gestión de comentarios de revisión de GitHub PR","Verificación de sugerencias para mejoras de proyectos impulsados por datos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la rétroaction des expériences de page de destination A/B","Simplification de la gestion des commentaires de révision des demandes de tirage GitHub","Vérification des suggestions pour l''amélioration des projets axés sur les données"],"de":["Automatisierung der Feedback-Rückmeldung für A/B-Landingpage-Experimente","Simplifizierung der GitHub-PR-Überprüfungskommentar-Verwaltung","Überprüfung von Vorschlägen für datengetriebene Projektverbesserungen"],"pt":["Automatizando o feedback de experimentos de página de destino A/B","Simplificando o gerenciamento de comentários de revisão de PRs no GitHub","Verificando sugestões para melhorias de projetos orientados por dados"],"ru":["Автоматизация сбора отзывов по экспериментам с A/B-тестированием целевых страниц","Упрощение управления комментариями к проверке в GitHub PR","Проверка предложений по улучшению проектов, управляемых данными"],"ar":["أتمتة التعليقات على تجارب الصفحات المقصودة من النوع A/B","تبسيط إدارة تعليقات المراجعة على طلبات السحب (PRs) في GitHub","التحقق من الاقتراحات لتحسين المشاريع القائمة على البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Limited to unbound.tools and GitHub PRs"],"zh":["需要 GitHub API 访问","仅限于 unbound.tools 和 GitHub PRs"],"ja":["GitHub API アクセスが必要","unbound.tools と GitHub PRs 限定"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요","unbound.tools 및 GitHub PRs에만 적용"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","Limitado a unbound.tools y GitHub PRs"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Limité à unbound.tools et aux demandes de tirage GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf unbound.tools und GitHub-PRs"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do GitHub","Limitado ao unbound.tools e PRs do GitHub"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к GitHub API","Ограничено unbound.tools и GitHub PR"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى GitHub API","يقتصر على unbound.tools وطلبات السحب (PRs) في GitHub"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"712176b2ede2a1805751c302527454ee4556e118566a17f4e39cb3997cdefd9f","qualityScore":54}');
