INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('renpereiradx/erp-webapp/enhance-prompt', 'enhance-prompt', 'renpereiradx', 'erp-webapp', 'community', 'enhance-prompt renpereiradx erp-webapp community The enhance-prompt skill helps Stitch Prompt Engineers optimize UI generation ideas into effective prompts, resulting in better Stitch outputs. It benefits developers working with Stitch. 增强提示是Stitch Prompt Engineer的关键技能，用于将粗糙或模糊的UI生成想法转换为精致的优化提示。 エンハンスプロンプトは、Stitch Prompt Engineerの重要なスキルであり、粗いまたは漠然としたUI生成アイデアを洗練された最適化プロンプトに変換するために使用されます。 엔하ンス 프롬프트는 Stitch Prompt Engineer의 중요한 기술입니다. 이는 조잡하거나 모호한 UI 생성 아이디어를 세련된 최적화 프롬프트로 변환하는 데 사용됩니다. El enhance-prompt es una habilidad que transforma ideas de generación de UI vagas en promtps optimizados para Stitch. Consulta la guía de Stitch para las mejores prácticas. L''enhance-prompt est une compétence qui transforme des idées de génération d''UI vagues en invites optimisées pour Stitch. Consultez le guide de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques. Das enhance-prompt ist eine Fähigkeit, die vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in optimierte Prompts für Stitch umwandelt. Siehe die Stitch-Anleitung für die besten Praktiken. Enhance-Prompt é uma habilidade que transforma ideias vagas de geração de UI em prompts otimizados para Stitch. Enhance-Prompt - это навык, который преобразует расплывчатые идеи генерации UI в оптимизированные промпты для Stitch. Enhance-Prompt هو مهارة تحول الأفكار الغامضة لجينيرات UI إلى Prompts مثالية لستيتش. how to use enhance-prompt what is enhance-prompt enhance-prompt setup guide Stitch Effective Prompting Guide enhance-prompt for AI agents optimized prompt engineering for Stitch 增强提示 Stitch提示优化 AI工具 Stitch Effective Prompting Guide Stitch Prompt Engineer UI生成 最优化提示 Consults the official Stitch documentation for best practices Utilizes the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for up-to-date recommendations Transforms rough UI generation ideas into polished prompts Produces better results from Stitch through optimized prompting Follows the latest guidelines from https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/ enhance-prompt is a skill that transforms vague UI generation ideas into optimized prompts for improved Stitch results.');
