cumentation for the latest best practices","Follows the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide for optimized prompts","Transforms rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished prompts","Produces better results from Stitch using optimized prompts","Utilizes the https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/ guide for up-to-date recommendations"],"zh":["参考官方Stitch文档和最佳实践","优化提示文本提高UI生成结果质量","使用Stitch Effective Prompting Guide提高结果准确性","通过Stitch Prompt Engineer角色实现提示优化"],"ja":["公式Stitchドキュメントとベストプラクティスを参照","プロンプトテキストを最適化してUI生成結果の品質を向上させる","Stitch Effective Prompting Guideを使用して結果の正確性を向上させる","Stitch Prompt Engineer役割を通じてプロンプトを最適化"],"ko":["공식 Stitch 문서와 모범 사례를 참조","프롬프트 텍스트를 최적화하여 UI 생성 결과의 품질을 높인다","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide를 사용하여 결과의 정확성을 높인다","Stitch 프롬프트 엔지니어 역할을 통해 프롬프트를 최적화"],"es":["Transformación de ideas vagas en prompts pulidos","Optimización de prompts para mejores resultados de Stitch","Consulta de la guía oficial de Stitch para mejores prácticas","Mejora de la generación de UI con prompts optimizados","Compatibilidad con la última documentación de Stitch"],"fr":["Transformation d''idées vagues en prompts optimisés","Optimisation de prompts pour obtenir de meilleurs résultats avec Stitch","Consultation du guide officiel de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques","Amélioration de la génération d''interfaces utilisateur avec des prompts optimisés","Compatibilité avec la dernière documentation de Stitch"],"de":["Umwandlung von vagen Ideen in polierte Prompts","Optimierung von Prompts für bessere Ergebnisse mit Stitch","Konsultation der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation für Best Practices","Verbesserung der UI-Generierung mit optimierten Prompts","Kompatibilität mit der neuesten Stitch-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Consulte o guia oficial de Stitch para as últimas práticas recomendadas","Transforme ideias vagas de geração de UI em prompts otimizados","Aprenda a produzir resultados mais precisos com Stitch","Utilize o Stitch Effective Prompting Guide para melhorar os prompts","Melhore a eficácia dos prompts com as últimas recomendações","Otimizar prompts para geração de UI mais eficaz"],"ru":["Используйте официальное руководство Stitch для получения последних рекомендаций","Преобразуйте неясные идеи генерации UI в оптимизированные промпты","Узнайте, как производить более точные результаты с помощью Stitch","Используйте руководство Stitch Effective Prompting для улучшения промптов","Улучшите эффективность промптов с помощью последних рекомендаций","Оптимизируйте промпты для более эффективной генерации UI"],"ar":["استخدم دليل ستيتش الرسمي للحصول على أحدث الممارسات الموصى بها","قم بتحويل الأفكار الغامضة لتوليد واجهة المستخدم إلى إشعارات محسنة","تعلم كيفية إنتاج نتائج أكثر دقة مع ستيتش","استخدم دليل ستيتش الفعال لتطوير الإشعارات","حسن فعالية الإشعارات مع أحدث التوصيات","تحسين الإشعارات لتوليد واجهة المستخدم الأكثر فعالية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use enhance-prompt","what is enhance-prompt","enhance-prompt setup guide","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","enhance-prompt for Stitch","optimized prompt engineering","Stitch prompt optimization","enhance-prompt install","enhance-prompt tutorial"],"zh":["增强提示","Stitch Prompt Engineer","AI工具","UI生成","提示优化","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide"],"ja":["エンハンスプロンプト","Stitch Prompt Engineer","AIエージェント","UI生成","プロンプト最適化","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide"],"ko":["프롬프트 강화","Stitch 프롬프트 엔지니어","AI 도구","UI 생성","프롬프트 최적화","Stitch Effective Prompting Guide"],"es":["enhance-prompt","Stitch","prompts optimizados","generación de UI","mejores prácticas de Stitch","guía de prompting de Stitch","optimización de prompts","desarrollo de UI","herramientas de AI"],"fr":["enhance-prompt","Stitch","prompts optimisés","génération d''interfaces utilisateur","meilleures pratiques de Stitch","guide de prompting de Stitch","optimisation de prompts","développement d''interfaces utilisateur","outils d''IA"],"de":["enhance-prompt","Stitch","optimierte Prompts","UI-Generierung","Best Practices von Stitch","Stitch-Prompting-Leitfaden","Prompt-Optimierung","UI-Entwicklung","KI-Tools"],"pt":["enhance prompt","stitch","guias de configuração","melhorar prompts","resultados precisos","stitch effective prompting guide","otimizar prompts","geração de ui","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","enhance prompt","stitch","руководство по настройке","улучшить промпты","точные результаты","stitch effective prompting guide","оптимизировать промпты","генерация ui","разработчики"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعزيز الإشعار","ستيتش","دليل الإعداد","تحسين الإشعارات","نتائج دقيقة","دليل ستيتش الفعال","تحسين الإشعارات","توليد واجهة المستخدم","مطورون"]}},"owner":"ksolomon68","repo":"CaltransBizConnect","repoPath":"ksolomon68/CaltransBizConnect","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T06:23:00.224Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T08:34:46.254Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Model Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing to refine user inputs into effective Stitch prompts.","zh":"适用于需要将用户输入完善为有效Stitch提示的语言模型代理，如Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの言語モデルエージェントが、ユーザーの入力を効果的なStitchのプロンプトに洗練する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 언어 모델 에이전트가 사용자 입력을 효과적인 Stitch 프롬프트로 정련해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Modelo de Lenguaje como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan refinar las entradas de los usuarios en prompts de Stitch efectivos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de modèle de langage comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain qui ont besoin d''affiner les entrées utilisateur en prompts Stitch efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Language-Model-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die Benutzereingaben in effektive Stitch-Prompts verfeinern müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem, como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain, que precisam refinar entradas de usuário em prompts de Stitch eficazes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которые необходимо уточнять пользовательские вводы в эффективные подсказки Stitch.","ar":"مثالي لعميل نموذج اللغة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذي يحتاج إلى تعدين مدخلات المستخدم إلى محفزات Stitch فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts for Stitch, leveraging the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide and best practices for enhanced results, utilizing protocols like HTTPS for documentation access.","zh":"赋予代理能力，将模糊的UI生成想法转化为针对Stitch的优化、精细的提示，利用Stitch有效提示指南和最佳实践，通过协议如HTTPS访问文档以获得更好的结果。","ja":"エージェントに、曖昧なUI生成アイデアをStitch用に最適化されたプロンプトに変換する能力を与え、Stitchの効果的なプロンプティングガイドやベストプラクティスを利用し、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用して文書にアクセスして、より良い結果を得る。","ko":"에이전트가 모호한 UI 생성 아이디어를 Stitch 용으로 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드와 최고의 관행을 사용하여 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 문서에 액세스하여 더好的 결과를 얻습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes transformar ideas vagas de generación de UI en prompts pulidos y optimizados para Stitch, aprovechando la Guía de Prompting Efectiva de Stitch y las mejores prácticas para resultados mejorados, utilizando protocolos como HTTPS para el acceso a la documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées vagues de génération d''UI en prompts polis et optimisés pour Stitch, en exploitant le Guide de promptage efficace de Stitch et les meilleures pratiques pour des résultats améliorés, en utilisant des protocoles comme HTTPS pour l''accès à la documentation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, vage UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte, optimierte Prompts für Stitch zu verwandeln, indem sie den Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfaden und die besten Praktiken für verbesserte Ergebnisse nutzen und Protokolle wie HTTPS für den Zugriff auf die Dokumentation verwenden.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a transformar ideias vagas de geração de UI em prompts polidos e otimizados para Stitch, utilizando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch e as melhores práticas para resultados aprimorados, utilizando protocolos como HTTPS para acesso à documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать неясные идеи генерации UI в отполированные и оптимизированные подсказки для Stitch, используя Руководство по эффективному продвижению Stitch и лучшие практики для улучшения результатов, используя протоколы, такие как HTTPS, для доступа к документации.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكيل من تحويل أفكار غير واضحة لإنشاء واجهة المستخدم إلى محفزات منقحة ومُحسنة لبرنامج Stitch، مستخدما دليل التوجيه الفعّال لبرنامج Stitch وأفضل الممارسات لتحسين النتائج، مستخدما بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS للوصول إلى الوثائق."},"useCases":{"en":["Transforming rough UI concepts into actionable Stitch prompts","Consulting official Stitch documentation for best practices","Optimizing prompts for better results from Stitch"],"zh":["将粗糙的UI概念转化为可执行的Stitch提示","查阅官方Stitch文档以获取最佳实践","优化提示以获得Stitch的更好结果"],"ja":["曖昧なUI概念を実行可能なStitchのプロンプトに変換する","公式Stitchドキュメントを参照してベストプラクティスを取得する","Stitchのより良い結果を得るためのプロンプトの最適化"],"ko":["조잡한 UI 개념을 실행 가능한 Stitch 프롬프트로 변환하는 것","공식 Stitch 문서를 참조하여 최고의 관행을 얻는 것","Stitch의 더 나은 결과를 얻기 위한 프롬프트 최적화"],"es":["Transformar conceptos de UI poco definidos en prompts de Stitch accionables","Consultar la documentación oficial de Stitch para las mejores prácticas","Optimizar prompts para mejores resultados de Stitch"],"fr":["Transformer des concepts d''UI peu définis en prompts Stitch actionnables","Consulter la documentation officielle de Stitch pour les meilleures pratiques","Optimiser les prompts pour de meilleurs résultats de Stitch"],"de":["Ungenaue UI-Konzepte in handhabbare Stitch-Prompts umwandeln","Offizielle Stitch-Dokumentation für Best-Practices konsultieren","Prompts für bessere Ergebnisse von Stitch optimieren"],"pt":["Transformar conceitos UI grosseiros em prompts de Stitch ação","Consultar a documentação oficial do Stitch para as melhores práticas","Otimizar prompts para melhores resultados do Stitch"],"ru":["Преобразование грубых концепций UI в действенные подсказки Stitch","Консультирование по официальной документации Stitch для лучших практик","Оптимизация подсказок для лучших результатов Stitch"],"ar":["تحويل مفاهيم واجهة المستخدم الخشنة إلى محفزات برنامج Stitch قابلة للتنفيذ","استشارة وثائق برنامج Stitch الرسمية لأفضل الممارسات","تحسين المحفزات للحصول على أفضل نتائج من برنامج Stitch"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the official Stitch documentation","Stitch-specific prompting guide compliance necessary"],"zh":["需要访问官方Stitch文档","需要遵守Stitch特定的提示指南"],"ja":["公式Stitchドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Stitch特有のプロンプティングガイドへの準拠が必要"],"ko":["공식 Stitch 문서에 접근할 필요가 있음","Stitch 특정 프롬프트 가이드 준수 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación oficial de Stitch","Cumplimiento de la guía de prompting específica de Stitch es necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation officielle de Stitch","Le respect du guide de promptage spécifique à Stitch est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die offizielle Stitch-Dokumentation","Einhaltung der Stitch-spezifischen Prompting-Richtlinie ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação oficial do Stitch","É necessário cumprir com o guia de prompting do Stitch"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к официальной документации Stitch","Необходимо соблюдать руководство по продвижению Stitch"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق برنامج Stitch الرسمية","لا بد من الامتثال لدليل التوجيه لبرنامج Stitch"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ccb200c798072438b642b1fa6a5c515563159e2fab3d56e813d76d8afa9a7ce6","qualityScore":54}');
