ug is a structured bug-fixing workflow for the Formidable Forms plugin ecosystem, extending always-on rules with bug-fix-specific steps.","zh":"Fix Bug 是一个用于调试 Formidable Forms 代码的 AI 工具","ja":"Fix Bug は Formidable Forms コードをデバッグするための AI エージェント","ko":"Fix Bug는 Formidable Forms 플러그인 코드를 디버깅하기 위한 AI 도구","es":"El skill fix-bug es una herramienta de depuración de AI que ayuda a solucionar errores en Formidable Forms","fr":"Le skill fix-bug est un outil de débogage AI qui aide à résoudre les erreurs dans Formidable Forms","de":"Der Skill fix-bug ist ein AI-Debugging-Tool, das dabei hilft, Fehler in Formidable Forms zu beheben","pt":"O que é Fix-Bug? Um fluxo de trabalho automatizado para resolver bugs no Formidable Forms LITE.","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Fix-Bug? Автоматизированный рабочий процесс для исправления ошибок в Formidable Forms LITE.","ar":"ما هو Fix-Bug؟ عملية عمل آلي ل修复 العيوب في Formidable Forms LITE."},"features":{"en":["Follows WordPress, Formidable Forms, and WordPress VIP coding standards","Extends always-on rules in .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ with bug-fix-specific steps","Automates core principles, code change phases, writing style, and commit message format","Supports debugging unexpected behavior and fixing reported bugs","Integrates with Formidable Forms LITE Plugin for seamless bug-fixing"],"zh":["遵循 WordPress 和 WordPress VIP 编码标准","结构化的 bug 修复工作流程","自动应用核心原则、代码更改阶段、编写风格和提交消息格式","支持 Formidable Forms 代码调试","集成了 .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ 规则"],"ja":["WordPress と WordPress VIP のコーディング規約に従ったデバッグ","構造化されたバグ修正ワークフロー","自動でコア原則、コード変更段階、スタイル、コミットメッセージ形式を適用","Formidable Forms コードのデバッグをサポート",".windsurf/rules/enterprise/ ルールの統合"],"ko":["워드프레스 및 워드프레스 VIP 코딩 표준을 준수","구조화된 버그 수정 워크플로우","자동으로 코어 원칙, 코드 변경 단계, 스타일, 커밋 메시지 형식을 적용","Formidable Forms 플러그인 코드 디버깅 지원",".windsurf/rules/enterprise/ 규칙 통합"],"es":["Flujo de trabajo estructurado para solucionar errores","Seguimiento de los estándares de codificación de WordPress y WordPress VIP","Integración con Formidable Forms","Soporte para depuración y solución de errores","Compatibilidad con los estándares de codificación de WordPress"],"fr":["Workflow structuré pour résoudre les erreurs","Respect des normes de codage de WordPress et WordPress VIP","Intégration avec Formidable Forms","Support pour le débogage et la résolution des erreurs","Compatibilité avec les normes de codage de WordPress"],"de":["Strukturierter Workflow zur Fehlerbehebung","Einhaltung der Codierungsstandards von WordPress und WordPress VIP","Integration mit Formidable Forms","Unterstützung für Debugging und Fehlerbehebung","Kompatibilität mit den Codierungsstandards von WordPress"],"pt":["Segue os padrões de codificação do WordPress","Segue os padrões de codificação do Formidable Forms","Extende as regras sempre-ativas em .windsurf/rules/enterprise/","Fornece um fluxo de trabalho estruturado para resolver bugs","Suporta a forma de commit e mensagem de commit padrão"],"ru":["Следует стандартам кодирования WordPress","Следует стандартам кодирования Formidable Forms","Расширяет всегда-включенные правила в .windsurf/rules/enterprise/","Предоставляет структурированный рабочий процесс для исправления ошибок","Поддерживает стандартную форму коммита и сообщения коммита"],"ar":["يتبع معايير الترميز الخاصة بـ WordPress","يتبع معايير الترميز الخاصة بـ Formidable Forms","يوسع القواعد دائمًا في .windsurf/rules/enterprise/","يقدم عملية عمل مهيكلة ل修复 العيوب","يدعم شكل Commit ومensagem Commit القياسي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use fix-bug","fix-bug alternative","fix-bug setup guide","what is fix-bug","fix-bug vs WordPress VIP","fix-bug install","Formidable Forms bug fixing","WordPress bug-fixing workflow","fix-bug for developers"],"zh":["Fix Bug","Formidable Forms","WordPress","WordPress VIP","AI 工具","代码调试","结构化 bug 修复","自动化代码审查"],"ja":["Fix Bug","Formidable Forms","WordPress","WordPress VIP","AI エージェント","コードデバッグ","構造化バグ修正","自動コードレビュー"],"ko":["Fix Bug","Formidable Forms","워드프레스","워드프레스 VIP","AI 도구","코드 디버깅","구조화된 버그 수정","자동화된 코드 리뷰"],"es":["fix-bug","Herramientas de depuración de AI","Formidable Forms","WordPress","WordPress VIP","depuración de errores","solución de errores","codificación de WordPress"],"fr":["fix-bug","Outils de débogage AI","Formidable Forms","WordPress","WordPress VIP","débogage d''erreurs","résolution d''erreurs","codage de WordPress"],"de":["fix-bug","AI-Debugging-Tools","Formidable Forms","WordPress","WordPress VIP","Fehlerbehebung","Debugging","Codierungsstandards von WordPress"],"pt":["Fix-Bug","Formidable Forms LITE","WordPress","padrões de codificação","fluxo de trabalho automatizado","resolução de bugs","desenvolvimento de plugins","Formidable Forms plugin"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Fix-Bug","Formidable Forms LITE","WordPress","стандарты кодирования","автоматизированный рабочий процесс","исправление ошибок","разработка плагинов","Formidable Forms плагин"],"ar":["Fix-Bug","Formidable Forms LITE","WordPress","معايير الترميز","عملية عمل آلي","تصحيح العيوب","تطوير البرامج الإضافية","Formidable Forms برنامج إضافي"]}},"owner":"Strategy11","repo":"formidable-forms","repoPath":"Strategy11/formidable-forms","stars":60,"forks":39,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T18:19:36Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fix-bug","description":"Bug-fixing workflow for Formidable Forms. Use when fixing bugs, debugging unexpected behavior, investigating error logs, or resolving compatibility issues.","bodyPreview":"# Fix Bug\n\nStructured bug-fixing workflow for the Formidable Forms plugin ecosystem, following WordPress, Formidable Forms, and WordPress VIP coding standards.\n\nThis skill builds on the always-on rules in `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` which define core principles, code change phases, writing style, and commit message format. Those rules apply automatically to every conversation. This skill extends them with bug-fix-specific steps.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Fixing reported bugs\n- Debugging unexpected be","body":"# Fix Bug\n\nStructured bug-fixing workflow for the Formidable Forms plugin ecosystem, following WordPress, Formidable Forms, and WordPress VIP coding standards.\n\nThis skill builds on the always-on rules in `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` which define core principles, code change phases, writing style, and commit message format. Those rules apply automatically to every conversation. This skill extends them with bug-fix-specific steps.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Fixing reported bugs\n- Debugging unexpected behavior\n- Investigating error logs\n- Resolving compatibility issues\n\n---\n\n## Coding Standards\n\nBefore writing or modifying ANY code, read and follow the applicable rules from `.windsurf/rules/`:\n\n| File type                | Rules to read                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `*.php`                  | `formidable/frm-php.md`, `wordpress/php.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-security.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-performance.md` |\n| `*.js`, `*.jsx`, `*.mjs` | `formidable/frm-javascript.md`, `wordpress/javascript.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-security.md`                         |\n| `*.css`, `*.scss`        | `formidable/frm-css.md`                                                                                              |\n| `*.html`                 | `wordpress/html.md`                                                                                                  |\n| Block editor code        | `wordpress/block-editor.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-block-editor.md`                                                   |\n| UI/forms/user-facing     | `wordpress/accessibility.md`                                                                                         |\n| Tests                    | `formidable/testing.md`                                                                                              |\n\n**How to apply:**\n\n1. Before implementing, read ALL rules that match the file types you will modify\n2. Follow every rule when writing new code or modifying existing code\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\nThe always-on rule `enterprise/code-change-principles.md` defines the core phases: Understand, Locate, Research, Select Solution, Implement, and Verify. The steps below are **additional** bug-fix-specific requirements.\n\n### Phase 4: Design\n\n- Document proposed solutions using [solution-template.md](solution-template.md)\n\n### Phase 6: Verify\n\n- Run through [checklist.md](checklist.md)\n\n### Phase 7: Report\n\nOutput a single concise report following [report-template.md](report-template.md).\n\nThe report contains all deliverables:\n\n```markdown\nReport\n├── Root Cause → Fix (1 sentence each)\n├── Files Changed (file path + what changed)\n├── PR Info\n│ ├── Branch (fix/{issue}-{slug})\n│ ├── PR Title (human-readable, NOT conventional commit format)\n│ ├── PR Body (Fixes URL + description + test steps)\n│ └── Commit Msg (conventional commit, NO issue number)\n└── Manual Test Steps (numbered reproduction/verification)\n```\n\nSee [pr-template.md](pr-template.md) for PR title, PR body, and commit message formatting rules.\n\n---\n\n## Supporting Resources\n\n- [checklist.md](checklist.md): Verification checklist\n- [solution-template.md](solution-template.md): Solution comparison template\n- [report-template.md](report-template.md): Completion report template\n- [pr-template.md](pr-template.md): Branch name, PR title, and PR body template\n\n## Invocation\n\nCascade automatically invokes this skill when your request matches bug-fixing tasks.\n\nTo manually invoke:\n\n```text\n@fix-bug\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:34:23.832Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing structured bug-fixing workflows for WordPress and Formidable Forms plugin ecosystems.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化的bug修复工作流程的开发者代理，适用于WordPress和Formidable Forms插件生态系统。","ja":"WordPressおよびFormidable Formsプラグインのエコシステム向けに構造化されたバグ修正ワークフローが必要な開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"WordPress 및 Formidable Forms 플러그인 에코시스템을 위한 구조화된 버그 수정 워크플로가 필요한 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan flujos de trabajo de solución de errores estructurados para WordPress y los ecosistemas del plugin Formidable Forms.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant des flux de travail de correction de bogues structurés pour WordPress et les écosystèmes du plugin Formidable Forms.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die strukturierte Workflows für die Fehlerbehebung in WordPress und den Formidable Forms-Plugin-Ökosystemen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de correção de bugs estruturados para WordPress e ecossistemas de plugin Formidable Forms.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков, которым необходимы структурированные рабочие процессы исправления ошибок для WordPress и экосистем плагинов Formidable Forms.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى سير عمل تصحيح الأخطاء المنظمة لويبورد بريس وبيئة 플러그인 Formidable Forms."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to follow WordPress and WordPress VIP coding standards, utilizing always-on rules in .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ for core principles, code change phases, writing style, and commit message format, ensuring high-quality bug fixes.","zh":"赋予代理按照WordPress和WordPress VIP编码标准进行操作，利用.windsurf/rules/enterprise/中的始终打开规则来确保核心原则、代码更改阶段、编写风格和提交消息格式，从而确保高质量的bug修复。","ja":"エージェントがWordPressおよびWordPress VIPのコーディング規範に従うことを可能にし、.windsurf/rules/enterprise/にある常にオンのルールを使用して、コア原則、コード変更段階、書き込みスタイル、およびコミットメッセージ形式を確実に遵守し、高品質のバグ修正を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 WordPress 및 WordPress VIP 코딩 표준을 따르도록 하여 .windsurf/rules/enterprise/에 있는 항상 켜져 있는 규칙을 사용하여 핵심 원칙, 코드 변경 단계, 작성 스타일 및 커밋 메시지 형식을 보장하여 고품질의 버그 수정을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a seguir los estándares de codificación de WordPress y WordPress VIP, utilizando reglas siempre activas en .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ para principios básicos, fases de cambios de código, estilo de escritura y formato de mensaje de confirmación, garantizando soluciones de alta calidad para errores.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les normes de codage de WordPress et WordPress VIP, en utilisant des règles toujours activées dans .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ pour les principes fondamentaux, les phases de modification de code, le style d''écriture et le format de message de validation, garantissant des corrections de bogues de haute qualité.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die WordPress- und WordPress-VIP-Codierungsstandards zu befolgen, indem sie immer aktive Regeln in .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ für Kernprinzipien, Codeänderungsphasen, Schreibstil und Commit-Nachrichtenformat verwenden, um hochwertige Fehlerbehebungen sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a seguir os padrões de codificação do WordPress e do WordPress VIP, utilizando regras sempre ativadas em .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ para princípios básicos, fases de alteração de código, estilo de escrita e formato de mensagem de compromisso, garantindo correções de bugs de alta qualidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью следовать стандартам кодирования WordPress и WordPress VIP, используя всегда активные правила в .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ для основных принципов, фаз изменений кода, стиля письма и формата сообщения о фиксации, обеспечивая высококачественные исправления ошибок.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من اتباع معايير الترميز الخاصة بـ WordPress و WordPress VIP، باستخدام القواعد المفعلة دائمًا في .windsurf/rules/enterprise/ لمبادئ أساسية وأطوار تغيير الكود وأسلوب الكتابة وتنسيق رسالة التعهد، مما يضمن إصلاحات الأخطاء عالية الجودة."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging reported bugs in Formidable Forms plugins","Fixing unexpected behavior in WordPress environments","Implementing automated testing for bug fixes"],"zh":["调试Formidable Forms插件中报告的bug","修复WordPress环境中的意外行为","实现自动化测试以修复bug"],"ja":["Formidable Formsプラグインで報告されたバグのデバッグ","WordPress環境での予期せぬ動作の修正","バグ修正の自動テストの実装"],"ko":["Formidable Forms 플러그인에서 보고된 버그 디버깅","WordPress 환경에서 예기치 않은 동작 수정","버그 수정을 위한 자동화된 테스트 구현"],"es":["Depuración de errores informados en plugins de Formidable Forms","Corrección de comportamientos inesperados en entornos de WordPress","Implementación de pruebas automatizadas para soluciones de errores"],"fr":["Débogage des bogues signalés dans les plugins Formidable Forms","Correction de comportements inattendus dans les environnements WordPress","Mise en œuvre de tests automatisés pour les corrections de bogues"],"de":["Debuggen von gemeldeten Fehlern in Formidable Forms-Plugins","Beheben unerwarteten Verhaltens in WordPress-Umgebungen","Implementierung automatisierter Tests für Fehlerbehebungen"],"pt":["Depuração de bugs relatados em plugins Formidable Forms","Correção de comportamento inesperado em ambientes WordPress","Implementação de testes automatizados para correções de bugs"],"ru":["Отладка сообщенных ошибок в плагинах Formidable Forms","Исправление непредвиденного поведения в средах WordPress","Реализация автоматизированного тестирования для исправления ошибок"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء المُبلَغ عنها في مشغلات Formidable Forms","تصحيح السلوك غير المتوقع في بيئات ووردبريس","تنفيذ اختبارات آلية للإصلاحات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of WordPress and Formidable Forms plugin ecosystems","Limited to bug-fixing workflows for these specific ecosystems"],"zh":["需要了解WordPress和Formidable Forms插件生态系统","仅限于这些特定生态系统的bug修复工作流程"],"ja":["WordPressおよびFormidable Formsプラグインのエコシステムに関する知識が必要","これらの特定のエコシステムのバグ修正ワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["WordPress 및 Formidable Forms 플러그인 에코시스템에 대한 지식이 필요","이러한 특정 에코시스템의 버그 수정 워크플로에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de WordPress y Formidable Forms","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de solución de errores para estos ecosistemas específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des écosystèmes WordPress et Formidable Forms","Limité aux flux de travail de correction de bogues pour ces écosystèmes spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der WordPress- und Formidable Forms-Plugin-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf Fehlerbehebungsworkflows für diese spezifischen Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos ecossistemas de plugin WordPress e Formidable Forms","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de correção de bugs para esses ecossistemas específicos"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем плагинов WordPress и Formidable Forms","Ограничен рабочими процессами исправления ошибок для этих конкретных экосистем"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بيئات الويبورد بريس و Formidable Forms","محدود بسير عمل تصحيح الأخطاء لهذه البيئات المحددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"47139e8218c39a42e5c445d4cdc9ea3bc651f45451ebc33e47a8fdc0b90443e9","qualityScore":53}');
