INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('vitalyiegorov/suuudokuuu/native-data-fetching', 'native-data-fetching', 'vitalyiegorov', 'suuudokuuu', 'community', 'native-data-fetching vitalyiegorov suuudokuuu community expo react-native sudoku sudoku-game sudoku-generator sudoku-solver The native-data-fetching skill enables developers to handle networking tasks, including API requests and data fetching, for Expo and React Native applications. Native Data Fetching 是 Expo 网络请求和数据缓存的必备技能，支持 React Query 和 SWR ネイティブデータフェッチングは Expo ネットワークリクエストとデータキャッシュの必須スキルで、React Query と SWR をサポート 네이티브 데이터 Fetching은 Expo 네트워크 요청과 데이터 캐싱의 필수적인 기술로 React Query와 SWR을 지원 Native-data-fetching es una habilidad para Expo y React Native que permite solicitudes de API, caché y depuración de redes. Utilice esta habilidad para cualquier trabajo de red. Native-data-fetching est une compétence pour Expo et React Native qui permet les requêtes API, le cache et le débogage réseau. Utilisez cette compétence pour tout travail réseau. Native-data-fetching ist eine Fähigkeit für Expo und React Native, die API-Anfragen, Caching und Netzwerk-Debugging ermöglicht. Verwenden Sie diese Fähigkeit für alle Netzwerkaufgaben. O native-data-fetching é uma habilidade essencial para trabalhar com networking em Expo e React Native, incluindo solicitações de API e gerenciamento de cache. Native-data-fetching - это необходимый навык для работы с сетью в Expo и React Native, включая запросы API и управление кешем. أداة native-data-fetching هي مهارة أساسية للعمل مع الشبكات في Expo و React Native، بما في ذلك طلبات API وإدارة الذاكرة المؤقتة. how to use native-data-fetching native-data-fetching expo react native data fetching native-data-fetching vs axios native-data-fetching install guide expo networking setup Native Data Fetching Expo 网络请求 数据缓存 React Query SWR 离线场景 鉴权/令牌管理 AIエージェント Implements API requests using expo/fetch Sets up data fetching with React Query and SWR Handles network debugging and offline scenarios Manages authentication and token management Configures API URLs and environment variables native-data-fetching is a skill for managing networking tasks, such as API requests, data fetching, and caching, in Expo and React Native environments.');
