urs de gérer des instances de Redis et de Tair dans le cloud d''Alibaba","de":"Alicloud-redis ist ein Skill, der Entwicklern ermöglicht, Redis- und Tair-Instanzen in der Alibaba-Cloud zu verwalten","pt":"O que é alicloud-redis? É uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de instâncias Redis e Tair com TypeScript.","ru":"Что такое alicloud-redis? Это инструмент управления экземплярами Redis и Tair с помощью TypeScript.","ar":"ما هو alicloud-redis? هو أداة لإدارة مثيلات Redis و Tair مع TypeScript."},"features":{"en":["Utilizes the @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK for Redis and Tair instance management","Employs the @alicloud/openapi-core library for streamlined API interactions","Leverages the @darabonba/typescript package for enhanced type safety","Supports environment variable configuration via ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID and ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET","Includes a reusable client factory in scripts/setup_client.ts","Provides a quickstart guide in references/quickstart.md for rapid deployment"],"zh":["使用TypeScript + Bun实现","一键化部署流程","支持生产环境","集成@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 SDK","支持环境变量配置"],"ja":["TypeScript + Bunで実装","一键化デプロイフロー","生産環境に対応","@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 SDKを統合","環境変数の設定をサポート"],"ko":["TypeScript + Bun으로 구현","일键화 배포 과정","생산 환경 지원","@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 SDK 통합","환경 변수 설정 지원"],"es":["Implementación de una sola clave con TypeScript y Bun","Administración de instancias de Redis y Tair","Compatibilidad con el SDK de TypeScript @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101","Autenticación con claves de acceso de Alibaba Cloud","Ejemplos de código en scripts/setup_client.ts y references/quickstart.md"],"fr":["Déploiement d''une seule clé avec TypeScript et Bun","Gestion d''instances de Redis et de Tair","Compatibilité avec le SDK de TypeScript @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101","Authentification avec des clés d''accès d''Alibaba Cloud","Exemples de code dans scripts/setup_client.ts et references/quickstart.md"],"de":["Ein-Klick-Implementierung mit TypeScript und Bun","Verwaltung von Redis- und Tair-Instanzen","Kompatibilität mit dem TypeScript-SDK @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101","Authentifizierung mit Alibaba-Cloud-Zugriffsschlüsseln","Codebeispiele in scripts/setup_client.ts und references/quickstart.md"],"pt":["Implementação de CLI com TypeScript e Bun","Gerenciamento de instâncias Redis e Tair com @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101","Suporte a autenticação com ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID e ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET","Exemplo de código em scripts/setup_client.ts","Documentação em references/quickstart.md"],"ru":["Реализация CLI с помощью TypeScript и Bun","Управление экземплярами Redis и Tair с @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101","Поддержка аутентификации с ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID и ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET","Пример кода в scripts/setup_client.ts","Документация в references/quickstart.md"],"ar":["تنفيذ واجهة سطر الأوامر مع TypeScript و Bun","إدارة مثيلات Redis و Tair مع @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101","دعم التوثيق مع ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID و ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET","مثال الكود في scripts/setup_client.ts","التعليمات في references/quickstart.md"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use alicloud-redis","alicloud-redis setup guide","what is alicloud-redis","alicloud-redis vs redis-cli","alicloud-redis install","typescript redis deployment","alibaba cloud redis tutorial","alicloud-redis alternative","redis instance management"],"zh":["阿里云Redis","TypeScript","Bun","CLI工具","一键化部署","生产环境","AI工具","云计算"],"ja":["Alibaba Cloud Redis","TypeScript","Bun","CLIツール","一键化デプロイ","生産環境","AIエージェント","クラウドコンピューティング"],"ko":["알리바바 클라우드 Redis","TypeScript","Bun","CLI 도구","일键화 배포","생산 환경","AI 에이전트","클라우드 컴퓨팅"],"es":["alicloud-redis","typescript","bun","redis","tair","alibaba cloud","desarrollo de aplicaciones en la nube","implementación de una sola clave","administración de instancias de redis"],"fr":["alicloud-redis","typescript","bun","redis","tair","alibaba cloud","développement d''applications dans le cloud","déploiement d''une seule clé","gestion d''instances de redis"],"de":["alicloud-redis","typescript","bun","redis","tair","alibaba cloud","entwicklung von cloud-anwendungen","ein-klick-implementierung","verwaltung von redis-instanzen"],"pt":["alicloud-redis","TypeScript","Bun","CLI","Redis","Tair","gerenciamento de instâncias","autenticação","ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID","ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET"],"ru":["alicloud-redis","TypeScript","Bun","CLI","Redis","Tair","управление экземплярами","аутентификация","ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID","ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["alicloud-redis","TypeScript","Bun","واجهة سطر الأوامر","Redis","Tair","إدارة مثيلات","توثيق","ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID","ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"agents-infrastructure","repo":"licell","repoPath":"agents-infrastructure/licell","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T09:58:15Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"alicloud-redis","description":"Manage Alibaba Cloud Redis (Tair / R-KVStore) using the @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK. Use when working with Redis or Tair instances, accounts, backups, security (whitelist/SSL/TDE/audit), parameters, monitoring, cluster scaling, direct connection, Tair Custom instances, and resource tagging. Covers all 157 APIs of the R-KVStore 20150101 version.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore) Skill\n\nManage Redis and Tair instances via the `@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101` TypeScript SDK.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\nnpm install @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 @alicloud/openapi-core @darabonba/typescript\n```\n\n```bash\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID=\"<your-key-id>\"\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET=\"<your-key-secret>\"\n```\n\nSee [scripts/setup_client.ts](scripts/setup_client.ts) for a reusable client factory, and [references/quickstart.md](references/quick","body":"# Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore) Skill\n\nManage Redis and Tair instances via the `@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101` TypeScript SDK.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\nnpm install @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 @alicloud/openapi-core @darabonba/typescript\n```\n\n```bash\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID=\"<your-key-id>\"\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET=\"<your-key-secret>\"\n```\n\nSee [scripts/setup_client.ts](scripts/setup_client.ts) for a reusable client factory, and [references/quickstart.md](references/quickstart.md) for full setup including endpoints, instance types, architectures, Redis versions, pagination, and async polling.\n\n## Client Initialization\n\n```typescript\nimport Client from ''@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101'';\nimport { Config } from ''@alicloud/openapi-core'';\n\nconst client = new Client(new Config({\n  accessKeyId: process.env.ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID,\n  accessKeySecret: process.env.ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET,\n  endpoint: ''r-kvstore.aliyuncs.com'',\n  regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'',\n}));\n```\n\n## API Overview (157 APIs in 8 Domains)\n\n| Domain | APIs | Key Operations | Reference |\n|--------|------|----------------|-----------|\n| Instance Management | 82 | createInstance, describeInstances, modifyInstanceSpec | [references/instance.md](references/instance.md) |\n| Account Management | 7 | createAccount, grantAccountPrivilege, resetAccountPassword | [references/account.md](references/account.md) |\n| Backup & Recovery | 11 | createBackup, describeBackups, modifyBackupPolicy, restoreInstance | [references/backup.md](references/backup.md) |\n| Security & Encryption | 23 | modifySecurityIps, modifyInstanceSSL, modifyInstanceTDE, modifyAuditLogConfig | [references/security.md](references/security.md) |\n| Parameter Management | 11 | describeParameters, createParameterGroup, modifyInstanceParameter | [references/parameter.md](references/parameter.md) |\n| Monitoring & Performance | 8 | describeHistoryMonitorValues, describeSlowLogRecords | [references/monitoring.md](references/monitoring.md) |\n| Tair Custom Instance | 12 | createTairKVCacheCustomInstance, describeTairKVCacheCustomInstances | [references/tair-custom.md](references/tair-custom.md) |\n| Tag & Resource | 5 | tagResources, untagResources, listTagResources | [references/tag-resource.md](references/tag-resource.md) |\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### RPC-Style with instanceId\n\nMost APIs require `instanceId` as the primary identifier:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as models from ''@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101/dist/models'';\n\nconst { body } = await client.describeInstanceAttribute(\n  new models.DescribeInstanceAttributeRequest({\n    instanceId: ''r-bp1xxxxxxxxxxxxx'',\n  })\n);\n```\n\n### Page-Based Pagination\n\n```typescript\nlet pageNumber = 1;\nlet all: any[] = [];\nwhile (true) {\n  const { body } = await client.describeInstances(new models.DescribeInstancesRequest({\n    regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'', pageSize: 50, pageNumber,\n  }));\n  all.push(...(body.instances?.KVStoreInstance || []));\n  if (all.length >= (body.totalCount || 0)) break;\n  pageNumber++;\n}\n```\n\n### Async Operation Polling\n\nMany operations are async — poll instance status until target state:\n\n```typescript\nwhile (true) {\n  const { body } = await client.describeInstanceAttribute(\n    new models.DescribeInstanceAttributeRequest({ instanceId })\n  );\n  const status = body.instances?.DBInstanceAttribute?.[0]?.instanceStatus;\n  if (status === ''Normal'') break;\n  await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 5000));\n}\n```\n\n### Multi-Type Support\n\nR-KVStore supports Redis Community and Tair (DRAM/Persistent Memory/ESSD):\n\n```typescript\n// Redis Community\nconst { body: redis } = await client.createInstance(new models.CreateInstanceRequest({\n  regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'', instanceType: ''Redis'', engineVersion: ''7.0'',\n  instanceClass: ''redis.master.small.default'', chargeType: ''PostPaid'',\n  password: process.env.REDIS_PASSWORD!, vpcId: ''vpc-xxx'', vSwitchId: ''vsw-xxx'',\n}));\n\n// Tair (Enhanced Redis)\nconst { body: tair } = await client.createTairInstance(new models.CreateTairInstanceRequest({\n  regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'', instanceType: ''tair_rdb'',\n  instanceClass: ''tair.rdb.2g'', chargeType: ''PostPaid'',\n  password: process.env.REDIS_PASSWORD!, vpcId: ''vpc-xxx'', vSwitchId: ''vsw-xxx'',\n}));\n```\n\n### Config as JSON String\n\nInstance configuration is passed as a JSON string:\n\n```typescript\nawait client.modifyInstanceConfig(new models.ModifyInstanceConfigRequest({\n  instanceId,\n  config: JSON.stringify({\n    ''maxmemory-policy'': ''allkeys-lru'',\n    ''timeout'': ''300'',\n  }),\n}));\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```typescript\ntry {\n  await client.createInstance(request);\n} catch (err: any) {\n  console.error(`Code: ${err.code}, Message: ${err.message}, RequestId: ${err.data?.RequestId}`);\n}\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### 1. Create Redis Instance with Account\n\n```\ncreateInstance → waitForNormal → createAccount → modifySecurityIps\n```\n\n### 2. Create Tair Cluster\n\n```\ncreateTairInstance → waitForNormal → describeClusterMemberInfo\n```\n\n### 3. Backup and Recovery\n\n```\nmodifyBackupPolicy → createBackup → describeBackups → restoreInstance\n```\n\n### 4. Security Hardening\n\n```\nmodifySecurityIps → modifyInstanceSSL → modifyInstanceTDE → modifyAuditLogConfig\n```\n\n### 5. Cluster Scaling\n\n```\ndescribeClusterMemberInfo → addShardingNode / deleteShardingNode\n```\n\n### 6. Direct Connection Mode\n\n```\nallocateDirectConnection → describeDBInstanceNetInfo → releaseDirectConnection\n```\n\n### 7. Parameter Tuning\n\n```\ndescribeParameterTemplates → createParameterGroup → modifyInstanceParameter\n```\n\n### 8. Performance Monitoring\n\n```\ndescribeMonitorItems → describeHistoryMonitorValues → describeSlowLogRecords → createCacheAnalysisTask\n```\n\nSee [references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md) for detailed workflow examples with full code.\n\n## API Reference Quick Index\n\nLoad the corresponding reference file for parameter details:\n\n- **Instance CRUD/lifecycle/spec/network/cluster/proxy**: `references/instance.md`\n- **Account CRUD/password/privileges**: `references/account.md`\n- **Backup/restore/cache analysis**: `references/backup.md`\n- **IP whitelist/SSL/TDE/audit/global whitelist**: `references/security.md`\n- **Parameters/parameter groups/templates**: `references/parameter.md`\n- **Performance monitoring/slow logs/running logs**: `references/monitoring.md`\n- **TairKVCache custom instances**: `references/tair-custom.md`\n- **Resource tagging**: `references/tag-resource.md`\n\nEach reference file contains per-API documentation with method signatures and parameter tables.\n\n## Code Examples\n\nSee [scripts/examples.ts](scripts/examples.ts) for ready-to-use code covering:\n\n- Instance listing, creation, and deletion\n- Account management\n- Backup creation and listing\n- IP whitelist and SSL configuration\n- Audit log management\n- Performance monitoring and slow log analysis\n- Parameter management\n- Resource tagging\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:05:19.379Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring seamless integration with Alibaba Cloud Redis instances","zh":"适用于需要与阿里云Redis实例实现无缝集成的云管理代理","ja":"Alibaba Cloud Redisインスタンスとのシームレスな統合を必要とするクラウド管理エージェントに最適","ko":"알리바바 클라우드 Redis 인스턴스와의 무결점 통합을 요구하는 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión en la nube que requieren una integración sin problemas con instancias de Redis de Alibaba Cloud","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion cloud nécessitant une intégration transparente avec les instances Redis d''Alibaba Cloud","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Management-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Alibaba Cloud Redis-Instanzen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de gerenciamento de nuvem que exigem integração sem problemas com instâncias do Alibaba Cloud Redis","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления облаком, требующих бесшовной интеграции с экземплярами Alibaba Cloud Redis","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة السحابة الذي يتطلب التكامل السلس مع مثيلات Alibaba Cloud Redis"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Redis and Tair instances via the @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK, leveraging Alibaba Cloud access keys for secure authentication and utilizing libraries like @alicloud/openapi-core and @darabonba/typescript for efficient interaction","zh":"赋予代理管理Redis和Tair实例的能力，通过@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK，利用阿里云访问密钥进行安全认证，并使用@alicloud/openapi-core和@darabonba/typescript等库实现高效交互","ja":"@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDKを使用して、RedisおよびTairインスタンスを管理するエージェントを強化し、Alibaba Cloudアクセスキーを使用したセキュアな認証と、@alicloud/openapi-coreおよび@darabonba/typescriptなどのライブラリを使用した効率的な相互作用を実現する","ko":"@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK를 통해 Redis 및 Tair 인스턴스를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고, 알리바바 클라우드 액세스 키를 사용한 보안 인증 및 @alicloud/openapi-core 및 @darabonba/typescript 등의 라이브러리를 사용한 효율적인 상호 작용을 제공한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para gestionar instancias de Redis y Tair a través del SDK de TypeScript @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101, aprovechando las claves de acceso de Alibaba Cloud para una autenticación segura y utilizando bibliotecas como @alicloud/openapi-core y @darabonba/typescript para una interacción eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les instances Redis et Tair via le SDK TypeScript @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101, en exploitant les clés d''accès Alibaba Cloud pour une authentification sécurisée et en utilisant des bibliothèques comme @alicloud/openapi-core et @darabonba/typescript pour une interaction efficace","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Redis- und Tair-Instanzen über das @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK zu verwalten, indem es die Alibaba Cloud-Zugriffsschlüssel für eine sichere Authentifizierung nutzt und Bibliotheken wie @alicloud/openapi-core und @darabonba/typescript für eine effiziente Interaktion verwendet","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar instâncias Redis e Tair por meio do SDK @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript, aproveitando chaves de acesso da Alibaba Cloud para autenticação se