"클라리파이는 깃허브 이슈를 위한 상호작용 해결 기술입니다","es":"Clarify es una herramienta de resolución interactiva de preguntas que utiliza GitHub para aclarar requisitos y enfoques de desarrollo","fr":"Clarify est un outil de résolution interactive de questions qui utilise GitHub pour clarifier les exigences et les approches de développement","de":"Clarify ist ein Tool zur interaktiven Lösung von offenen Fragen, das GitHub nutzt, um Anforderungen und Entwicklungsansätze zu klären","pt":"O Clarify é uma habilidade de AI que resolve dúvidas em issues do GitHub de forma interativa.","ru":"ИИ Агент Clarify - это способность, которая интерактивно решает открытые вопросы на GitHub.","ar":"Clarify هو قدرة من الذكاء الاصطناعي لحل الأسئلة المفتوحة في قضايا GitHub بشكل تفاعلي."},"features":{"en":["Fetches GitHub issues with all comments using `gh issue view` command","Takes a single argument, the issue number (e.g., `/clarify 42`)","Works through open questions on a triaged issue before development","Clarifies requirements or approach for a specific ticket","Uses JSON format to fetch issue details like number, title, body, and comments"],"zh":["支持 GitHub 问题的交互式解决","使用 gh 命令行工具来获取问题信息","支持 JSON 格式的数据输出","可以使用 /clarify 命令来指定问题编号"],"ja":["GitHub の問題の解決をサポート","gh コマンドラインツールを使用して問題情報を取得","JSON 形式のデータ出力をサポート","/clarify コマンドを使用して問題番号を指定"],"ko":["깃허브 이슈의 상호작용 해결을 지원","gh 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 이슈 정보를 가져옴","JSON 형식의 데이터 출력을 지원","/clarify 명령을 사용하여 이슈 번호를 지정"],"es":["Resolución interactiva de preguntas abiertas en GitHub","Uso de la CLI de GitHub para leer y resolver preguntas","Compatibilidad con números de problema para identificar y resolver preguntas específicas","Integración con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo para mejorar la productividad"],"fr":["Résolution interactive des questions ouvertes sur GitHub","Utilisation de la CLI de GitHub pour lire et résoudre les questions","Compatibilité avec les numéros de problème pour identifier et résoudre des questions spécifiques","Intégration avec les flux de travail de développement pour améliorer la productivité"],"de":["Interaktive Lösung von offenen Fragen auf GitHub","Verwendung der GitHub-CLI zum Lesen und Lösen von Fragen","Kompatibilität mit Problemmnummern zur Identifizierung und Lösung spezifischer Fragen","Integration in Entwicklungsworkflows zur Steigerung der Produktivität"],"pt":["Leitura de issues do GitHub, incluindo comentários","Esclarecimento de requisitos ou abordagens para tickets específicos","Uso de CLI para executar comandos","Interação com issues do GitHub de forma interativa"],"ru":["Чтение вопросов на GitHub, включая комментарии","Уточнение требований или подходов для конкретных тикетов","Использование CLI для выполнения команд","Взаимодействие с вопросами на GitHub в интерактивном режиме"],"ar":["قراءة قضايا GitHub, بما في ذلك التعليقات","توضيح المتطلبات أو المناهج للطوابع النوعية","استخدام CLI لتنفيذ الأوامر","التفاعل مع قضايا GitHub بشكل تفاعلي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use clarify","what is clarify","clarify alternative","clarify vs github","clarify install","clarify setup guide","github issue resolution","interactive issue resolution","clarify ai agent"],"zh":["Clarify 技术","GitHub 问题解决","交互式解决","gh 命令行工具","JSON 数据输出","代码疑问解决"],"ja":["Clarify AI エージェント","GitHub の問題解決","交互式解決","gh コマンドラインツール","JSON データ出力","コードの疑問解決"],"ko":["클라리파이 기술","깃허브 이슈 해결","상호작용 해결","gh 명령줄 도구","JSON 데이터 출력","코드의疑問 해결"],"es":["herramientas de desarrollo","GitHub","resolución de preguntas","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","Clarify","CLI de GitHub","desarrollo de software","productividad de desarrollo"],"fr":["outils de développement","GitHub","résolution de questions","flux de travail de développement","Clarify","CLI de GitHub","développement de logiciels","productivité de développement"],"de":["Entwicklungstools","GitHub","Lösung von offenen Fragen","Entwicklungsworkflow","Clarify","GitHub-CLI","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsproduktivität"],"pt":["clarify github","ai agent para github","resolver duvidas em issues","configurar clarify","guia de configuracao do clarify","clarify para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Clarify","интерактивное решение открытых вопросов на GitHub","настройка Clarify","руководство по настройке Clarify","Clarify для разработчиков","ИИ Агенты для GitHub"],"ar":["clarify github","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لجيت هاب","حل الأسئلة المفتوحة في قضايا جيت هاب","إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للdevelopers"]}},"owner":"percy-main","repo":"web","repoPath":"percy-main/web","stars":1,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T16:52:52Z","topics":["cricket","sport"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clarify","description":"Reads a triaged GitHub issue and interactively walks through its open questions with the user, updating the ticket as answers are resolved.","tags":"github, issues, triage, clarification","bodyPreview":"# Clarify\n\nInteractively resolve open questions on a triaged GitHub issue.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when the user wants to:\n\n- Work through open questions on a triaged issue before starting development\n- Clarify requirements or approach for a specific ticket\n\n## Arguments\n\nThis skill takes a single argument: the issue number (e.g. `/clarify 42`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Read the issue\n\nFetch the issue including all comments:\n\n```bash\ngh issue view <number> --json number,title,body,comme","body":"# Clarify\n\nInteractively resolve open questions on a triaged GitHub issue.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when the user wants to:\n\n- Work through open questions on a triaged issue before starting development\n- Clarify requirements or approach for a specific ticket\n\n## Arguments\n\nThis skill takes a single argument: the issue number (e.g. `/clarify 42`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Read the issue\n\nFetch the issue including all comments:\n\n```bash\ngh issue view <number> --json number,title,body,comments,labels\n```\n\nIf the issue is not triaged, report that back to the user and stop:\n\n> Issue #42 is not triaged. Please triage it first with /triage\n\n### Step 2: Find open questions\n\nLook through the issue comments for a triage comment (marked with `*Triaged by Claude*`). Extract any open questions — these are checkbox items under the `### Open questions` heading:\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] Unanswered question\n- [x] Already answered question\n```\n\nIf there is no triage comment, or there are no open questions (all checked or section absent), report that back to the user and stop:\n\n> No open questions on #42. This issue is ready for development.\n\n### Step 3: Walk through each question\n\nFor each unanswered question (`- [ ]`), present it to the user one at a time using `AskUserQuestion`. Provide options where you can infer sensible choices from the codebase, and always allow a free-text \"Other\" response.\n\nBefore presenting each question, briefly explore the codebase if it helps you offer better options. For example, if the question is about where to place a component, check the existing component structure first.\n\n### Step 4: Update the issue\n\nOnce all questions are resolved, post a new comment on the issue summarising the decisions:\n\n```markdown\n## Clarifications\n\n| Question | Decision |\n|----------|----------|\n| Should X use approach A or B? | Approach A — because ... |\n| ... | ... |\n\n---\n*Clarified by Claude*\n```\n\nThen update the triage comment to check off the resolved questions. Use `gh api` to edit the existing triage comment:\n\n1. Find the triage comment ID from the comments JSON\n2. For each resolved question, replace `- [ ]` with `- [x]` in the comment body\n3. Update the comment:\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/comments/{comment_id} -X PATCH -f body=''...''\n```\n\nAdd the `ready for dev` label to the issue:\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"ready for dev\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Report\n\nTell the user the issue is now clarified and ready for development, or note if any questions remain unresolved.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:15:05.176Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing issue resolution and requirement clarification on GitHub.","zh":"非常适合需要在 GitHub 上解决问题和澄清需求的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub で問題を解決し、要件を明確化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub에서 문제를 해결하고 요구 사항을 명확히 할 필요가 있는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan resolver problemas y aclarar requisitos en GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin de résoudre des problèmes et de clarifier les exigences sur GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsspezialisten, die Probleme lösen und Anforderungen auf GitHub klären müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de resolução de problemas e esclarecimento de requisitos no GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется решение проблем и уточнение требований на GitHub.","ar":"مثالي للوكيلين الإنمائيين الذين يحتاجون إلى حل المشكلات وتوضيح المتطلبات على GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interactively resolve open questions on triaged GitHub issues, enabling them to work through requirements and approaches before starting development using gh issue view and JSON data.","zh":"使代理能够交互式地解决 GitHub 上已分类的问题中尚未解决的问题，允许他们在开始使用 gh issue view 和 JSON 数据进行开发之前处理需求和方法。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub の分類済み問題で解決されていない質問を対話的に解決できるようにし、gh issue view と JSON データを使用して開発を開始する前に要件とアプローチを処理できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub의 분류된 문제에서 해결되지 않은 질문을 상호 작용하여 해결할 수 있도록 하여 gh issue view 및 JSON 데이터를 사용하여 개발을 시작하기 전에 요구 사항과 접근 방식을 처리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver interactivamente preguntas abiertas en problemas de GitHub clasificados, lo que les permite trabajar en los requisitos y enfoques antes de comenzar el desarrollo utilizando la vista de problemas de gh y datos JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre de manière interactive les questions ouvertes sur les problèmes GitHub triés, leur permettant de travailler sur les exigences et les approches avant de commencer le développement en utilisant la vue des problèmes gh et les données JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, offene Fragen in triagierten GitHub-Problemen interaktiv zu lösen, sodass sie Anforderungen und Ansätze durcharbeiten können, bevor sie mit der Entwicklung beginnen, und zwar mithilfe der gh-Problemanzeige und JSON-Daten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolverem interativamente perguntas abertas em problemas triados do GitHub, permitindo que eles trabalhem nos requisitos e abordagens antes de iniciar o desenvolvimento usando a visualização de problemas do gh e dados JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интерактивно решать открытые вопросы в отобранных проблемах GitHub, позволяя им работать над требованиями и подходами до начала разработки с помощью просмотра проблем gh и данных JSON.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من حل الأسئلة المفتوحة بطريقة تفاعلية على قضايا GitHub المصنفة، مما يسمح لهم بالعمل على المتطلبات والمناهج قبل بدء التطوير باستخدام عرض قضايا غه وبيانات JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Resolving open questions on GitHub issues","Clarifying requirements for specific tickets","Working through development approaches before coding"],"zh":["在 GitHub 问题上解决未解决的问题","为特定票据澄清需求","在编码之前处理开发方法"],"ja":["GitHub の問題で解決されていない質問を解決する","特定のチケットの要件を明確化する","コーディングを開始する前に開発アプローチを処理する"],"ko":["GitHub 문제에서 해결되지 않은 질문을 해결한다","특정 티켓의 요구 사항을 명확히 한다","코딩을 시작하기 전에 개발 접근 방식을 처리한다"],"es":["Resolver preguntas abiertas en problemas de GitHub","Aclarar requisitos para boletos específicos","Trabajar en enfoques de desarrollo antes de codificar"],"fr":["Résoudre les questions ouvertes sur les problèmes GitHub","Clarifier les exigences pour les tickets spécifiques","Travailler sur les approches de développement avant de coder"],"de":["Offene Fragen in GitHub-Problemen lösen","Anforderungen für bestimmte Tickets klären","Entwicklungsansätze durcharbeiten, bevor der Code geschrieben wird"],"pt":["Resolver perguntas abertas em problemas do GitHub","Esclarecer requisitos para bilhetes específicos","Trabalhar em abordagens de desenvolvimento antes de codificar"],"ru":["Решение открытых вопросов в проблемах GitHub","Уточнение требований для конкретных тикетов","Работа над подходами разработки до начала кодирования"],"ar":["حل الأسئلة المفتوحة على قضايا GitHub","توضيح المتطلبات لطوابع معينة","العمل على مناهج التطوير قبل الترميز"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub issue number as an argument","Limited to triaged GitHub issues only"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 问题编号作为参数","仅限于已分类的 GitHub 问题"],"ja":["GitHub の問題番号を引数として必要とする","分類済みの GitHub の問題のみに限定される"],"ko":["GitHub 문제 번호를 인수로서 필요로 한다","분류된 GitHub 문제에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere el número de problema de GitHub como argumento","Limitado solo a problemas de GitHub clasificados"],"fr":["Nécessite le numéro de problème GitHub comme argument","Limité aux seuls problèmes GitHub triés"],"de":["Benötigt die GitHub-Problemmnummer als Argument","Begrenzt auf nur triagierte GitHub-Probleme"],"pt":["Exige o número do problema do GitHub como um argumento","Limitado a problemas do GitHub triados apenas"],"ru":["Требует номера проблемы GitHub в качестве аргумента","Ограничен только отобранными проблемами GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب رقم قضية GitHub كحجة","محدود بالمشكلات المصنفة على GitHub فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a4efe9aaacecc9aab2a0c60711178846fbde5442cfad82819c9b26a6e574fbf3","qualityScore":53}');
