етов проекта","Поддержка.glob-шаблонов для указания пакетов"],"ar":["تأتمة مهام صيانة حزم JavaScript","عمليات التدقيق الأمنية لاكتشاف الثغرات","تحديث الإعتماديات لتحسين أداء الحزم","دعم مختلف مديري الحزم (npm, yarn, pnpm, bun)","اكتشاف تلقائي لمدير الحزم للمشروع","دعم أنماط Glob لتحديد الحزم"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use package-json-maintenance","package-json-maintenance setup guide","automated dependency management","JavaScript package maintenance","security audit tools","package-json-maintenance vs npm","package-json-maintenance install","package-json-maintenance tutorial","dependency update best practices"],"zh":["Package.json 维护","AI 工具","安全审计","依赖更新","包管理","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ja":["Package.json メンテナンス","AI ツール","セキュリティ監査","依存関係の更新","パッケージ管理","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"ko":["Package.json 유지 보수","AI 도구","보안 감사","종속성 업데이트","패키지 관리","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"es":["package-json-maintenance","agentes de IA","herramientas de IA","mantenimiento de paquetes JavaScript","auditorías de seguridad","actualizaciones de dependencias","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"fr":["package-json-maintenance","outils d''IA","agentes d''IA","maintenance de packages JavaScript","audits de sécurité","mises à jour des dépendances","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"de":["package-json-maintenance","KI-Tools","KI-Agenten","JavaScript-Paket-Wartung","Sicherheitsaudits","Abhängigkeitsupdates","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun"],"pt":["package-json-maintenance","manutenção de pacotes JavaScript","auditorias de segurança","atualizações de dependências","gerenciadores de pacotes","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["package-json-maintenance","поддержка пакетов JavaScript","аудиты безопасности","обновления зависимостей","менеджеры пакетов","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["package-json-maintenance","صيانة حزم JavaScript","عمليات التدقيق الأمنية","تحديث الإعتماديات","مديري الحزم","npm","yarn","pnpm","bun","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"WhatIfWeDigDeeper","repo":"typescript-features-by-version","repoPath":"WhatIfWeDigDeeper/typescript-features-by-version","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.340Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"package-json-maintenance","description":">","version":"0.1","bodyPreview":"# Package.json Maintenance\n\nManages JavaScript package maintenance tasks in an isolated worktree, including security audits and dependency updates. Automatically detects and uses the project''s package manager (npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun).\n\n## Arguments\n\n- **Specific packages**: `jest @types/jest`\n- **All packages**: `.`\n- **Glob patterns**: `@testing-library/* jest*`\n\n## Workflow Selection\n\nBased on user request:\n- **Security audit** (audit, CVE, vulnerabilities, security): Read [references/audit-w","body":"# Package.json Maintenance\n\nManages JavaScript package maintenance tasks in an isolated worktree, including security audits and dependency updates. Automatically detects and uses the project''s package manager (npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun).\n\n## Arguments\n\n- **Specific packages**: `jest @types/jest`\n- **All packages**: `.`\n- **Glob patterns**: `@testing-library/* jest*`\n\n## Workflow Selection\n\nBased on user request:\n- **Security audit** (audit, CVE, vulnerabilities, security): Read [references/audit-workflow.md](references/audit-workflow.md)\n- **Dependency updates** (update, upgrade, latest, modernize): Read [references/update-workflow.md](references/update-workflow.md)\n\n## Shared Process\n\n### 1. Create Isolated Environment\n\n**Preferred: Worktree** (isolated, non-disruptive)\n```bash\nTIMESTAMP=$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)\nBRANCH_NAME=\"pkg-maintenance-$TIMESTAMP\"\nWORKTREE_PATH=\"../$BRANCH_NAME\"\ngit worktree add \"$WORKTREE_PATH\" -b \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\ncd \"$WORKTREE_PATH\"\nUSE_WORKTREE=true\n```\n\n**Fallback: Branch** (if worktree fails due to sandbox directory restrictions)\n\nPrompt user: \"Worktree creation failed (sandbox may restrict creating directories outside the working directory). Run in current directory on a new branch instead? This will stash any uncommitted changes.\"\n\nIf user accepts:\n```bash\ngit stash --include-untracked\ngit checkout -b \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\nUSE_WORKTREE=false\n```\n\n### 2. Detect Package Manager\n\nCheck for lock files to determine the package manager. See [references/package-managers.md](references/package-managers.md) for detection logic and command mappings.\n\n```bash\nif [ -f \"bun.lockb\" ]; then PM=\"bun\"\nelif [ -f \"pnpm-lock.yaml\" ]; then PM=\"pnpm\"\nelif [ -f \"yarn.lock\" ]; then PM=\"yarn\"\nelse PM=\"npm\"\nfi\n```\n\nAlso check `package.json` for `packageManager` field which takes precedence.\n\n### 3. Verify Registry Access\n\nVerify the package manager can reach its registry. See [references/package-managers.md](references/package-managers.md) for manager-specific commands.\n\nIf this fails, prompt user: \"Cannot reach package registry. Sandbox may be blocking network access. To allow package manager commands in sandbox mode, update settings.json.\"\n\nDo not proceed until connectivity is confirmed.\n\n### 4. Discover Package Locations\n\nFind all package.json files excluding node_modules:\n```bash\nfind . -name \"package.json\" -not -path \"*/node_modules/*\" -type f\n```\n\nStore results as an array of directories to process.\n\n### 5. Identify Packages\n\n- Parse `$ARGUMENTS` to determine packages\n- For globs, expand against package.json dependencies\n- For `.`, process all packages\n\n### 6. Validate Changes\n\nCheck `package.json` scripts for available validation commands:\n\n| Purpose | Common names |\n|---------|--------------|\n| Build | `build`, `compile`, `tsc` |\n| Lint | `lint`, `check`, `eslint` |\n| Test | `test`, `jest`, `vitest` |\n\nRun available scripts using `$PM run <script>` in order (build → lint → test), continuing on failure to collect all errors. Skip any that don''t exist.\n\nIf validation fails, revert to previous version before continuing.\n\n### 7. Update Documentation for Major Version Changes\n\nFor major version upgrades (e.g., 18.x to 19.x):\n\n1. Search for version references: `grep -r \"React 18\\|Express 4\" --include=\"*.md\" .`\n2. Update in: `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`, `docs/*.md`\n3. Skip: `specs/*/research.md`, `specs/*/tasks.md`, archived files\n4. Include changes in report/PR description\n\n### 8. Cleanup\n\n**If using worktree:**\n```bash\ncd -\ngit worktree remove \"$WORKTREE_PATH\"\n# Delete branch only if no PR was created\ngit branch -d \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\n```\n\n**If using branch fallback:**\n```bash\ngit checkout -\ngit stash pop\n# Delete branch only if no PR was created\ngit branch -d \"$BRANCH_NAME\"\n```\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- **No package.json**: Error with clear message\n- **Not a git repo**: Error - git required for branch/worktree isolation\n- **Package not found**: Suggest checking package name\n- **Glob matches nothing**: Warn and list available packages\n- **Network restricted**: Package manager commands require internet access; will fail in offline sandbox environments\n- **Unsupported package manager**: If using an unrecognized package manager, prompt user for guidance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:26.336Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Development Agents needing automated package maintenance and security audit capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化包维护和安全审计能力的JavaScript开发代理。","ja":"JavaScript開発エージェントが自動化されたパッケージのメンテナンスとセキュリティ監査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 패키지 유지 보수 및 보안 감사 기능이 필요한 자바스크립트 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de JavaScript que necesitan mantenimiento de paquetes automatizado y capacidades de auditoría de seguridad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement JavaScript nécessitant une maintenance de package automatisée et des capacités d''audit de sécurité.","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Entwicklungsagenten, die automatisierte Paketwartung und Sicherheitsauditfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento JavaScript que precisam de manutenção de pacotes automatizada e capacidades de auditoria de segurança.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки JavaScript, требующих автоматизированного обслуживания пакетов и возможностей аудита безопасности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية جافا سكريبت الذين يحتاجون إلى صيانة حزمة أوتوماتيكية وقدرات تدقيق أمان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate security audits and dependency updates for npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun packages, ensuring project security and integrity by detecting vulnerabilities and using glob patterns for package management.","zh":"赋予代理自动化安全审计和依赖更新的能力，适用于npm、yarn、pnpm或bun包，通过检测漏洞和使用glob模式进行包管理，确保项目安全和完整性。","ja":"エージェントにセキュリティ監査と依存関係の更新を自動化する能力を与え、npm、yarn、pnpm、またはbunパッケージに対応し、脆弱性を検出してglobパターンを使用してパッケージを管理することで、プロジェクトのセキュリティと完全性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 보안 감사 및 종속성 업데이트를 자동화 할 수 있도록 해 주며, npm, yarn, pnpm 또는 bun 패키지에 대한 프로젝트 보안 및完整性를 보장하기 위해 취약점을 감지하고 글로브 패턴을 사용하여 패키지를 관리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar auditorías de seguridad y actualizaciones de dependencias para paquetes npm, yarn, pnpm o bun, garantizando la seguridad y la integridad del proyecto al detectar vulnerabilidades y utilizar patrones glob para la gestión de paquetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les audits de sécurité et les mises à jour des dépendances pour les packages npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun, garantissant la sécurité et l''intégrité du projet en détectant les vulnérabilités et en utilisant des modèles globaux pour la gestion des packages.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Sicherheitsaudits und Abhängigkeitsupdates für npm-, yarn-, pnpm- oder bun-Pakete zu automatisieren, wodurch die Projektsicherheit und -integrität durch die Erkennung von Schwachstellen und die Verwendung von Glob-Mustern für die Paketverwaltung gewährleistet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar auditorias de segurança e atualizações de dependências para pacotes npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun, garantindo a segurança e integridade do projeto, detectando vulnerabilidades e usando padrões globais para gerenciamento de pacotes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать аудит безопасности и обновления зависимостей для пакетов npm, yarn, pnpm или bun, обеспечивая безопасность и целостность проекта, обнаруживая уязвимости и используя глобальные шаблоны для управления пакетами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تلقيم تدقيق أمان وتحديثات الاعتماديات لحزم npm، yarn، pnpm أو bun، ضمان الأمان وسلامة المشروع، وكشف الثغرات واستخدام أنماط الكرة الأرضية لإدارة الحزم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security audits for JavaScript projects","Updating dependencies for npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun packages","Detecting vulnerabilities in specific packages or using glob patterns"],"zh":["自动化JavaScript项目的安全审计","更新npm、yarn、pnpm或bun包的依赖项","在特定包中检测漏洞或使用glob模式"],"ja":["JavaScriptプロジェクトのセキュリティ監査を自動化する","npm、yarn、pnpm、またはbunパッケージの依存関係を更新する","特定のパッケージ内で脆弱性を検出したり、globパターンを使用したりする"],"ko":["자바스크립트 프로젝트의 보안 감사를 자동화하는 것","npm, yarn, pnpm 또는 bun 패키지의 종속성을 업데이트하는 것","특정 패키지에서 취약점을 감지하거나 글로브 패턴을 사용하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de seguridad para proyectos JavaScript","Actualizar dependencias para paquetes npm, yarn, pnpm o bun","Detectar vulnerabilidades en paquetes específicos o utilizando patrones glob"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits de sécurité pour les projets JavaScript","Mettre à jour les dépendances pour les packages npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun","Détecter les vulnérabilités dans des packages spécifiques ou en utilisant des modèles globaux"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheitsaudits für JavaScript-Projekte","Aktualisierung von Abhängigkeiten für npm-, yarn-, pnpm- oder bun-Pakete","Erkennung von Schwachstellen in bestimmten Paketen oder mit Hilfe von Glob-Mustern"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de segurança para projetos JavaScript","Atualizar dependências para pacotes npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun","Detectar vulnerabilidades em pacotes específicos ou usando padrões globais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудит безопасности для проектов JavaScript","Обновлять зависимости для пакетов npm, yarn, pnpm или bun","Обнаруживать уязвимости в конкретных пакетах или используя глобальные шаблоны"],"ar":["تلقيم تدقيق أمان للمشاريع جافا سكريبت","تحديث الاعتماديات لحزم npm، yarn، pnpm أو bun","كشف الثغرات في حزم محددة أو باستخدام أنماط الكرة الأرضية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to package.json file","Limited to JavaScript projects using npm, yarn, pnpm, or bun"],"zh":["需要访问package.json文件","仅限于使用npm、yarn、pnpm或bun的JavaScript项目"],"ja":["package.jsonファイルへのアクセスが必要","npm、yarn、pnpm、またはbunを使用するJavaScriptプロジェクトのみ"],"ko":["package.json 파일에 액세스해야 함","npm, yarn, pnpm 또는 bun을 사용하는 자바스크립트 프로젝트만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo package.json","Limitado a proyectos JavaScript que utilizan npm, yarn, pnpm o bun"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier package.json","Limité aux projets JavaScript utilisant npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei package.json","Begrenzt auf JavaScript-Projekte, die npm, yarn, pnpm oder bun verwenden"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao arquivo package.json","Limitado a projetos JavaScript que usam npm, yarn, pnpm ou bun"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу package.json","Ограничен проектами JavaScript, использующими npm, yarn, pnpm или bun"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف package.json","محدود بمشاريع جافا سكريبت التي تستخدم حزم npm، yarn، pnpm أو bun"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f1c47767776f93bf124c78cc789fd34f3f75cd4e4ee06e8b480c3910ab924356","qualityScore":53}');
