する"],"ko":["CircleTel 고객의 PPPoE/RADIUS 세션을 실시간으로 확인","CDR를 분석하여 연결 상태를 결정","Interstellio Telemetry API를 사용","세션 기록을 자동으로 확인","연결 문제 디버깅 및 문제 해결","세션 패턴 분석"],"es":["Verificación de sesiones PPPoE/RADIUS activas","Análisis de registros de detalles de llamadas (CDR)","Integración con la API de Telemetría de Interstellio","Determinación del estado de conexión en tiempo real","Historial de sesiones para suscriptores","Depuración de problemas de conexión"],"fr":["Vérification des sessions PPPoE/RADIUS actives","Analyse des enregistrements de détails d''appel (CDR)","Intégration avec l''API de télémétrie d''Interstellio","Détermination de l''état de connexion en temps réel","Historique des sessions pour les abonnés","Débogage des problèmes de connexion"],"de":["Überprüfung aktiver PPPoE/RADIUS-Sitzungen","Analyse von Anrufdetailaufzeichnungen (CDR)","Integration mit der Interstellio-Telemetrie-API","Bestimmung des Verbindungsstatus in Echtzeit","Sitzungshistorie für Abonnenten","Fehlerbehebung bei Verbindungsproblemen"],"pt":["Verificação de sessões PPPoE/RADIUS em tempo real","Análise de CDR para determinar o status de conexão","Histórico de sessões para depuração e solução de problemas","Integração com a API de Telemetria Interstellio (NebularStack)","Suporte à depuração de problemas de conexão"],"ru":["Проверка сессий PPPoE/RADIUS в режиме реального времени","Анализ CDR для определения статуса подключения","История сессий для отладки и решения проблем","Интеграция с API телеметрии Interstellio (NebularStack)","Поддержка отладки проблем подключения с помощью ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["التحقق من جلسات PPPoE/RADIUS في الوقت الفعلي","تحليل سجلات التفاصيل الدورية لتحديد حالة الاتصال","سجل جلسات للتصحيح والتحليل","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات التелемيتري Interstellio (NebularStack)","دعم التصحيح الأوتوماتيكي لمشاكل الاتصال باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use Session Checker","Session Checker setup guide","what is Session Checker","Session Checker alternative","Session Checker vs competitors","Interstellio Telemetry API integration","CDR analysis for connection monitoring","CircleTel customer session management","real-time connection status monitoring","PPPoE/RADIUS session troubleshooting"],"zh":["Session Checker","CircleTel","PPPoE/RADIUS","Interstellio Telemetry API","CDR","实时检查","网络连接","AI 工具","会话管理"],"ja":["Session Checker","CircleTel","PPPoE/RADIUS","Interstellio Telemetry API","CDR","リアルタイム確認","ネットワーク接続","AI エージェント","セッション管理"],"ko":["Session Checker","CircleTel","PPPoE/RADIUS","Interstellio Telemetry API","CDR","실시간 확인","네트워크 연결","AI 에이전트","세션 관리"],"es":["Session Checker","agentes de IA","herramientas de IA","verificación de sesiones","PPPoE/RADIUS","API de Telemetría de Interstellio","registros de detalles de llamadas","estado de conexión en tiempo real"],"fr":["Session Checker","outils d''IA","agents d''IA","vérification de sessions","PPPoE/RADIUS","API de télémétrie d''Interstellio","enregistrements de détails d''appel","état de connexion en temps réel"],"de":["Session Checker","KI-Tools","KI-Agenten","Überprüfung von Sitzungen","PPPoE/RADIUS","Interstellio-Telemetrie-API","Anrufdetailaufzeichnungen","Verbindungsstatus in Echtzeit"],"pt":["Session Checker","Verificação de sessões","PPPoE/RADIUS","CDR","Telemetria Interstellio","NebularStack","Depuração de problemas de conexão","Análise de sessões"],"ru":["Session Checker","Проверка сессий","PPPoE/RADIUS","CDR","Телеметрия Interstellio","NebularStack","Отладка проблем подключения","Анализ сессий","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Session Checker","التحقق من جلسات","PPPoE/RADIUS","سجلات التفاصيل الدورية","تелемيتري Interstellio","NebularStack","التصحيح الأوتوماتيكي لمشاكل الاتصال","تحليل جلسات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"jdeweedata","repo":"circletel","repoPath":"jdeweedata/circletel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.352Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Session Checker","description":"Check if Interstellio/NebularStack client sessions are active. Analyzes CDR records to determine connection status, session history, and terminate causes.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Session Checker\n\nA skill for checking if CircleTel customer PPPoE/RADIUS sessions are active using the Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API. Analyzes CDR (Call Detail Records) to determine real-time connection status.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nThis skill automatically activates when you:\n- Need to check if a customer''s internet session is active\n- Want to view session history for a subscriber\n- Debug connection issues or troubleshoot \"not connected\" complaints\n- Analyze session patte","body":"# Session Checker\n\nA skill for checking if CircleTel customer PPPoE/RADIUS sessions are active using the Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API. Analyzes CDR (Call Detail Records) to determine real-time connection status.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nThis skill automatically activates when you:\n- Need to check if a customer''s internet session is active\n- Want to view session history for a subscriber\n- Debug connection issues or troubleshoot \"not connected\" complaints\n- Analyze session patterns and terminate causes\n- Check PPPoE connection status\n\n**Keywords**: session active, session status, connection status, PPPoE session, check session, CDR records, subscriber online, is connected, client session, terminate cause\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Session States\n\n| State | terminate_cause | Meaning |\n|-------|-----------------|---------|\n| **Active** | `null` | Session is currently connected |\n| **Disconnected** | `Lost-Carrier` | Connection lost (modem/router issue) |\n| **User Ended** | `User-Request` | User initiated disconnect |\n| **Idle Timeout** | `Idle-Timeout` | Session timed out due to inactivity |\n| **Session Timeout** | `Session-Timeout` | Max session duration reached |\n| **Admin Disconnect** | `Admin-Reset` | Administratively disconnected |\n| **Port Error** | `Port-Error` | NAS/BNG port issue |\n| **NAS Error** | `NAS-Error` | Network access server error |\n\n### CDR Record Fields\n\n| Field | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `id` | Unique session identifier |\n| `start_time` | When session started (ISO 8601) |\n| `update_time` | Last accounting update |\n| `username` | PPPoE username (e.g., `customer@circletel.co.za`) |\n| `calling_station_id` | Customer''s IP address assigned by BRAS |\n| `called_station_id` | BRAS/BNG IP address |\n| `nas_ip_address` | NAS that authenticated the session |\n| `duration` | Session duration in seconds |\n| `terminate_cause` | Why session ended (null if active) |\n\n## Quick Check Methods\n\n### Method 1: Using the Interstellio Client (Programmatic)\n\n```typescript\nimport { getInterstellioClient } from ''@/lib/interstellio''\n\n// Set token first (get from Interstellio dashboard or auth)\nconst client = getInterstellioClient()\nclient.setToken(process.env.INTERSTELLIO_API_TOKEN!, ''circletel.co.za'')\n\n// Quick check - just returns true/false\nconst isActive = await client.isSessionActive(''subscriber-uuid-here'')\nconsole.log(''Session active:'', isActive)\n\n// Detailed analysis\nconst analysis = await client.analyzeSessionStatus(''subscriber-uuid-here'')\nconsole.log(''Analysis:'', {\n  isActive: analysis.isActive,\n  lastSession: analysis.lastSession?.username,\n  sessionsToday: analysis.totalSessionsToday,\n  terminateCauses: analysis.terminateCauses\n})\n\n// Get raw CDR records for custom analysis\nconst records = await client.getCDRRecords(''subscriber-uuid'', {\n  start_time: ''2025-12-19T00:00:00+02:00'',\n  end_time: ''2025-12-19T23:59:59+02:00''\n})\n```\n\n### Method 2: Using PowerShell (Quick CLI Check)\n\n```powershell\n# Run the session checker script\npowershell -File .claude/skills/session-checker/check-session.ps1 -SubscriberId \"23ffee86-dbe9-11f0-9102-61ef2f83e8d9\"\n```\n\n### Method 3: Direct API Call (cURL/PowerShell)\n\n```powershell\n$headers = @{\n    \"X-Auth-Token\" = $env:INTERSTELLIO_API_TOKEN\n    \"X-Tenant-ID\" = \"circletel.co.za\"\n    \"X-Domain\" = \"circletel.co.za\"\n    \"X-Timezone\" = \"Africa/Johannesburg\"\n    \"Content-Type\" = \"application/json\"\n}\n\n$body = @{\n    start_time = (Get-Date).Date.ToString(\"yyyy-MM-ddT00:00:00+02:00\")\n    end_time = (Get-Date).ToString(\"yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss+02:00\")\n} | ConvertTo-Json\n\n$response = Invoke-RestMethod `\n    -Uri \"https://telemetry-za.nebularstack.com/v1/subscriber/{subscriber_id}/cdr/records\" `\n    -Method POST `\n    -Headers $headers `\n    -Body $body\n\n# Check if session is active\nif ($response.terminate_cause -eq $null) {\n    Write-Host \"Session is ACTIVE\" -ForegroundColor Green\n    Write-Host \"Username: $($response.username)\"\n    Write-Host \"Connected since: $($response.start_time)\"\n    Write-Host \"Duration: $([math]::Round($response.duration / 60, 1)) minutes\"\n} else {\n    Write-Host \"Session is DISCONNECTED\" -ForegroundColor Red\n    Write-Host \"Last terminate cause: $($response.terminate_cause)\"\n}\n```\n\n## Finding Subscriber IDs\n\n### From Supabase (CircleTel Database)\n\n```sql\n-- Find subscriber by customer email\nSELECT\n    cs.interstellio_subscriber_id,\n    cs.radius_username,\n    c.email,\n    c.first_name,\n    c.last_name\nFROM customer_services cs\nJOIN customers c ON cs.customer_id = c.id\nWHERE c.email = ''customer@example.com'';\n\n-- Find subscriber by account number\nSELECT\n    cs.interstellio_subscriber_id,\n    cs.radius_username,\n    cs.status\nFROM customer_services cs\nJOIN customers c ON cs.customer_id = c.id\nWHERE c.account_number = ''CT-2025-00001'';\n```\n\n### From Interstellio API\n\n```typescript\n// Search by username\nconst subscribers = await client.listSubscribers({\n  username: ''customer@circletel.co.za''\n})\nconst subscriberId = subscribers.payload[0]?.id\n```\n\n## Common Troubleshooting Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: Customer Reports \"No Internet\"\n\n1. **Check session status**:\n   ```typescript\n   const analysis = await client.analyzeSessionStatus(subscriberId)\n   ```\n\n2. **Interpret results**:\n   - `isActive: true` → Session is up, issue is elsewhere (DNS, routing, etc.)\n   - `isActive: false` with `Lost-Carrier` → Customer''s router lost connection\n   - `isActive: false` with `Session-Timeout` → Session expired, needs reconnect\n\n3. **Check session history** for patterns:\n   ```typescript\n   // Multiple Lost-Carrier in short time = unstable line\n   if (analysis.terminateCauses[''Lost-Carrier''] > 5) {\n     console.log(''Line appears unstable - recommend technician check'')\n   }\n   ```\n\n### Scenario 2: Checking Before Service Activation\n\n```typescript\n// Ensure no orphaned sessions before provisioning\nconst existingSessions = await client.listSessions(subscriberId)\nif (existingSessions.payload.length > 0) {\n  // Disconnect existing sessions first\n  await client.disconnectAllSessions(subscriberId)\n}\n```\n\n### Scenario 3: Usage Monitoring Dashboard\n\n```typescript\n// Get today''s session stats for dashboard\nconst analysis = await client.analyzeSessionStatus(subscriberId)\n\nconst dashboardData = {\n  connectionStatus: analysis.isActive ? ''Online'' : ''Offline'',\n  currentSessionDuration: analysis.lastSession?.duration || 0,\n  reconnectsToday: analysis.terminateCauses[''Lost-Carrier''] || 0,\n  totalOnlineTime: analysis.totalDurationSeconds\n}\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\n### Endpoint\n\n```\nPOST https://telemetry-za.nebularstack.com/v1/subscriber/{subscriber_id}/cdr/records\n```\n\n### Required Headers\n\n| Header | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| `X-Auth-Token` | JWT from Interstellio identity service |\n| `X-Tenant-ID` | `circletel.co.za` |\n| `X-Domain` | `circletel.co.za` |\n| `X-Timezone` | `Africa/Johannesburg` |\n| `Content-Type` | `application/json` |\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  \"start_time\": \"2025-12-19T00:00:00+02:00\",\n  \"end_time\": \"2025-12-19T23:59:59+02:00\"\n}\n```\n\n**Note**: Maximum query window is 32 days.\n\n### Response Example\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"4d81f126-dcd1-11f0-9e13-a59eec990c99::2025-12-01\",\n  \"start_time\": \"2025-12-19T13:53:15.000+02:00\",\n  \"update_time\": \"2025-12-19T14:20:50.132+02:00\",\n  \"acct_unique_id\": \"4d81f126-dcd1-11f0-9e13-a59eec990c99\",\n  \"username\": \"customer@circletel.co.za\",\n  \"calling_station_id\": \"100.125.57.136\",\n  \"called_station_id\": \"100.127.1.229\",\n  \"nas_ip_address\": \"41.198.130.3\",\n  \"client_ip_address\": \"13.247.40.35\",\n  \"duration\": 1655,\n  \"terminate_cause\": \"Lost-Carrier\"\n}\n```\n\n## Environment Variables Required\n\n```env\nINTERSTELLIO_API_TOKEN=your_jwt_token_here\nINTERSTELLIO_TENANT_ID=circletel.co.za\nINTERSTELLIO_DOMAIN=circletel.co.za\n```\n\n## Related Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `lib/interstellio/client.ts` | Interstellio API client |\n| `lib/interstellio/types.ts` | TypeScript types including CDR records |\n| `docs/api/INTERSTELLIO_API.md` | Full API documentation |\n| `.claude/skills/session-checker/check-session.ps1` | PowerShell quick-check script |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always check session status before disconnecting** - Don''t blindly disconnect active sessions\n2. **Use timezone-aware dates** - Always include `+02:00` for South Africa\n3. **Handle empty results** - API may return empty if no sessions in time window\n4. **Cache tokens** - Interstellio tokens are valid for 12 months\n5. **Monitor terminate causes** - High `Lost-Carrier` counts indicate line issues\n\n---\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Last Updated**: 2025-12-20\n**Maintained By**: CircleTel Development Team\n**API Source**: https://docs.interstellio.io/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:55.327Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Network Analysis Agents requiring real-time connection status monitoring via the Interstellio Telemetry API.","zh":"适用于需要通过Interstellio Telemetry API实时监控连接状态的网络分析代理。","ja":"Interstellio Telemetry APIを介してリアルタイムに接続状態を監視する必要があるネットワーク分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"Interstellio Telemetry API를 통해 실시간으로 연결 상태를 모니터링해야 하는 네트워크 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Red que requieren monitoreo de estado de conexión en tiempo real a través de la API de Telemetría Interstellio.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse de réseau nécessitant un suivi de l''état de connexion en temps réel via l''API de télémétrie Interstellio.","de":"Ideal für Netzwerkanalyse-Agents, die eine Echtzeit-Verbindungszustandsüberwachung über die Interstellio-Telemetrie-API erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Rede que exigem monitoramento de status de conexão em tempo real via a API de Telemetria Interstellio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа сети, требующих мониторинга статуса подключения в режиме реального времени через API телеметрии Interstellio.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الشبكة التي تتطلب مراقبة حالة الاتصال في الوقت الحقيقي عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تелеметري Interstellio."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze CDRs for real-time connection status, leveraging PPPoE/RADIUS sessions and the Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API for enhanced debugging and troubleshooting capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理分析CDRs以监测实时连接状态的能力，利用PPPoE/RADIUS会话和Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API增强调试和故障排除能力。","ja":"PPPoE/RADIUSセッションとInterstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry APIを利用して、リアルタイムの接続状態の分析が可能になり、デバッグとトラブルシューティング能力が強化されます。","ko":"PPPoE/RADIUS 세션과 Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API를 활용하여 실시간 연결 상태를 분석할 수 있으며, 디버깅 및 문제 해결 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar CDR para el estado de conexión en tiempo real, aprovechando sesiones PPPoE/RADIUS y la API de Telemetría Interstellio (NebularStack) para capacidades de depuración y solución de problemas mejoradas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les CDR pour l''état de connexion en temps réel, en exploitant les sessions PPPoE/RADIUS et l''API de télémétrie Interstellio (NebularStack) pour des capacités de débogage et de dépannage améliorées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, CDR für den Verbindungszustand in Echtzeit zu analysieren, indem PPPoE/RADIUS-Sitzungen und die Interstellio-Telemetrie-API (NebularStack) für verbesserte Debug- und Troubleshooting-Funktionen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar CDRs para status de conexão em tempo real, aproveitando sessões PPPoE/RADIUS e a API de Telemetria Interstellio (NebularStack) para capacidades de depuração e solução de problemas aprimoradas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность анализировать CDR для статуса подключения в режиме реального времени, используя сессии PPPoE/RADIUS и API телеметрии Interstellio (NebularStack) для расширенных возможностей отладки и устранения неполадок.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحليل سجلات بيانات الاستدعاء للتحقق من حالة الاتصال في الوقت الحقيقي، واستخدام جلسات بروتوكول بروتوكول نقطة إلى نقطة عبر الإيثرنت/نظام التحكم في الوصول عن بعد وواجهة برمجة تطبيقات تелемيتري Interstellio (NebularStack) لتحسين قدرات التصحيح والأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating internet session status checks for CircleTel customers","Debugging connection issues using session history and CDR analysis","Troubleshooting ''not connected'' complaints with real-time session data"],"zh":["为CircleTel客户自动执行互联网会话状态检查","使用会话历史记录和CDR分析进行连接问题调试","使用实时会话数据排除''未连接''投诉"],"ja":["CircleTel顧客のインターネットセッション状態の自動チェック","セッション履歴とCDR分析を使用した接続問題のデバッグ","リアルタイムセッションデータを使用した''未接続''の苦情のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["CircleTel 고객을 위한 인터넷 세션 상태 자동 체크","세션 기록 및 CDR 분석을 통한 연결 이슈 디버깅","실시간 세션 데이터를 통한 ''연결 안됨'' 고객 민원 해결"],"es":["Automatizar comprobaciones de estado de sesión de internet para clientes de CircleTel","Depurar problemas de conexión utilizando el historial de sesiones y el análisis de CDR","Solucionar quejas de ''no conectados'' con datos de sesión en tiempo real"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de statut de session Internet pour les clients CircleTel","Déboguer les problèmes de connexion en utilisant l''historique de session et l''analyse de CDR","Résoudre les plaintes de ''non connectés'' avec des données de session en temps réel"],"de":["Automatisierung von Internet-Sitzungsstatus-Prüfungen für CircleTel-Kunden","Fehlerbehebung bei Verbindungsproblemen unter Verwendung von Sitzungshistorie und CDR-Analyse","Behebung von ''nicht verbunden''-Beschwerden mit Echtzeit-Sitzungsdaten"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de status de sessão de internet para clientes da CircleTel","Depurar problemas de conexão usando histórico de sessão e análise de CDR","Solucionar reclamações de ''não conectado'' com dados de sessão em tempo real"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки статуса интернет-сессии для клиентов CircleTel","Отладка проблем подключения с помощью истории сессии и анализа CDR","Устранение жалоб на ''не подключено'' с данными сессии в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["أتمتة التحقق من حالة جلسة الإنترنت للعملاء CircleTel","تصحيح الأخطاء في مشاكل الاتصال باستخدام تاريخ الجلسة وتحليل سجل بيانات الاتصال","حل شكاوي ''غير متصل'' مع بيانات الجلسة في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API","Specific to CircleTel customer PPPoE/RADIUS sessions","Dependent on CDR data for analysis"],"zh":["需要访问Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API","仅适用于CircleTel客户的PPPoE/RADIUS会话","依赖于CDR数据进行分析"],"ja":["Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry APIへのアクセスが必要","CircleTel顧客のPPPoE/RADIUSセッションのみに対応","分析にはCDRデータに依存"],"ko":["Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API에 접근해야 함","CircleTel 고객의 PPPoE/RADIUS 세션만 해당","분석을 위해 CDR 데이터에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de Telemetría Interstellio (NebularStack)","Específico para sesiones PPPoE/RADIUS de clientes de CircleTel","Dependiente de datos CDR para el análisis"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API de télémétrie Interstellio (NebularStack)","Spécifique aux sessions PPPoE/RADIUS des clients CircleTel","Dépendant des données CDR pour l''analyse"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Interstellio-Telemetrie-API (NebularStack)","Spezifisch für PPPoE/RADIUS-Sitzungen von CircleTel-Kunden","Abhängig von CDR-Daten für die Analyse"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API de Telemetria Interstellio (NebularStack)","Específico para sessões PPPoE/RADIUS de clientes da CircleTel","Dependente de dados de CDR para análise"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API телеметрии Interstellio (NebularStack)","Специфичен для сессий PPPoE/RADIUS клиентов CircleTel","Зависит от данных CDR для анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تелемيتري Interstellio (NebularStack)","محدد للجلسات بروتوكول بروتوكول نقطة إلى نقطة عبر الإيثرنت/نظام التحكم في الوصول عن بعد لعملاء CircleTel","يعتمد على بيانات سجل بيانات الاتصال للتحليل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"06f431cd69e57eef1eedffc883f7e6b1fe150a3430be948b792097b3fd18ed0e","qualityScore":53}');
