INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jdeweedata/circletel/Session Checker', 'Session Checker', 'jdeweedata', 'circletel', 'community', 'Session Checker jdeweedata circletel community The Session Checker skill analyzes CDRs to determine real-time connection status for CircleTel customers, benefiting developers and support teams. It automatically activates to check internet sessions, view session history, and debug connection issues. Session Checker 是一个用于检查 CircleTel 客户 PPPoE/RADIUS 会话是否活跃的技能，通过分析 CDR 实时确定连接状态 Session Checker は、CircleTel の PPPoE/RADIUS セッションがアクティブであるかどうかを確認するスキルで、CDR を分析してリアルタイムで接続状態を決定します Session Checker는 CircleTel 고객의 PPPoE/RADIUS 세션이 활성화되었는지 확인하는 기능으로, CDR를 분석하여 실시간으로 연결 상태를 결정합니다 Session Checker es una habilidad para verificar sesiones PPPoE/RADIUS activas utilizando la API de Telemetría de Interstellio. Analiza registros de detalles de llamadas para determinar el estado de conexión en tiempo real. Session Checker est une compétence pour vérifier les sessions PPPoE/RADIUS actives en utilisant l''API de télémétrie d''Interstellio. Elle analyse les enregistrements de détails d''appel pour déterminer l''état de connexion en temps réel. Session Checker ist eine Fähigkeit, um aktive PPPoE/RADIUS-Sitzungen mit der Interstellio-Telemetrie-API zu überprüfen. Sie analysiert Anrufdetailaufzeichnungen, um den Verbindungsstatus in Echtzeit zu bestimmen. O Session Checker é uma habilidade que verifica se as sessões PPPoE/RADIUS dos clientes estão ativas, analisando CDR em tempo real. Session Checker — это навык, который проверяет активные сессии PPPoE/RADIUS клиентов, анализируя CDR в режиме реального времени с помощью ИИ Агентов. Session Checker هو مهارة تقوم بالتحقق من حالة جلسات PPPoE/RADIUS للعملاء، وتحليل سجلات التفاصيل الدورية في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي. how to use Session Checker Session Checker setup guide what is Session Checker Session Checker alternative Session Checker vs competitors Interstellio Telemetry API integration CDR analysis for connection monitoring CircleTel customer session management real-time connection status monitoring PPPoE/RADIUS session troubleshooting Session Checker CircleTel PPPoE/RADIUS Interstellio Telemetry API CDR 实时检查 网络连接 AI 工具 会话管理 Analyzes CDRs to determine real-time connection status Uses Interstellio (NebularStack) Telemetry API for session monitoring Automatically activates to check internet sessions and view session history Supports debugging connection issues and troubleshooting ''not connected'' complaints Provides real-time connection status for CircleTel customers Enables session pattern analysis for optimized support Session Checker is a skill that checks if CircleTel customer PPPoE/RADIUS sessions are active using the Interstellio Telemetry API, analyzing CDRs for real-time connection status.');
