バッグ"],"ko":["Refresh Context","플레이스테이션 메모리 카드 이미지 관리자","AI 기술","아키텍처 컨텍스트","新的 세션","여러 컴포넌트의 수정","新的 기능의 구현","UI 디버깅","ViewModel 디버깅","Domain 디버깅"],"es":["refresh-context","PSX Memory Card Manager","administración de memoria","carga de contexto","arquitectura de proyecto","Herramientas de desarrollo","Agentes de inteligencia artificial","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["refresh-context","PSX Memory Card Manager","gestion de mémoire","chargement de contexte","architecture de projet","Outils de développement","Agents d''intelligence artificielle","Outils d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["refresh-context","PSX-Speicherkarten-Manager","Speicherverwaltung","Kontextladen","Projektarchitektur","Entwicklungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["Refresh Context","gerenciador de imagens de cartão de memória do PSX","arquitetura de projeto","depuração de problemas","implementação de novas funcionalidades","PSX Memory Card Manager","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Refresh Context","менеджер изображений карты памяти PSX","архитектура проекта","отладка проблем","реализация новых функций","PSX Memory Card Manager","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Refresh Context","مدير صور بطاقة الذاكرة PSX","هندسة المشروع","تصحيح الأخطاء","تنفيذ ميزات جديدة","PSX Memory Card Manager","أدوات تطوير"]}},"owner":"yveskaufmann","repo":"go-psx-memcard","repoPath":"yveskaufmann/go-psx-memcard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.359Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"refresh-context","description":"Reads and loads architectural context files (architecture.md and architecture.puml) to understand the PSX Memory Card Manager project structure, components, and design patterns. Use when starting a new session or when architectural context is needed for code changes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Refresh Context Skill\n\nThis skill loads the architectural context for the PSX Memory Card Manager project by reading key documentation files.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- At the start of a new session to understand project architecture\n- When making changes that affect multiple components\n- When architectural context is needed for implementing new features\n- When debugging issues that span multiple layers (UI, ViewModel, Domain)\n\n## What this skill does\n\nReads and provides context from:\n1. `a","body":"# Refresh Context Skill\n\nThis skill loads the architectural context for the PSX Memory Card Manager project by reading key documentation files.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- At the start of a new session to understand project architecture\n- When making changes that affect multiple components\n- When architectural context is needed for implementing new features\n- When debugging issues that span multiple layers (UI, ViewModel, Domain)\n\n## What this skill does\n\nReads and provides context from:\n1. `architecture.md` - Detailed component structure, MVVM patterns, and responsibilities\n2. `architecture.puml` - Visual C4 model diagrams showing system boundaries and data flow\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Read architecture documentation\nLoad the main architecture documentation to understand:\n- MVVM pattern implementation\n- Component responsibilities and boundaries\n- Dependency injection structure\n- Layer separation (UI, ViewModel, Domain)\n\n```bash\n# Read the architecture documentation\nread_file(''architecture.md'', 1, 300)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Load visual architecture model\nRead the PlantUML C4 model to understand:\n- System container boundaries  \n- Component relationships and data flow\n- Dependency directions between layers\n\n```bash\n# Read the PlantUML C4 model\nread_file(''architecture.puml'', 1, 100)  \n```\n\n## Key architectural concepts to remember\n\nAfter reading the files, keep these principles in mind:\n\n- **MVVM Pattern**: Views render UI, ViewModels manage state, Domain handles business logic\n- **Dependency Injection**: Use uber/dig container in `internal/dig/container.go`\n- **Layer Separation**: UI (`internal/ui/`) ↔ ViewModel ↔ Domain (`internal/memcard/`)\n- **Data Binding**: ViewModels use bindings/events, never manipulate widgets directly\n\n## Expected outcome\n\nAfter running this skill, you should have context about:\n- Main application components (ManagerWindowView, BlocksContainer, etc.)\n- Memory card domain concepts (MemoryCard, Block, Icon)\n- How data flows between UI and business logic\n- Project structure and file organization\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:10.497Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring project architecture insights, such as those built with LangChain or AutoGPT, to efficiently manage PSX Memory Card Manager projects.","zh":"适合需要项目架构洞察的代码分析代理，例如使用 LangChain 或 AutoGPT 构建的代理，能够高效地管理 PSX Memory Card Manager 项目。","ja":"LangChain または AutoGPT で構築されたような、プロジェクト アーキテクチャの洞察が必要なコード分析エージェントに適しています。PSX Memory Card Manager プロジェクトを効率的に管理できます。","ko":"LangChain 또는 AutoGPT로 구축된 것과 같은 프로젝트 아키텍처 정보가 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다. PSX Memory Card Manager 프로젝트를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Código que requieren conocimientos de la arquitectura del proyecto, como aquellos construidos con LangChain o AutoGPT, para gestionar de manera eficiente los proyectos de PSX Memory Card Manager.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant des connaissances en matière d''architecture de projet, tels que ceux construits avec LangChain ou AutoGPT, pour gérer efficacement les projets de PSX Memory Card Manager.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agents, die Projektarchitektur-Einblicke benötigen, wie z.B. solche, die mit LangChain oder AutoGPT erstellt wurden, um PSX Memory Card Manager-Projekte effizient zu verwalten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que exigem insights de arquitetura de projeto, como aqueles construídos com LangChain ou AutoGPT, para gerenciar projetos de PSX Memory Card Manager de forma eficiente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих информации о проектной архитектуре, таких как те, которые построены с помощью LangChain или AutoGPT, для эффективного управления проектами PSX Memory Card Manager.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى رؤى هيكل المشروع، مثل تلك المبنية باستخدام LangChain أو AutoGPT، لإدارة مشاريع إدارة بطاقات الذاكرة PSX بشكل فعال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load architectural context by reading key documentation files, providing crucial project architecture understanding through PSX Memory Card Manager''s specific file formats and structures, and facilitating informed decision-making for features implementation and debugging.","zh":"赋予代理读取关键文档文件以加载架构上下文的能力，通过 PSX Memory Card Manager 的特定文件格式和结构提供关键的项目架构理解，并促进功能实现和调试的明智决策。","ja":"エージェントが重要なドキュメント ファイルを読み取ってアーキテクチャ コンテキストをロードする能力を付与します。PSX Memory Card Manager の特定のファイル形式と構造を通じて、プロジェクト アーキテクチャの重要な理解を提供し、機能の実装とデバッグの情報に基づいた意思決定を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 주요 문서 파일을 읽어 아키텍처 컨텍스트를 로드할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 PSX Memory Card Manager의 특정 파일 형식 및 구조를 통해 프로젝트 아키텍처에 대한 중요한 이해를 제공하고 기능 구현 및 디버깅에 대한 정보에 기반한 의사 결정에 기여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes cargar el contexto arquitectónico leyendo archivos de documentación clave, proporcionando una comprensión crucial de la arquitectura del proyecto a través de formatos y estructuras de archivos específicos de PSX Memory Card Manager, y facilitando la toma de decisiones informadas para la implementación de características y la depuración.","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger le contexte architectural en lisant les fichiers de documentation clés, fournissant une compréhension cruciale de l''architecture du projet à travers les formats et les structures de fichiers spécifiques de PSX Memory Card Manager, et facilitant la prise de décisions éclairées pour la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités et le débogage.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, den architektonischen Kontext durch das Lesen von Schlüsseldokumentationsdateien zu laden, eine entscheidende Projektarchitekturverständnis durch spezifische Dateiformate und -strukturen von PSX Memory Card Manager bereitzustellen und eine fundierte Entscheidungsfindung für die Implementierung von Funktionen und das Debuggen zu erleichtern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a carregar o contexto arquitetônico lendo arquivos de documentação-chave, fornecendo compreensão crucial da arquitetura do projeto por meio de formatos e estruturas de arquivos específicos do PSX Memory Card Manager e facilitando a tomada de decisões informadas para implementação de recursos e depuração.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью загружать архитектурный контекст, читая ключевые документационные файлы, предоставляя важное понимание архитектуры проекта через конкретные форматы и структуры файлов PSX Memory Card Manager и облегчая принятие обоснованных решений по реализации функций и отладке.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية تحميل السياق الهندسي من خلال قراءة ملفات الوثائق الرئيسية، وتوفير فهم حاسم لهيكل المشروع من خلال صيغ وتركيبات ملفات إدارة بطاقات الذاكرة PSX الخاصة، وتسهيل اتخاذ القرارات المطلعة لتنفيذ الميزات وتصحيح الأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing project context at the start of new sessions","Informing multi-component changes with up-to-date architectural knowledge","Debugging cross-layer issues spanning UI, ViewModel, and Domain layers"],"zh":["在新会话开始时初始化项目上下文","使用最新的架构知识来告知多组件更改","跨 UI、ViewModel 和 Domain 层的调试跨层问题"],"ja":["新しいセッションの開始時にプロジェクト コンテキストを初期化する","最新のアーキテクチャの知識を使用してマルチコンポーネントの変更を通知する","UI、ViewModel、Domain 層に跨るクロスレイヤーの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["새 세션 시작 시 프로젝트 컨텍스트 초기화","최신 아키텍처 지식을 사용하여 다중 컴포넌트 변경 알림","UI, ViewModel 및 Domain 레이어에 걸친 크로스 레이어 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Inicializar el contexto del proyecto al comienzo de nuevas sesiones","Informar cambios de varios componentes con conocimientos arquitectónicos actualizados","Depurar problemas entre capas que abarcan UI, ViewModel y Domain"],"fr":["Initialiser le contexte du projet au début de nouvelles sessions","Informer les modifications multi-composants avec des connaissances architecturales à jour","Déboguer les problèmes entre les couches qui couvrent l''UI, le ViewModel et les couches de domaine"],"de":["Initialisieren des Projekt-Kontexts am Beginn neuer Sitzungen","Informieren von Änderungen an mehreren Komponenten mit aktuellen architektonischen Kenntnissen","Debuggen von Problemen zwischen Schichten, die UI, ViewModel und Domain-Schichten umfassen"],"pt":["Inicializar o contexto do projeto no início de novas sessões","Informar alterações multi-componentes com conhecimento arquitetônico atualizado","Depurar problemas transversais que abrangem camadas UI, ViewModel e Domain"],"ru":["Инициализировать контекст проекта в начале новых сессий","Информировать многокомпонентные изменения с актуальными знаниями об архитектуре","Отлаживать межслоевые проблемы, охватывающие слои UI, ViewModel и Domain"],"ar":["ت 초기化 سياق المشروع في بداية الجلسات الجديدة","إعلام التغييرات متعددة المكونات مع المعرفة الهندسية المحدثة","تصحيح الأخطاء العابرة التي تشمل طبقات واجهة المستخدم والنموذج والمنطقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specific PSX Memory Card Manager project documentation files","Limited to PSX Memory Card Manager projects"],"zh":["需要访问特定的 PSX Memory Card Manager 项目文档文件","仅限 PSX Memory Card Manager 项目"],"ja":["特定の PSX Memory Card Manager プロジェクト ドキュメント ファイルへのアクセスが必要","PSX Memory Card Manager プロジェクトのみ"],"ko":["특정 PSX Memory Card Manager 프로젝트 문서 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","PSX Memory Card Manager 프로젝트만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de documentación de proyectos de PSX Memory Card Manager específicos","Limitado a proyectos de PSX Memory Card Manager"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des fichiers de documentation de projets spécifiques de PSX Memory Card Manager","Limité aux projets de PSX Memory Card Manager"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf bestimmte PSX Memory Card Manager-Projekt-Dokumentationsdateien","Begrenzt auf PSX Memory Card Manager-Projekte"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de d